intlab.ch + SAN sur le certificat\n\nBascule du domaine interne de stock.entreprise.local vers\nstock.gvaprintlab.ch :\n- host de l''Ingress Traefik (k8s/ingress.yaml, règle de routage + SNI TLS) ;\n- generate_certs.sh : nouveau domaine et ajout d''un subjectAltName\n  (les navigateurs récents refusent un certificat sans SAN, même\n  auto-signé) ;\n- mise à jour des références dans K8S_GUIDE.md et USER_GUIDE.md.\n\nLes références restantes (plan_action_gestion_stock.md, nginx/nginx.conf\nde l''ancien Docker Compose) ne sont pas fonctionnelles en k8s.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48ae5fbc863d1c8ae0a41297c16f037b70690122","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/th0to/inventory_app/git/trees/48ae5fbc863d1c8ae0a41297c16f037b70690122"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/th0to/inventory_app/git/commits/01faf93b6148e8807fed2af4bf42dc58548c8ecc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82789984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/th0to","id":82789984,"login":"th0to","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNzg5OTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/th0to/inventory_app/commit/01faf93b6148e8807fed2af4bf42dc585