omarinier@gmail.com","name":"Thomas Marinier"},"message":"docs: deploiement Kubernetes manuel (Debian 13), abandon Terraform/Compose\n\nLe provisionnement Terraform est abandonne (VM Proxmox + k3s installes a la\nmain) et Kubernetes devient la methode de deploiement de reference.\n\n- README : section deploiement -> renvoi vers K8S_GUIDE.md, VM Debian 13,\n  stack/archi alignees (Traefik/k3s), import CSV et backups via kubectl\n- K8S_GUIDE : section \"Prerequis VM et installation de k3s\" (Debian 13 via\n  ISO, 4 vCPU/8 Go/60-80 Go, SSH, curl get.k3s.io, kubeconfig)\n- ADMIN_GUIDE : commandes docker compose -> kubectl (creation compte de\n  secours, logs Postgres/backend/Traefik)\n- plan_action : VM cible Debian 13 (Trixie)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"72d31824ed300814e609fa58ab19e0a99a17e64b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/th0to/inventory_app/git/trees/72d31824ed300814e609fa58ab19e0a99a17e64b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/th0to/inventory_app/git/commits/086dbc1462d3b6fcda90ce98d65878de6c4a37dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82789984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/th0to","id":82789984,"login":"th0to","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNzg5OTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/subscriptions