th0to/inventory_app/commits/91e94613c70a77a67cdd61c7752e57927054f0b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T12:23:27Z","email":"thomarinier@gmail.com","name":"Thomas Marinier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T12:23:27Z","email":"thomarinier@gmail.com","name":"Thomas Marinier"},"message":"Ajoute les manifestes Kubernetes (dossier k8s/)\n\nMigration Docker Compose -> k3s mono-noeud :\n- namespace, configmap (DB_HOST=postgres-service, DB_PORT/NAME, JWT_EXPIRE_HOURS)\n- secrets.example.yaml : gabarit non applique (vrai Secret cree via kubectl)\n- postgres.yaml : Service headless postgres-service + StatefulSet + PVC 10Gi,\n  credentials depuis le Secret, probes pg_isready\n- backend.yaml : Deployment (envFrom configmap+secret) + probes /health\n  (startup/readiness/liveness) + Service ClusterIP + resources\n- frontend.yaml : Deployment nginx + Service ClusterIP + resources\n- ingress.yaml : Traefik + TLS (Secret inventory-tls), /api->backend, /->frontend\n- kustomization.yaml : kubectl apply -k k8s/\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ffd220f4ab3505057b32f83e5ebe281e7a09a88e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/th0to/inventory_app/git/trees/ffd220f4ab3505057b32f83e5ebe281e7a09a88e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/th0to/inventory_app/git/commits/91e94613c70a77a67cdd61c7752e57927054f0b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82789984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/th0to","id":82789984,"login":"th0to","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNzg5OTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/