hub.com/users/th0to/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/th0to/inventory_app/commits/5a934f4eb0c2263a87efbe7d7c30c5614cd80098/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T11:45:59Z","email":"thomarinier@gmail.com","name":"Thomas Marinier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T11:45:59Z","email":"thomarinier@gmail.com","name":"Thomas Marinier"},"message":"feat(backend): gestion des comptes utilisateurs par l''admin (API)\n\nNouveau routeur users.py (require_admin) : liste, creation, modification\n(role / is_active / reset mot de passe) et desactivation logique.\n\n- DELETE = desactivation (is_active=False) plutot que suppression dure :\n  les FK devices.owner_id/created_by/updated_by et device_history.user_id\n  (sans ON DELETE) feraient echouer une suppression pour tout utilisateur\n  reference. Reactivation via PUT is_active=true.\n- Garde-fous : un admin ne peut pas se desactiver, se retrograder ni se\n  supprimer lui-meme.\n- 7 tests (TestClient + SQLite) : creation, liste, doublon 409, update,\n  desactivation/reactivation, refus auto-suppression/desactivation, 404.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d4e2e64326a76214549946e009e9fea2a7d80481","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/th0to/inventory_app/git/trees/d4e2e64326a76214549946e009e9fea2a7d80481"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/th0to/inventory_app/git/commits/5a934f4eb0c2263a87efbe7d7c30c5614cd80098","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82789984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/use