order_number (donnee jusque-la perdue)\n- Detection d''entite explicite + warnings (CDS ambigu -> GVA)\n- Validation numerique stricte (regex) avec log des rejets\n- Option --dry-run, argument csv_path fonctionnel, encodage utf-8-sig\n- Rapport de fin structure (importes/maj/skippes/erreurs/warnings)\n- Tests pytest (SQLite) + requirements-dev.txt\n\nPhase A (nettoyage donnees):\n- seed.py: 5eme aligne sur le CSV (supprime le doublon de Location)\n- Double-owner \"NomA - NomB\": owner=NomA, co-owner en commentaire grep-able\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"03cc179e3fa41ba93ecbaf475e3cb2d844d63885","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/th0to/inventory_app/git/trees/03cc179e3fa41ba93ecbaf475e3cb2d844d63885"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/th0to/inventory_app/git/commits/90f06355900dbfacc46fb64a1caafb54cfbad79c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82789984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/th0to","id":82789984,"login":"th0to","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNzg5OTg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/th0to","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/th0to/inventory_app/commit/90f06355900dbfacc46fb64a1caafb54cfbad79c","node_id":"C_kwDOS