ml_url":"https://github.com/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commit/0d441524c6a90b32a5ef3c51b1496200f1d41cfb","sha":"0d441524c6a90b32a5ef3c51b1496200f1d41cfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commits/0d441524c6a90b32a5ef3c51b1496200f1d41cfb"}],"sha":"2e37c9e289af2d388480c19ba568129918aa76e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commits/2e37c9e289af2d388480c19ba568129918aa76e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/184391486?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikash-barnwal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikash-barnwal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikash-barnwal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikash-barnwal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bikash-barnwal","id":184391486,"login":"bikash-barnwal","node_id":"U_kgDOCv2XPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikash-barnwal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikash-barnwal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikash-barnwal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikash-barnwal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikash-barnwal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bikash-barnwal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commits/0d441524c6a90b32a5ef3c51b1496200f1d41cfb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T05:20:48Z","email":"bikashprasadbarnwal@gmail.com","name":"Bikash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T05:20:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(security): log unexpected errors in the superset user resolver (#809)\n\n_session_user() swallowed any exception and returned None, which looks\nexactly like \"this user has no tenant role\". It still fails closed, but now\nlogs a warning with the stack trace so the two cases can be told apart (#806).\n\nAdds a test for the ordinary-request path, where g.user is not set and\nflask_login''s current_user is the authenticated user: both the tenant and\nthe own-rows narrowing must resolve from it (#807).\n\nRefs #806, #807\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c5273fa958dd4a45dff62cce696c5f328e8b55c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/trees/9c5273fa958dd4a45dff62cce696c5f328e8b55c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/commits/0d441524c6a90b32a5ef3c51b1496200f1d41cfb","verification":{"payload":"tree 9c5273fa958dd4a45dff62cce696c5f328e8b55c\nparent 332788e853c93208630ec551366a450fa1d4c788\nauthor Bikash <bikashprasadbarnwal@gmail.com> 1791436848 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791436848 +0530\n\nfix(security): log unexpected errors in the superset user resolver (#809)\n\n_session_user() swallowed any exception and returned None, which looks\nexactly like \"this user has no tenant role\". It still fails closed, but now\nlogs a warning with the stack trace so the two cases can be told apart (#806).\n\nAdds a test for the ordinary-request path, where g.user is not set and\nflask_login''s current_user is the authenticated user: both the tenant and\nthe own-rows narrowing must resolve from it (#807).\n\nRefs #806, #807\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxygwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmKEQAAkl1C3/InNB0d9MXvmRACzq\nIeMSChV/kdqYBME9A0EqjiaBYYy77tAp24vo+kNSxGuhVCt37k/8thnxQAlNLupF\nu6XoPiWtSvt0H2ZEEfGy10ql+lPAnWqLJKLvB+BmiDtU7yYq5zV+69WSDHt35ivN\nKKLkl37Q/CvQc9OmzRuKepckoxmLFpnK+oQWw6qocG/K98JrK5nfTWlncfiqIQrS\nHTAi67LIWlmN0xrtarK8yRVxYSR0WuWsAJO8OAltzh5e37pCoZDacdVEnceDBwBq\nTCO/EXO+77/iflmDp6OMnl9fjX5MqIoREXKR9rq/BucbQxAvoAcZHCwP03zpfDSQ\n55i89eKQd92xbKgftgkLm5kO4NdROkoOam92dYWGlvQttWqaiWbv2TtxxtEwvL8L\n4seKKikeQa3LUGP9b27qsK0rm