43","sha":"3d89abbdbc8a5067bf270f2df12603a73cc03543","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commits/3d89abbdbc8a5067bf270f2df12603a73cc03543"}],"sha":"02099d9a971b0df64dc38cb322716f1c56f17dcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commits/02099d9a971b0df64dc38cb322716f1c56f17dcb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67047397?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TusharSharma991","id":67047397,"login":"TusharSharma991","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDQ3Mzk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commits/3d89abbdbc8a5067bf270f2df12603a73cc03543/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:01:09Z","email":"67047397+TusharSharma991@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tushar Sharma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:01:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(docs): ADR-022 platform-admin sandbox role [skip-tests-check] docs-only ADR, no code change (#781)\n\n* docs(docs): record platform-admin cross-tenant sandbox role decision\n\n* docs(docs): record rls mechanism decision for platform-admin role (option b)\n\n* docs(docs): add multi-org sandbox spec, resolving adr-022 review blocker on missing spec reference\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(docs): address prabhuvijit''s adr-022 review blockers\n\nResolves Decisions 2-4 with concrete answers, adds Decisions 5-9 (connection\npool pattern, SECURITY DEFINER exposure, audit trail open item, rate\nlimiting, reset semantics), updates the MFA mechanism description to the\nreal OpenWind email-OTP implementation (Zitadel''s hosted instance has no\nusable MFA method), and cross-references the now-committed spec file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(docs): remove local path from spec, point mfa bug log to adr decision\n\nBlocker C from PrabhuVijit''s round-2 ADR-022 review: the spec''s closing\nnote referenced a local Windows filesystem path no other contributor\ncan read. Removed. B2''s backprop entry now points to ADR-022 Decision\n10 (prepared separately) as the real record of the MFA mechanism\ntrade-off, rather than framing it as just a bug-log entry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(docs): record mfa mechanism trade-off as adr-022 decision 10\n\nAddresses PrabhuVijit''s round-2 review blockers A and B: the TOTP to\nemail-OTP MFA mechanism change was a real security trade-off that had\nno ADR decision entry, and the 12-hour verification window had no\nstated justification. Decision 10 records both, plus the re-verification\nrequirement for reset/delete, the Redis storage backend (finding F),\nand the seeded-account shared-password risk acceptance (finding D).\nStatus line stripped to the bare \"Proposed\" keyword (suggestion G).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5f85211437819e5cb656def80c6a747d302379b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/trees/e5f85211437819e5cb656def80c6a747d302379b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/commits/3d89abbdbc8a5067bf270f2df12603a73cc03543","verification":{"payload":"tree e5f85211437819e5cb656def80c6a747d302379b\nparent 19f688f75b56eff549a55299d195c504ab9ad15a\nauthor Tushar Sharma <67047397+TusharSharma991@users.noreply.github.com> 1791367269 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791367269 +0530\n\ndocs(docs): ADR-022 platform-admin sandbox role [skip-tests-check] docs-only ADR, no code change (#781)\n\n* docs(docs): record platform-admin cross-tenant sandbox role decision\n\n* docs(docs): record rls mechanism decision for platform-admin role (option b)\n\n* docs(docs): add multi-org sandbox spec, resolving adr-022 review blocker on missing spec reference\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(docs): address prabhuvijit''s adr-022 review blockers\n\nResolves Decisions 2-4 with concrete answers, adds Decisions 5-9 (connection\npool pattern, SECURITY DEFINER exposure, audit trail open item, rate\nlimiting, reset semantics), updates the MFA mechanism description to the\nreal OpenWind email-OTP implementation (Zitadel''s hosted instance has no\nusable MFA method), and cross-references the now-committed spec file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(docs): remove local path from spec, point mfa bug log to adr decision\n\nBlocker C from PrabhuVijit''s round-2 ADR-022 review: the spec''s closing\nnote referenced a local Windows filesystem path no other contributor\ncan read. Removed. B2''s backprop entry now points to ADR-022 Decision\n10 (prepared separately) as the real record of the MFA mechanism\ntrade-off, rather than framing it as just a bug-log entry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(docs): record mfa mechanism trade-off as adr-022 decision 10\n\nAddresses PrabhuVijit''s round-2 review blockers A and B: the TOTP to\nemail-OTP MFA mechanism change was a real security trade-off that had\nno ADR decision entry, and the 12-hour verification window had no\nstated justification. Decision 10 records both, plus the re-verification\nrequirement for reset/delete, the Redis storage backend (finding F),\nand the seeded-account shared-password risk acceptance (finding D).\nStatus line stripped to the bare \"Proposed\" keyword (suggestion G).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxhhlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqKcQAKXiMAWoUvBY12MZ151Gnqb9\nKHS2n9xmlk6tUVMko/6/EHsp3d4MZqtiGmjMkfI3Qgu/nlb7rFtZA2sAbcrYwFN/\nP0fwBZ7iI1dMHj0/qhWZFVeEu2ugSktgZ7oiZyVjJhE8C2xKdbVUTwexEbC4BA5a\nygRk0l7ng2aW+VnVcmUHe5H79gkYh3PMJDaisud7jgqADxUXp/gtqqmfO8mUX+cl\njJOjNh1yhXZ0TRhetoCUike0K8qDM5KtPekzeuosgEtZoGVfF0dLUJrYFCLKfEdp\njFNxvCUIjHzWTuMv+aEmgSY+Ol1Cj8fhy7lxFOWfwutkCP/JT7sFVTxN/lBCgGRu\n8D+kiC/FIFXN+EZ/ce6F8OlW/NCQtP9c3yYWyQyNxIpUpeQS2uUGm8HyeDJ62N/a\njxqgjAytdKRJ6l8nokGVL6ws9OCEcS6a06vhEe+cc2L8RTK9D4safPPWwRgIeQbS\n25N/ooctNX5anGnDG00vJSN/HCUvfw38V+XzpWDFAHN8+zgzy/ZgMM41kR6Jcz2W\nl9iaIoGoevQulYPMwyv20k9jrN6pOeaZVztaj5ZVKMxqBx/GrCryWnyJVnjnFaes\n1OcVXlmmOKdpNy4TV0qyDmu43wEfPz0CecWri9Mx/5T8qHVgW9uO4r/UtMEFI1/d\nxMQUOwnv3Dg4fcc1dv4e\n=sFBc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T10:01:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"ht