vents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commits/fdb5130f400c27f56c527d63911fe45f5974ecaf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T07:11:54Z","email":"67047397+TusharSharma991@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tushar Sharma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T07:11:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(audit): org-directory review follow-ups (#774)\n\n- Rename the admin-triggered org-directory sync audit actions to the\n  resource.verb taxonomy: org_directory.sync_completed (was the generic\n  \"updated\") and org_directory.sync_failed (was the bare \"sync_failed\").\n  Migration 0134 swaps the CHECK constraint values and renames any\n  pre-existing sync_failed rows so it validates on already-migrated stacks.\n- Keep a search-highlighted org chart card''s border orange: skip the hover\n  style for highlighted cards so a hover-out no longer overrides it.\n- Add an isolation test for GDPR erasure of a manager: reports move up\n  exactly one hop, siblings are untouched, triggered_by is redacted.\n\nCloses #745, closes #754, closes #755, closes #727\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5f2cc7261b87bfa5a6355685ffd7e12923f534de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/trees/5f2cc7261b87bfa5a6355685ffd7e12923f534de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/commits/fdb5130f400c27f56c527d63911fe45f5974ecaf","verification":{"payload":"tree 5f2cc7261b87bfa5a6355685ffd7e12923f534de\nparent 998e5c9a81cda361c4b29817f13c9acb4d07da95\nauthor Tushar Sharma <67047397+TusharSharma991@users.noreply.github.com> 1791357114 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791357114 +0530\n\nfix(audit): org-directory review follow-ups (#774)\n\n- Rename the admin-triggered org-directory sync audit actions to the\n  resource.verb taxonomy: org_directory.sync_completed (was the generic\n  \"updated\") and org_directory.sync_failed (was the bare \"sync_failed\").\n  Migration 0134 swaps the CHECK constraint values and renames any\n  pre-existing sync_failed rows so it validates on already-migrated stacks.\n- Keep a search-highlighted org chart card''s border orange: skip the hover\n  style for highlighted cards so a hover-out no longer overrides it.\n- Add an isolation test for GDPR erasure of a manager: reports move up\n  exactly one hop, siblings are untouched, triggered_by is redacted.\n\nCloses #745, closes #754, closes #755, closes #727\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxfC6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+scQAJO17NZzi3qLWowmSzRdsjxZ\nvDXY+jyAesmPPqqHBRaMHk+nqkMAVbixkUOmpGU4wOvRRh1S7L5wMDC0g2Sd9k2+\nfgQkbrqes66UGVUjhpzwsG3qtp9TdC8NcPGEtKePAvHx7IwqM02pX3WLW1w3mn0k\nhQEs2zE3GFRCtZEC+z4pIoFR4v6hbgXP4XL4rv8obPviwUrRZtHWDW0UIG0qnSto\nPtt1irTX6aMBCPEjT6vhLeuqc1+I61wxLXudiA5yjw8I8MnuV7Id3P2/dAyhFp3f\nlWgoPgNcPq60s+Zlaf2YV5hAuOwKSN0zJwR2TmS4qIvl536ReU0faBpLyXokdL69\n0yMQNFRfnW3bfaGKAuOlA6FbGqPoBR5ovaHWDt2X3Tanwmlbyz1CwD0mAEgFLVN+\ng4efURcYetj6XkJBkh6D7e7xw2Ngo2bNnO9M6/EqN0Xwr3WhkTQqdMrALfIZsMwU\nnXRbQ7ZqOBnBwtyOppX1LZAySmQTnYBtSrFej5MkowiJeXSiAgF+Utt+ZOSRgCGD\nuSqJQBhQ/nM82X8YbmuFnZIeNf1uR+LHabsmthu+hkJY0uune/Ta7UqjOVT7+IrG\n0I3YXwfpFYx4Zg64aAiu+sV1P2yCiQXPehgvRKGMqgi7t5q1u6Ods3+Jy+BefOFN\nOSKc4UwSHX57GA8OAW99\n=gigT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T07:11:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/us