automations run\nwithout actor roles.\n\nCloses #760","tree":{"sha":"078c83cf2700947ec112755a2dcd43dcb110216f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/trees/078c83cf2700947ec112755a2dcd43dcb110216f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/commits/9137a5c2b2088299c52405761db4efee25a0667e","verification":{"payload":"tree 078c83cf2700947ec112755a2dcd43dcb110216f\nparent 67acccb9cd9ad73810db8e1b170a9db0cd761b4c\nauthor Abhinav Mishra <needabhinav@gmail.com> 1791116910 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791116910 +0530\n\nfix(admin-ui): pick the automation transition from the trigger''s workflow (#771)\n\nThe wizard''s transition action saved a typed transitionName, but the\nAPI and executor need transitionId, so every wizard-built transition\naction was rejected. List the transitions of the workflow the trigger\npins (directly, or through its record type) and save the picked id.\nNext stays blocked until the action can actually run: no workflow,\na transition from another workflow, or a missing required comment.\nRole-restricted transitions show disabled, since automations run\nwithout actor roles.\n\nCloses #760","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwkZuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqDwQAKo+yA7m48QhJbrO9sdoHAGe\nijKrnOm2QqtWh3hN7Ne27b/dTJV3nt74W8uT9FYokT2wRBrIDMxXMPmR+uC6U1vT\n4+QgXSub5doB78c3wS37j0yWFcmccLzIb/GtUsrwmZpxNcnWbWeM/QmG/VgoFMnu\nWGA22/CjJwEzIr7wix+Kzqb91EL0R2htyCML9sbCF1rcWA9+iIzvflZc9rG8wYUT\nI/PdgU42FviuTSufu/M0GqfNZlRI2wcvjqNFnmw/yM+9MCUvOF3FwmXenwd/e8rf\ny9SeGmmNmLE4u4vd9knrhI8LNjNMBIVd2nAN08rP8kNxmGaCUQ9tONRhAytoRAbJ\nKvZcTuAPACh8gJ8+auzdIX9Y4dXS4B3Msi7ThMYQieSacS/XcDIPCWfmGLyJbFKv\nCx8jOiyFpyQLjyMI46vIHBK57yy93JUVj3mJSN7+DpiyHzbh+xhpLHmtRrw0kIDH\nLDBGkTvt5C1RF6E2o34HU0j4+Jr5zbUQf/RojWBvyHyqocBL1OEBC2rfw3NsgrNz\nX9yJdqFMtBnrMV1Odh0Uafs2tn0/3R9WtaMdmgjS3bovNAEU69XK9Ve726cl/EER\npKC/qpuLB++QUbUozaM8EfMQ7CbOh0oP5B61bTOUbZCZ2QAasF3bxZpdBW59u5oZ\nscv6Rf61jJJPvfK5reV/\n=+ZTC\n-----END