- mention-resolution records each resolved tenant member in the comment''s metadata.mentions\n- per-user erasure also redacts the target''s email and user id in mentioning comments\n- migration 0133 backfills mentions on existing third-party comments from the tag audit trail\n\n* test(worker): assert recorded mentions by argument, not query parameter order\n\nMock recordResolvedMention in the worker unit test and check the\n(tenantId, commentId, userId) it receives, so reordering the statement''s\nparameters can''t turn the assertions into a false green. The statement''s\nown behaviour stays covered on a real DB by the isolation test.","tree":{"sha":"c853b0fc0eed298cd04dfb123d5448e1f180fe0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/trees/c853b0fc0eed298cd04dfb123d5448e1f180fe0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/commits/1650f920476dd66e69c25cf950a3d4d46a2f59ca","verification":{"payload":"tree c853b0fc0eed298cd04dfb123d5448e1f180fe0f\nparent bf9f4d238506a34767c27cbac33b181abb4ce5ee\nauthor Abhinav Mishra <needabhinav@gmail.com> 1791114430 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791114430 +0530\n\nfix(worker): record resolved third-party mentions so erasure can scrub them (#766)\n\n* fix(worker): record resolved third-party mentions so erasure can scrub them\n\n- mention-resolution records each resolved tenant member in the comment''s metadata.mentions\n- per-user erasure also redacts the target''s email and user id in mentioning comments\n- migration 0133 backfills mentions on existing third-party comments from the tag audit trail\n\n* test(worker): assert recorded mentions by argument, not query parameter order\n\nMock recordResolvedMention in the worker unit test and check the\n(tenantId, commentId, userId) it receives, so reordering the statement''s\nparameters can''t turn the assertions into a false green. The statement''s\nown behaviour stays covered on a real DB by the isolation test.","reason":"valid","signature":"