ents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commit/b1415639c6c94ef8400bffd436b535995aafdc65","sha":"b1415639c6c94ef8400bffd436b535995aafdc65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commits/b1415639c6c94ef8400bffd436b535995aafdc65"}],"sha":"6599d79a5e80c4df8c6e72350feca038a418971a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commits/6599d79a5e80c4df8c6e72350feca038a418971a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67047397?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TusharSharma991","id":67047397,"login":"TusharSharma991","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MDQ3Mzk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TusharSharma991","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commits/b1415639c6c94ef8400bffd436b535995aafdc65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:48:25Z","email":"67047397+TusharSharma991@users.noreply.github.com","name":"TusharSharma991"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:48:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(auth): org-directory PR1 — package scaffold + Zitadel manager_id/department metadata read (#711)\n\n* feat(auth): add zitadel manager_id/department metadata read + org-directory scaffold\n\nNew @platform/org-directory package (docs/specs/org-directory.md) with the\nOrgSourceImporter/OrgNode/OrgTree contract that keeps the org-chart tree\nswappable across identity providers. Adds getOrgMetadataForUser to\npackages/auth/src/zitadel-management.ts, reading exactly the manager_id/\ndepartment metadata keys via the existing service-account token path,\nwith the same cache/single-flight pattern as the file''s other lookups.\n\nPR1 of the org-directory track (spec + tasks in docs/specs/). No schema,\nroutes, or UI yet — those land in follow-up PRs per the tasks file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(auth): address pr711 review feedback -- vitest deps.inline, dead param\n\n- packages/org-directory/vitest.config.ts: add server.deps.inline for\n  @platform/* workspace deps, matching the existing packages/workflow-engine\n  convention -- without it, vitest''s per-package module isolation can break\n  instanceof checks across the @platform/* boundary.\n- zitadel-management.ts: remove parseOrgMetadataEntries''s unused _userId\n  param rather than keep it for a hypothetical future logging path.\n- zitadel-management.test.ts: tighten the malformed-base64 test to assert\n  the exact best-effort-decoded value (the function does not skip malformed\n  entries, despite the old test''s name implying it did); add a test proving\n  the no-token path evicts its cache entry instead of permanently caching\n  an empty result.\n\nAddresses PrabhuVijit''s review on PR #711.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3354dc5f3ee8c4b70a0b6a1891b8bd6daa68d6a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/trees/3354dc5f3ee8c4b70a0b6a1891b8bd6daa68d6a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/commits/b1415639c6c94ef8400bffd436b535995aafdc65","verification":{"payload":"tree 3354dc5f3ee8c4b70a0b6a1891b8bd6daa68d6a4\nparent 450cf95e56465dd43a6d5f6ca506b5e69843dc5c\nauthor TusharSharma991 <67047397+TusharSharma991@users.noreply.github.com> 1790761705 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790761705 +0530\n\nfeat(auth): org-directory PR1 — package scaffold + Zitadel manager_id/department metadata read (#711)\n\n* feat(auth): add zitadel manager_id/department metadata read + org-directory scaffold\n\nNew @platform/org-directory package (docs/specs/org-directory.md) with the\nOrgSourceImporter/OrgNode/OrgTree contract that keeps the org-chart tree\nswappable across identity providers. Adds getOrgMetadataForUser to\npackages/auth/src/zitadel-management.ts, reading exactly the manager_id/\ndepartment metadata keys via the existing service-account token path,\nwith the same cache/single-flight pattern as the file''s other lookups.\n\nPR1 of the org-directory track (spec + tasks in docs/specs/). No schema,\nroutes, or UI yet — those land in follow-up PRs per the tasks file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(auth): address pr711 review feedback -- vitest deps.inline, dead param\n\n- packages/org-directory/vitest.config.ts: add server.deps.inline for\n  @platform/* workspace deps, matching the existing packages/workflow-engine\n  convention -- without it, vitest''s per-package module isolation can break\n  instanceof checks across the @platform/* boundary.\n- zitadel-management.ts: remove parseOrgMetadataEntries''s unused _userId\n  param rather than keep it for a hypothetical future logging path.\n- zitadel-management.test.ts: tighten the malformed-base64 test to assert\n  the exact best-effort-decoded value (the function does not skip malformed\n  entries, despite the old test''s name implying it did); add a test proving\n  the no-token path evicts its cache entry instead of permanently caching\n  an empty result.\n\nAddresses PrabhuVijit''s review on PR #711.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-autho