elf-assign commands\n\n* docs(docs): streamline contributing guide and prune stale commentary\n\n* fix(ci): tighten issue assignment commands and claim rules\n\nCommands now only count as the first word on their own line, so prose,\nquotes and code blocks no longer assign or unassign anyone. The bot\nfilter uses the user type github actually sends. Contributors can only\nself-assign good first issue or help wanted issues, and each run reads\nthe issue''s current state and runs one at a time per issue. Also fixes\nthe contributing guide''s dependency rules and commit examples.","tree":{"sha":"47a2bf3241d14f193d539de34b27cf6696ca0531","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/trees/47a2bf3241d14f193d539de34b27cf6696ca0531"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/commits/450cf95e56465dd43a6d5f6ca506b5e69843dc5c","verification":{"payload":"tree 47a2bf3241d14f193d539de34b27cf6696ca0531\nparent ea9eb722ef5b69f87dd139b6fc462c027957e993\nauthor Abhinav Mishra <needabhinav@gmail.com> 1790758844 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790758844 +0530\n\nfeat(ci): add issue self-assignment commands for contributors [skip-tests-check] workflow + docs, harness-verified (#721)\n\n* feat(ci): add issue assignment workflow for community contributors\n\n* docs(docs): document issue assignment and self-assign commands\n\n* docs(docs): streamline contributing guide and prune stale commentary\n\n* fix(ci): tighten issue assignment commands and claim rules\n\nCommands now only count as the first word on their own line, so prose,\nquotes and code blocks no longer assign or unassign anyone. The bot\nfilter uses the user type github actually sends. Contributors can only\nself-assign good first issue or help wanted issues, and each run reads\nthe issue''s current state and runs one at a time per issue. Also fixes\nthe contributing guide''s dependency rules and commit examples.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQ