pi.github.com/users/abmish/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abmish","id":3049693,"login":"abmish","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDk2OTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commits/77ae2481d45826bedbc7967b5b1cfb8c4b4c7c70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T05:00:13Z","email":"needabhinav@gmail.com","name":"Abhinav Mishra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T05:00:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge commit from fork\n\n* fix(security): guard the generic relation route and mention grants (ghsa-xgxf)\n\nThe generic relation route now refuses the engine-owned relation types\n(parent_of, child_of, references, referenced_by) and requires user-role\ncallers to be able to read the target; unreadable, missing and\ncross-tenant targets share one 404 body.\n\nUI @mentions only grant access to tenant members and never rewrite an\nexisting access entry.\n\nAdvisory: GHSA-xgxf-m4r9-xm4v.\n\n* fix(security): type the relation target error and skip non-member mentions (ghsa-xgxf)\n\nReplaces the string-matched sentinel in the relation route with a typed\nerror checked by instanceof. Mentions of ids outside the tenant now get\nneither an access grant nor a notification, for every commenter.\n\nAdvisory: GHSA-xgxf-m4r9-xm4v.","tree":{"sha":"be33cfb015869634e9b1aa914b503bd18b30d8a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/trees/be33cfb015869634e9b1aa914b503bd18b30d8a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/commits/77ae2481d45826bedbc7967b5b1cfb8c4b4c7c70","verification":{"payload":"tree be33cfb015869634e9b1aa914b503bd18b30d8a9\nparent fbd0ea6e2c14e1281c926a33a6518e6a00736368\nauthor Abhinav Mishra <needabhinav@gmail.com> 1790744413 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790744413 +0530\n\nMerge commit from fork\n\n* fix(security): guard the generic relation route and mention grants (ghsa-xgxf)\n\nThe generic relation route now refuses the engine-owned relation types\n(parent_of, child_of, references, referenced_by) and requires user-role\ncallers to be able to read the target; unreadable, missing and\ncross-tenant targets share one 404 body.\n\nUI @mentions only grant access to tenant members and never rewrite an\nexisting access entry.\n\nAdvisory: GHSA-xgxf-m4r9-xm4v.\n\n* fix(security): type the relation target error and skip non-member mentions (ghsa-xgxf)\n\nReplaces the string-matched sentinel in the relation route with a typed\nerror checked by instanceof. Mentions of ids outside the tenant now get\nneither an access grant nor a notification, for every commenter.\n\nAdvisory: GHSA-xgxf-m4r9-xm4v.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvJddCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAj4QQAE39ud/vNHgnMsRtE/TqQziw\n3I5djgjPdCU/5zKY1mr8SbRsfm4lJ5bgi221ApNTXk2/3lmHzMkQZ7+e3a0H22N4\nMrHHxK0lPR6ezLlP66NlM7VWL/+RPa9Ef8kbVn/3PG/DzgpafdtqYhGoEoY/xqZI\nSgBAdNVxB40gOSRGRNzuZkreHodjZq+uqGlXyw7FrVT2DJ6G2GSmfFCMSkDLOSi9\ncQzVZNGEHI9VSgM/IrYz7ToIADwFOG1WzUqcpUBGU7HRsZkLfX0f4rQSkerMFVSK\np/y897PViLAc1n0v9xMPXjlZO1Jzoo7nY4ep5l9udL/prJsrRLVSqH74XlngfPkS\nyufo0N6bnNdQ4NyA4+QMJnPan/3PDoGpOnDOcByMjO1CCmBdOmmD9ZL6AxDuMTcP\n3f0Km8iCoqvjfLIzAPgZ9XPI4s1i4SddEOb63vNoaWNyj7MikWZixRsVlHHijwiD\nTdQf89Vn4Pd/R4rpdo2yG54pD7/Dziq+bKKdIXeIFZ7pEFBMpCZuU52ixAXbnO4g\n49Z0SY2D3KL63op0ARVmmtcVJ4ORyrI3Ze083WfwkeuCm6A7cm4eDr6SzgKWWhHQ\n70KY5w