ch named after approve-plan or\napprove-ship, so an ambiguous approval across worktrees can be resolved\nfrom chat. A name that matches nothing approves nothing.","tree":{"sha":"6d36c23e5217b2fe70bddefc929eab48703ba70b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/trees/6d36c23e5217b2fe70bddefc929eab48703ba70b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/commits/d51451fd2a26cb28c6b6fc2cc73995520f7ac633","verification":{"payload":"tree 6d36c23e5217b2fe70bddefc929eab48703ba70b\nparent b019662eff4cca0ffbdae40d38f1e55648724377\nauthor Abhinav Mishra <needabhinav@gmail.com> 1790671277 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790671277 +0530\n\nfix(deps): raise the fast-uri pin and let approvals name a branch (#710)\n\nRaises the fast-uri override to 3.1.7 / 4.1.4 for two high advisories\npublished 2026-09-28 (ghsa-qw65-cvwx-89v3, ghsa-58mr-gqgx-xq4g), which\nfailed the dependency audit on main. fast-uri is dev-only, via\ncommitlint.\n\nThe approval gate now reads a branch named after approve-plan or\napprove-ship, so an ambiguous approval across worktrees can be resolved\nfrom chat. A name that matches nothing approves nothing.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu3mtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFOoQAKZubVTGwLfkKBsFp07xnTjp\ngPMPSrUWVDlC7t96/qq68vnny8AgEMzxJW5DBDvHBX5gU45QhYbIBGtZaXyi+hq2\nItY9M2YvFP6H5osI8oA1vLp+w687gbvFctQOFtByjz5FDt8qLbIxAT00lEsfilLj\n3N5HDORgFS+n82zJDWeHHqzgR8Zja2+w7Aswg74XJ8JyvOqsoL6SlMPFmI+vGnEo\nCCwvOipz/BqqdfF/RMoVc0U8nqy4CwzIw5S/wnuK9Pg+8EXg2Q6BNKBnpyyWjhWs\nLKjmXlU3zByxb0eqVUfdSfcBrq5nmg//Wz0A1U6Fte8oIHPb+9c3pKBaNz/HYV5/\nuH3lVqxj9Zr1EYFVwpXyxLijyfFlJ4dtWWTg/BhzDNWVssCq19QlOIi+RXNeSbOQ\nCUME3miH8TuZVmPeQfHs+bsR5wpS1ezVSNgAr/T44JdSMkF7z8vjsQG+PnfOwJVc\nhZ/SOwU9ImunkRcL6L0pOpxUGSsdBdyIzSUxLupMMX4h0z2ZHKPoNZxsTJQxa8Fj\nc7ZhZEvm6LBX82Srec9NRmUlXTlDSaC6kiDHe7z/RwDHXAqkcdfQkHgZvlfKZ2SV\ndXsgJkustUVuJHlDZEgsL8a3qBZkiaa3WNiVeGOD20k1gu5eeoRFGC4saJr9pUFp\nqaBFwLaPcy2ZTxJvReex\n=irGO\n-----END 