https://github.com/abmish","id":3049693,"login":"abmish","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDk2OTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commits/b019662eff4cca0ffbdae40d38f1e55648724377/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T06:46:46Z","email":"needabhinav@gmail.com","name":"Abhinav Mishra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T06:46:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(docs): draft adr-018, adr-020, adr-021 and answer open questions across all adrs (#695) [skip-tests-check] docs-only (#702)\n\n* docs(docs): draft adr-018 to adr-021 and answer open questions across all adrs (#695)\n\nDraft ADR-018 (AI layer), ADR-019 (reporting tenant isolation), ADR-020 (module\nownership) and ADR-021 (ticket relations and participant access) for peer review.\nEach has had an open-questions pass: answers settled by evidence are folded into\nthe Decisions, and judgment calls are marked proposed pending confirmation.\n\nIn accepted ADR-001 to ADR-017, each Open Questions section becomes one\nID | Question | Status | Evidence / answer table. Answers checked against main are\nmarked ''Recommended (2026-09-28), pending acceptance''. The layout follows\nADR-016/017. A baseline checker confirms no Decision text was reworded, apart from\nADR-006''s cross-reference to the renamed section.\n\nAlso: fix stale sup-docs path citations in ADR-008/009/011, correct ADR-001''s\nanalytics_user role row, and add the new ADRs to CLAUDE.md, the tracker and the\nweek-log.\n\n* docs(docs): address first review round on adr drafts (#695)\n\nUpdates the tracker note for issue 18, renames the adr-006 section\nto questions and resolutions, points adr-021 oq-11 at wa-06 and\nissue 703, and explains the adr-018 oq numbering gap.\n\n* docs(docs): hand adr-019 to its owner''s pr (#695)\n\nDrops the adr-019 draft, its claude.md row and the 3g and 695 tracker\nrow edits, since pr 707 by the isolation-approach owner carries them.\nThe adr-008/009/011 citation fixes stay; they match 707 exactly.","tree":{"sha":"951497f9810f0d1af6c3d0df30004240f5baadea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/trees/951497f9810f0d1af6c3d0df30004240f5baadea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/commits/b019662eff4cca0ffbdae40d38f1e55648724377","verification":{"payload":"tree 951497f9810f0d1af6c3d0df30004240f5baadea\nparent 2e897926222cfca47318fb3cda0152b80d8a6050\nauthor Abhinav Mishra <needabhinav@gmail.com> 1790664406 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790664406 +0530\n\ndocs(docs): draft adr-018, adr-020, adr-021 and answer open questions across all adrs (#695) [skip-tests-check] docs-only (#702)\n\n* docs(docs): draft adr-018 to adr-021 and answer open questions across all adrs (#695)\n\nDraft ADR-018 (AI layer), ADR-019 (reporting tenant isolation), ADR-020 (module\nownership) and ADR-021 (ticket relations and participant access) for peer review.\nEach has had an open-questions pass: answers settled by evidence are folded into\nthe Decisions, and judgment calls are marked proposed pending confirmation.\n\nIn accepted ADR-001 to ADR-017, each Open Questions section becomes one\nID | Question | Status | Evidence / answer table. Answers checked against main are\nmarked ''Recommended (2026-09-28), pending acceptance''. The layout follows\nADR-016/017. A baseline checker confirms no Decision text was reworded, apart from\nADR-006''s cross-reference to the renamed section.\n\nAlso: fix stale sup-docs path citations in ADR-008/009/011, correct ADR-001''s\nanalytics_user role row, and add the new ADRs to CLAUDE.md, the tracker and the\nweek-log.\n\n* docs(docs): address first review round on adr drafts (#695)\n\nUpdates the tracker note for issue 18, renames the adr-006 section\nto questions and resolutions, points adr-021 oq-11 at wa-06 and\nissue 703, and explains the adr-018 oq numbering gap.\n\n* docs(docs): hand adr-019 to its owner''s pr (#695)\n\nDrops the adr-019 draft, its claude.md row and the 3g and 695 tracker\nrow edits, since pr 707 by the isolation-approach owner carries them.\nThe adr-008/009/011 citation fixes stay; they match 707 exactly.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu17WCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAligQADb+XHgzU12cvI8Del/iW3qs\nWxjKCHMKrIwhaRkGjyBm4zy9IUv0lkcLo9oM6oDFSFLN6DmGR8Np/dBsfo9RJT6v\n/RCgNDTpSY3mXYx+gSP4Wsuh5LwHFIbOru78vYXTvuxBwhc5l+iWlolk4ha9MQZ2\ncDPwH0cA+/S6YZ5JqPShxA9R+W9L9kkT/r/IiTDhC++tvKkgbe+0M4q7wJv+vGf3\ncI5vmPnWeDHBe1o7iL4uu0+I606ZW7+BHefjcHR4qAGrfIKk7WXGKn0GrLEKP+pV\nfXnuT+3HOd+cdV4UFaP3f6Gpam3B1mzwTnQYbTZRPCngMvf5H33XQ1QF39KIZQVo\nVdpv6xVG/ZxtP99UOQMhdkmC88Ppq7O7Fo4Rd/Cw7zItJRp00WU0ZxGhnTDWpJmQ\ni75pWkrZWXC3LQlu6itR2yNUn403UabOPFagnl/Gy4e7Q70a+cNmrM7GxlKjwaSq\nbvCORgONcIK6paTN3s54awLFO5g44ydiAgVY6W1ut8jNZz8/5kdO3k3I8VULMbtm\n4RQf3agpEJopeGOWYyplciCMHCbOO39nrmYPw/E3Uu8m19OI9wDFTn7qEvPKeRW0\nYHauRPD0lZ+C8Ii96KQ3iLKAPIeN6i/JKYcjF1ax1Ee6y4fBhUT2DiyxcHI5kfdd\nfS2iUm3jxr1vpRKDt/cs\n=4B1j\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T06:46:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXN