Phi/OpenWind/commit/7750c9696a66877f812e3bbeb6e829964317a8a0","node_id":"C_kwDOScMdh9oAKDc3NTBjOTY5NmE2Njg3N2Y4MTJlM2JiZWI2ZTgyOTk2NDMxN2E4YTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commit/1c5bbbeac7680fe179d62c35279a9291c207966a","sha":"1c5bbbeac7680fe179d62c35279a9291c207966a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commits/1c5bbbeac7680fe179d62c35279a9291c207966a"}],"sha":"7750c9696a66877f812e3bbeb6e829964317a8a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commits/7750c9696a66877f812e3bbeb6e829964317a8a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3049693?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abmish","id":3049693,"login":"abmish","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDk2OTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commits/1c5bbbeac7680fe179d62c35279a9291c207966a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T10:50:56Z","email":"needabhinav@gmail.com","name":"Abhinav Mishra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T10:50:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(config): make the anthropic api key optional until an ai feature ships (#700) (#701)\n\nNothing consumes @platform/ai yet (3C hasn''t started), but packages/config\nrequired ANTHROPIC_API_KEY at startup. It is now optional, and an empty value\ncounts as unset. createClient() throws a typed AiNotConfiguredError\n(AI_NOT_CONFIGURED) when it is absent, and isAiConfigured() lets callers branch.\npackages/ai gains vitest with three tests; config gains three schema tests.\n.env.example no longer ships a non-empty placeholder that would look configured.","tree":{"sha":"5e4aff1f52281110f696a3a34828c1f1843d3ceb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/trees/5e4aff1f52281110f696a3a34828c1f1843d3ceb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/commits/1c5bbbeac7680fe179d62c35279a9291c207966a","verification":{"payload":"tree 5e4aff1f52281110f696a3a34828c1f1843d3ceb\nparent 439c5d67b57294b80b7d090772caa93b1906aac8\nauthor Abhinav Mishra <needabhinav@gmail.com> 1790592656 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790592656 +0530\n\nfix(config): make the anthropic api key optional until an ai feature ships (#700) (#701)\n\nNothing consumes @platform/ai yet (3C hasn''t started), but packages/config\nrequired ANTHROPIC_API_KEY at startup. It is now optional, and an empty value\ncounts as unset. createClient() throws a typed AiNotConfiguredError\n(AI_NOT_CONFIGURED) when it is absent, and isAiConfigured() lets callers branch.\npackages/ai gains vitest with three tests; config gains three schema tests.\n.env.example no longer ships a non-empty placeholder that would look configured.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqukaQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACEsQAHdkrEJtWzBPt2hcnrrr+8BT\n5KJkDHeXUcNfF3Qkmfoi18Ph/3vxZxTB+EsRGw60o+wvygr1iXKWrVgJ5SKxXGk2\nWF5598be/UJBDDoerT/b98Mha/l+sSapGiy/AlN/J1Nb3549Xj4RDnzpSA/+gycN\nDpnid50Dibrnv5aJr1ImGAhanMPbO1Vqip6ZPLUNJpnoADKv0dvoaWkztCDzxve1\nCIoYqZy0ZPFiekohEFhsbIAz0BpfprSzUxuIC6jQ8vl4zbN0wsVaewvZZ7qi44NA\nwyXVJ/6DtMAVOSoKdK0vUEP0rOGMBqnDXcjtficLhmSAj5CJFoxJHRhetzs87Jgt\nGKaINz9ieAei/v7Qed2zZzU1LsVWINeA0JrcF+uHidROPdsoLBysE/nBpJdWAL//\ncbY/Q5XK2iwziACIU/Sp