api.github.com/users/abmish/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abmish","id":3049693,"login":"abmish","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDk2OTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abmish","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/commits/439c5d67b57294b80b7d090772caa93b1906aac8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T05:13:06Z","email":"needabhinav@gmail.com","name":"Abhinav Mishra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T05:13:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: reconcile stale status, dedupe agent context, index specs [skip-tests-check] docs-only, no executable code (#696)\n\n* docs: reconcile stale status, dedupe agent context, index specs (#694)\n\n- Reconcile 3A/3E/3F/3G status against merged PRs in CLAUDE.md, VISION.md and\n  roadmap-tracker; the tracker is now the single source of PR-level detail.\n  Regenerate Open Tickets (72 open).\n- Cut CLAUDE.md from 339 to 168 lines (~60% fewer words): ADR bullets become one\n  \"read before touching\" table; the drifted dependency-pin list moves into\n  pnpm-workspace.yaml comments.\n- Document the delivery flow once in .claude/README.md. Fix agent-behaviour.md''s\n  broken list and its parallel-approval contradiction. Correct the S3 wording in\n  security rules and the sup-docs path in the session-start hook.\n- Correct 23 spec status headers and add docs/specs/README.md. Delete 15 uncited\n  tasks files for shipped specs and the abandoned workflow-id-based-linking spec.\n- Move the frozen week-log to week-log/archive/, move 4 session logs out of the\n  gitignored sup-docs, drop the dead root PR template, fix stale CONTRIBUTING items.\n\nCloses #694\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: correct async export storage wording, refresh open tickets (#694)\n\nsecurity.md, security-reviewer.md and CLAUDE.md said \"no S3\", but\napps/worker/src/export-worker.ts still uploads async exports to S3 with 1h\npresigned URLs (filed as #697). Open Tickets: #106 and #587 closed, #697 added.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: swap code owner and describe enforced branch protection (#694)\n\nReplace ArijChak with PrabhuVijit on /.claude/, /scripts/ and /.github/.\nThe CODEOWNERS header, .claude/README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md and the\nsession-start banner said code-owner review was not configured. main''s\nbranch protection enforces it, along with 1 approval and 3 required checks\n(admins are not included).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87a437a7898a26248061fa2346793de6370b9c1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/trees/87a437a7898a26248061fa2346793de6370b9c1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TinyPhi/OpenWind/git/commits/439c5d67b57294b80b7d090772caa93b1906aac8","verification":{"payload":"tree 87a437a7898a26248061fa2346793de6370b9c1b\nparent eab1110cb2486eeb312759119b05b282220f60df\nauthor Abhinav Mishra <needabhinav@gmail.com> 1790572386 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790572386 +0530\n\ndocs: reconcile stale status, dedupe agent context, index specs [skip-tests-check] docs-only, no executable code (#696)\n\n* docs: reconcile stale status, dedupe agent context, index specs (#694)\n\n- Reconcile 3A/3E/3F/3G status against merged PRs in CLAUDE.md, VISION.md and\n  roadmap-tracker; the tracker is now the single source of PR-level detail.\n  Regenerate Open Tickets (72 open).\n- Cut CLAUDE.md from 339 to 168 lines (~60% fewer words): ADR bullets become one\n  \"read before touching\" table; the drifted dependency-pin list moves into\n  pnpm-workspace.yaml comments.\n- Document the delivery flow once in .claude/README.md. Fix agent-behaviour.md''s\n  broken list and its parallel-approval contradiction. Correct the S3 wording in\n  security rules and the sup-docs path in the session-start hook.\n- Correct 23 spec status headers and add docs/specs/README.md. Delete 15 uncited\n  tasks files for shipped specs and the abandoned workflow-id-based-linking spec.\n- Move the frozen week-log to week-log/archive/, move 4 session logs out of the\n  gitignored sup-docs, drop the dead root PR template, fix stale CONTRIBUTING items.\n\nCloses #694\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: correct async export storage wording, refresh open tickets (#694)\n\nsecurity.md, security-reviewer.md and CLAUDE.md said \"no S3\", but\napps/worker/src/export-worker.ts still uploads async exports to S3 with 1h\npresigned URLs (filed as #697). Open Tickets: #106 and #587 closed, #697 added.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: swap code owner and describe enforced branch protection (#694)\n\nReplace ArijChak with PrabhuVijit on /.claude/, /scripts/ and /.github/.\nThe CODEOWNERS header, .claude/README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md and the\nsession-start banner said code-owner review was not configured. main''s\nbranch protection enforces it, along with 1 approval and 3 required checks\n(admins are not included).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqufdiCRC1aQ7uu5Uh