entous, with full lifecycle)\n\nCategory expansions:\n- ''Specialised'' renamed → ''Immune cells'' (4 cells)\n- New: Fungi, Protists, Reproductive cells\n- Viruses expanded to 6 (all with 5-stage lifecycle Process mode)\n- Total 9 categories, 26 specimens\n\nScene fixes:\n- _focusOnSelected targets actual bbox center (fixes off-center\n  framing for elongated cells: sperm, ebola, paramecium, muscle)\n- Status ring footprint capped at 1.9 for elongated cells\n- Camera zoom tightened to 1.35 × maxDim\n\nTotal source: 26 procedural builders, 26 CAD build123d sources,\n~200 i18n keys, 27+ screenshots.","tree":{"sha":"9006e1ef3327f28e2bf1e956813be9264f0d0496","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wayan123/3d-interactive-visuals/git/trees/9006e1ef3327f28e2bf1e956813be9264f0d0496"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wayan123/3d-interactive-visuals/git/commits/c1942da2d5b363cc9170508b4f448834facbaa1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17795544?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayan123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayan123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayan123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayan123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Wayan123","id":17795544,"login":"Wayan123","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3Nzk1NTQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayan123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayan123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayan123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayan123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayan123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayan123","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Wayan123/3d