nual\n\n- 16 procedural cells across 6 categories (tissue/immune/blood/bacteria/viruses/organelles)\n- 6 view modes: Standalone, Microscope, Electron Microscope, Process, Atlas, Compare\n- 5 top-bar panels: Gallery, Library, Recents, Manual (bilingual), Settings\n- 5 virus lifecycles with 5-stage Process animation + narration\n- Cross-section (XYZ clipping), Read View leader-lines, hover tooltips, axis gizmo\n- 3 themes (Dark/Light/System), bilingual English + Bahasa Indonesia (~200 i18n keys)\n- In-app User Manual with 11 bilingual sections\n- Backend Python stdlib only, 100 % procedural Three.js, no external 3D services\n- Privacy-first: service probes + tmux exposure are opt-in via env vars\n- Demo GIF + 15 curated screenshots\n- MIT license, references to inspiration article + Three.js + build123d","tree":{"sha":"f19645965342341a7d3c943ac9c4b6ff878fb872","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wayan123/3d-interactive-visuals/git/trees/f19645965342341a7d3c943ac9c4b6ff878fb872"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Wayan123/3d-interactive-visuals/git/commits/9bcc83183bc7604e78c727401b4742efc2bfb7bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17795544?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayan123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayan123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayan123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayan123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Wayan123","id":17795544,"login":"Wayan123","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3Nzk1NTQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayan123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayan123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayan123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wayan123/starred{/owner}{/re