w components: MonthView, WeekView, DayView, FourWeeksView, ScheduleView, YearView, EventChip\n- CalendarView reduced from 1324 to 392 lines\n\nFixes:\n- All-day events display under correct day column in week view\n- Schedule view grouped by date with click-to-navigate\n- Recurring event expansion and merge logic\n\nTesting:\n- Add unit tests for useCalendarNavigation (18 tests)\n- Add unit tests for useCalendarEvents (15 tests)\n- Fix type errors by properly typing test mocks instead of using ''as any''\n- All 141 tests passing\n\nQuality:\n- ESLint passes (no errors)\n- Prettier formatting applied\n- Production build succeeds","tree":{"sha":"9e2614402e95a8331a618a22dc0e57cff3b8f889","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/git/trees/9e2614402e95a8331a618a22dc0e57cff3b8f889"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/git/commits/4dda76705d6508ecba5ffce2fc7cb069b6af284a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commit/4dda76705d6508ecba5ffce2fc7cb069b6af284a","node_id":"C_kwDOScX5LNoAKDRkZGE3NjcwNWQ2NTA4ZWNiYTVmZmNlMmZjN2NiMDY5YjZhZjI4NGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commit/3bb8d9c973e8c202c1ea7149738d4349703cad76","sha":"3bb8d9c973e8c202c1ea7149738d4349703cad76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/3bb8d9c973e8c202c1ea7149738d4349703cad76"}],"sha":"4dda76705d6508ecba5ffce2fc7cb069b6af284a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/4dda76705d6508ecba5ffce2fc7cb069b6af284a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/3bb8d9c973e8c202c1ea7149738d4349703cad76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T10:08:57Z","email":"keitha@unsabo.de","name":"Keith A"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T10:08:57Z","email":"keitha@unsabo.de","name":"Keith A"},"message":"Enhance calendar and contacts views with new features\n\nCalendar:\n- Add 6 views: Year, Month, Week (with hourly rows), 4 Weeks, Day, Schedule\n- Week view starts on Monday, current day highlighted\n- All-day events display under correct day column\n- Schedule view grouped by date with click-to-navigate\n- Fix recurring event expansion and date parsing\n- Fix all-day event end date display (subtract 1 day for DTEND)\n- Add dynamic event fetch based on visible date range\n\nContacts:\n- Add search box for inline filtering\n- Fix vCard parsing for properties with parameters (EMAIL;TYPE=WORK)\n- Handle line folding in vCard format\n- Fall back to N field when FN is missing\n- Split address into Street, City, Region, Postcode, Country\n- Add Birthday field support\n- Parse \\n in notes as newlines\n\nAlso:\n- Fix lint and type issues\n- Add unit tests for contacts CRUD\n- Add component tests for EventModal\n- Run prettier on all files","tree":{"sha":"777805cdd11e2d61a16c2d16693372623447c4e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/git/trees/777805cdd11e2d61a16c2d16693372623447c4e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/git/commits/3bb8d9c973e8c202c1ea7149738d4349703cad76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commit/3bb8d9c973e8c202c1ea7149738d4349703cad76","node_id":"C_kwDOScX5LNoAKDNiYjhkOWM5NzNlOGMyMDJjMWVhNzE0OTczOGQ0MzQ5NzAzY2FkNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commit/30f0a6f3a92c8af0ba3be3e83f9a3d5bd3e0c625","sha":"30f0a6f3a92c8af0ba3be3e83f9a3d5bd3e0c625","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/30f0a6f3a92c8af0ba3be3e83f9a3d5bd3e0c625"}],"sha":"3bb8d9c973e8c202c1ea7149738d4349703cad76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/3bb8d9c973e8c202c1ea7149738d4349703cad76"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/30f0a6f3a92c8af0ba3be3e83f9a3d5bd3e0c625/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T12:17:23Z","email":"keitha@unsabo.de","name":"Keith A"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T12:17:23Z","email":"keitha@unsabo.de","name":"Keith A"},"message":"Fix calendar events not displaying and rewrite GUI with scoped CSS\n\nCritical fixes:\n- Set calendarHref on parsed events (was empty string, causing\n  all events to be filtered out in the view)\n- Fix allDay flag logic (was inverted)\n- Fix calendar-color namespace (Apple ns) and ctag (CalendarServer ns)\n- Remove duplicate CardDAV builders from CalDAV xml-builder\n- Add debug logging to event fetching\n\nGUI rewrite:\n- Replace Tailwind utility classes with scoped CSS (Tailwind not\n  available in OpenCloud runtime)\n- Use CSS variables from OpenCloud design system for theming\n- Add ''New Event'' button to CalendarView\n- Proper grid layout for calendar month/week views\n- Card-based layout for contacts","tree":{"sha":"5b5ddc282a42bad69e5971371879ac7265e995ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/git/trees/5b5ddc282a42bad69e5971371879ac7265e995ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/git/commits/30f0a6f3a92c8af0ba3be3e83f9a3d5bd3e0c625","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commit/30f0a6f3a92c8af0ba3be3e83f9a3d5bd3e0c625","node_id":"C_kwDOScX5LNoAKDMwZjBhNmYzYTkyYzhhZjBiYTNiZTNlODNmOWEzZDViZDNlMGM2MjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commit/1b8b6b2d7c8c7aab8b24eb8335a2be52d7ca2584","sha":"1b8b6b2d7c8c7aab8b24eb8335a2be52d7ca2584","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/1b8b6b2d7c8c7aab8b24eb8335a2be52d7ca2584"}],"sha":"30f0a6f3a92c8af0ba3be3e83f9a3d5bd3e0c625","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/30f0a6f3a92c8af0ba3be3e83f9a3d5bd3e0c625"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/1b8b6b2d7c8c7aab8b24eb8335a2be52d7ca2584/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T12:08:26Z","email":"keitha@unsabo.de","name":"Keith A"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T12:08:26Z","email":"keitha@unsabo.de","name":"Keith A"},"message":"Fix CardDAV XML builder: fix undeclared namespace and addressbook-query\n\n- Added CS namespace for getctag (was using undeclared C: prefix)\n- Fixed addressbook-query to use CA: namespace instead of D:\n- Updated parser to handle getctag element name","tree":{"sha":"4462c3cc36bc6410fbee8cda35f1442a064ef0d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/git/trees/4462c3cc36bc6410fbee8cda35f1442a064ef0d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/git/commits/1b8b6b2d7c8c7aab8b24eb8335a2be52d7ca2584","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commit/1b8b6b2d7c8c7aab8b24eb8335a2be52d7ca2584","node_id":"C_kwDOScX5LNoAKDFiOGI2YjJkN2M4YzdhYWI4YjI0ZWI4MzM1YTJiZTUyZDdjYTI1ODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commit/c19131e636e81e2c02048f8e5866f173a4d407c3","sha":"c19131e636e81e2c02048f8e5866f173a4d407c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/c19131e636e81e2c02048f8e5866f173a4d407c3"}],"sha":"1b8b6b2d7c8c7aab8b24eb8335a2be52d7ca2584","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/1b8b6b2d7c8c7aab8b24eb8335a2be52d7ca2584"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/c19131e636e81e2c02048f8e5866f173a4d407c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T12:03:24Z","email":"keitha@unsabo.de","name":"Keith A"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T12:03:24Z","email":"keitha@unsabo.de","name":"Keith A"},"message":"Fix CardDAV XML parser: add removeNSPrefix for Radicale compatibility\n\nSame fix as CalDAV parser - Radicale returns XML with default namespace\n(xmlns=\"DAV:\") which needs prefix stripping for proper parsing.","tree":{"sha":"b8240a081e000b70b005c48a2238c615b22a9277","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/git/trees/b8240a081e000b70b005c48a2238c615b22a9277"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/git/commits/c19131e636e81e2c02048f8e5866f173a4d407c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commit/c19131e636e81e2c02048f8e5866f173a4d407c3","node_id":"C_kwDOScX5LNoAKGMxOTEzMWU2MzZlODFlMmMwMjA0OGY4ZTU4NjZmMTczYTRkNDA3YzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commit/7553fb44cf338e400a22b2d4960ab3de93501a78","sha":"7553fb44cf338e400a22b2d4960ab3de93501a78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/7553fb44cf338e400a22b2d4960ab3de93501a78"}],"sha":"c19131e636e81e2c02048f8e5866f173a4d407c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/c19131e636e81e2c02048f8e5866f173a4d407c3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/7553fb44cf338e400a22b2d4960ab3de93501a78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T11:59:08Z","email":"keitha@unsabo.de","name":"Keith A"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T11:59:08Z","email":"keitha@unsabo.de","name":"Keith A"},"message":"Fix module federation by downgrading to MF runtime 2.3.1\n\nThe OpenCloud 6.2.0 host and its working apps (like unzip) use\n@module-federation/runtime 2.3.1. Our app was using 2.4.0 (from\n@module-federation/vite 1.15.4) which has a different init protocol\nthat includes a post-init module caching loop. This caused shared\nmodule resolution to fail with ''must be provided by host''.\n\nChanges:\n- Pin @opencloud-eu/extension-sdk to 6.2.0 (matches OpenCloud version)\n- Override @module-federation/vite to 1.13.7 (produces runtime 2.3.1)\n- Downgrade peer deps to 6.x versions\n- Keep version stripping plugin for safety","tree":{"sha":"8367bc9f3a02cc408b48ecdfe836053e3ccac858","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/git/trees/8367bc9f3a02cc408b48ecdfe836053e3ccac858"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/git/commits/7553fb44cf338e400a22b2d4960ab3de93501a78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commit/7553fb44cf338e400a22b2d4960ab3de93501a78","node_id":"C_kwDOScX5LNoAKDc1NTNmYjQ0Y2YzMzhlNDAwYTIyYjJkNDk2MGFiM2RlOTM1MDFhNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commit/126eedd25c9d853cf1d6166cf47de8de8927df2d","sha":"126eedd25c9d853cf1d6166cf47de8de8927df2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/126eedd25c9d853cf1d6166cf47de8de8927df2d"}],"sha":"7553fb44cf338e400a22b2d4960ab3de93501a78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/7553fb44cf338e400a22b2d4960ab3de93501a78"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/126eedd25c9d853cf1d6166cf47de8de8927df2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T11:45:13Z","email":"keitha@unsabo.de","name":"Keith A"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T11:45:13Z","email":"keitha@unsabo.de","name":"Keith A"},"message":"Fix module federation: strip shared module versions to match host\n\nThe OpenCloud host provides shared modules (luxon, pinia, vue, etc.) without\nspecific version constraints. Our app was declaring specific versions (e.g.\nluxon@3.7.2) which caused version-based matching failures with the error\n''must be provided by host''. Added a vite plugin that strips version numbers\nfrom the shared import map at build time, matching the pattern used by\nofficial OpenCloud apps like unzip (version: void 0).","tree":{"sha":"04b6eab6c9561338654b87e1678906d081371d75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/git/trees/04b6eab6c9561338654b87e1678906d081371d75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/git/commits/126eedd25c9d853cf1d6166cf47de8de8927df2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commit/126eedd25c9d853cf1d6166cf47de8de8927df2d","node_id":"C_kwDOScX5LNoAKDEyNmVlZGQyNWM5ZDg1M2NmMWQ2MTY2Y2Y0N2RlOGRlODkyN2RmMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commit/804940d93fb6d15389c0d5148e865a5413dc2592","sha":"804940d93fb6d15389c0d5148e865a5413dc2592","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/804940d93fb6d15389c0d5148e865a5413dc2592"}],"sha":"126eedd25c9d853cf1d6166cf47de8de8927df2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/126eedd25c9d853cf1d6166cf47de8de8927df2d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kja999/opencloud-radicale-web-apps/commits/804940d93fb6d15389c0d5148e865a5413dc2592/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T10:52:43Z","email":"keitha@unsabo.de","nam