ser_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/3b05106d55d5371726158e6de0d6faedaab7c7c1","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDNiMDUxMDZkNTVkNTM3MTcyNjE1OGU2ZGUwZDZmYWVkYWFiN2M3YzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/9ac91918940a2bd94b33d3726afb6dc7ed13a9c8","sha":"9ac91918940a2bd94b33d3726afb6dc7ed13a9c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/9ac91918940a2bd94b33d3726afb6dc7ed13a9c8"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/47582c00f6c7b00970698f66b0dcc928ac94542f","sha":"47582c00f6c7b00970698f66b0dcc928ac94542f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/47582c00f6c7b00970698f66b0dcc928ac94542f"}],"sha":"3b05106d55d5371726158e6de0d6faedaab7c7c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/3b05106d55d5371726158e6de0d6faedaab7c7c1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/47582c00f6c7b00970698f66b0dcc928ac94542f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T15:25:17Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T15:25:17Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(speech): gate voice on real model readiness (warmup, not worker-construct)\n\n`ready` used to flip the instant the Web Worker was constructed, but the\nmodel (Whisper/Moonshine/Kokoro) only downloaded lazily on the first\ntranscribe/synthesize — so mic/speak/conversation controls activated, and\nthe peer advertised its skill, before any model existed; the first call\nthen silently pulled hundreds of MB and hung.\n\nNow: enabling a host WARMS the model eagerly (new worker `warmup` message\n→ loads the engine → ready/error/progress), and `ready` flips only when\nthe model is loaded. The mesh tool is registered (and the cap descriptor\nexposed) only after warmup, so a peer never advertises asr.transcribe /\ntts.synthesize it can''t yet serve. Everything downstream already keyed off\n`ready`, so it auto-corrects.\n\n- engines: onProgress → transformers.js/kokoro-js progress_callback.\n- worker/ttsWorker + clients: warmup(onProgress) protocol (id-correlated).\n- useSpeechHost/useTtsHost/useMoonshineTranscriber: ready=model-warm, +\n  loading/progress/error; descriptor gated on ready.\n- UI: \"loading model… N%\" on the host toggles, \"loading speech model…\"\n  tooltips, \"loading models…\" conversation notice, live wake-ear progress.\n\nBuilds green: core/react/speech, speech 41/41 (+13 warmup tests), react\n124/124, chat tsc + vite.","tree":{"sha":"83be169fba3fed8d53c15a8f9fe4aeaf2463eaf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/83be169fba3fed8d53c15a8f9fe4aeaf2463eaf1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/47582c00f6c7b00970698f66b0dcc928ac94542f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.