n001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(chat): add Qwen3-235B-A22B MoE as a model channel\n\nAdds the published HF layer-package (wdunn001/legion-qwen3-235b-layer-package,\n94 layers, activation_width=4096, CORS-verified) as another CHAT_CHANNELS entry\n— surfaces automatically in ModelChannelPicker and drives resolveChatModelConfig\n+ communal hosting. MoE is handled natively by the runtime (per-tensor VRAM\nbuffers, VRAM→WASM-heap→OPFS tiering); the mesh spreads 94 layers across\ndesktop-class hosts, phones drive.","tree":{"sha":"3de6290ab3c65361fa488accf70310684fe1c64d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/3de6290ab3c65361fa488accf70310684fe1c64d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/2d397c5563b8bab2cf835745b5684c27d11dd3c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/2d397c5563b8bab2cf835745b5684c27d11dd3c2","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDJkMzk3YzU1NjNiOGJhYjJjZjgzNTc0NWI1Njg0YzI3ZDExZGQzYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/2ca7675038c57d1d5605f65189cf98a82fcb5aa6","sha":"2ca7675038c57d1d5605f65189cf98a82fcb5aa6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/2ca7675038c57d1d5605f65189cf98a82fcb5aa6"}],"sha":"2d397c5563b8bab2cf835745b5684c27d11dd3c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/2d397c5563b8bab2cf835745b5684c27d11dd3c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/9b7f35d0bcc3cc559eca5e054ed3eeebec56c048/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T00:07:45Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T00:07:45Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(speech): rolling/chunked TTS — speak long replies, start sooner\n\nA whole reply overflowed Kokoro-82M''s ~510-token context (the synthesize\ncall truncated/failed). Now split into sentence-sized chunks and pipeline\nthem:\n- splitForTts(text, 200): sentence → clause → word-boundary greedy packer,\n  never mid-word, each chunk safely under the limit. 6 tests.\n- useTtsSpeaker: composes useTtsClient + useAudioPlayback; synthesizes\n  chunks ONE AT A TIME (a single engine isn''t re-entrant) but does NOT\n  await playback before the next synth — so chunk i+1 synthesizes while\n  chunk i plays (first audio after ~one sentence, not the whole reply).\n  Each chunk stays a normal tts.synthesize tool call, so it works local\n  or over the mesh unchanged.\n- useAudioPlayback.stopAndClear(): generation-counter flush so queued\n  clips skip on stop (kept stop() semantics intact for other callers).\n- ChatPane: speak button uses the speaker; clicking 🔊 on the speaking\n  message toggles stop (⏹).\n\nBuilds green: core/react/speech, speech 21/21 (+6 split tests), chat tsc\n+ vite build.","tree":{"sha":"e4698d5f3784c56c9096383a6ba7078868bf6c5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/e4698d5f3784c56c9096383a6ba7078868bf6c5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/9b7f35d0bcc3cc559eca5e054ed3eeebec56c048","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"http