s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/cfc8419e61a939692890646db6a6b6008ef2d464/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T23:39:16Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T23:39:16Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(chat): speak the explanation, not the markup — TTS text sanitizer\n\nTTS was reading everything literally — code blocks, backticks, markdown\nsyntax, URLs — which is unbearable for coding answers. Add toSpeakableText:\nstrip fenced code blocks (incl. unterminated/streaming), <think> blocks,\nimages, link URLs (keep labels), inline-code backticks, bare URLs,\nheading/list/blockquote/table/emphasis markup; collapse to prose. The\nspeak button now synthesizes that instead of the raw reply, and says a\nshort note aloud when a reply is code-only (nothing to read).\n\nDeterministic + model-agnostic — no chat-template/token cost. 6 unit\ntests; chat tsc clean, 143/143 chat tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"f9ce30ea8db2397685f654015a562e22b0c3387d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/f9ce30ea8db2397685f654015a562e22b0c3387d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/cfc8419e61a939692890646db6a6b6008ef2d464","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/cfc8419e61a939692890646db6a6b6008ef2d464","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKGNmYzg0MTllNjFhOTM5NjkyODkwNjQ2ZGI2YTZiNjAwOGVmMmQ0NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/982e9a39b1cae0e15867bdc15834464217b1c59a","sha":"982e9a39b1cae0e15867bdc15834464217b1c59a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/982e9a39b1cae0e15867bdc15834464217b1c59a"}],"sha":"cfc8419e61a939692890646db6a6b6008ef2d464","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/cfc8419e61a939692890646db6a6b6008ef2d464"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/982e9a39b1cae0e15867bdc15834464217b1c59a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T23:14:47Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T23:14:47Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(speech): Kokoro TTS as a browser mesh capability (talk-and-hear)\n\nAdd text-to-speech as the reverse-direction twin of the ASR capability,\n100% browser-hosted via kokoro-js (Kokoro-82M ONNX on the transformers.js\nalready in the tree — no new runtime). Same mesh pattern: a peer advertises\n`tts.synthesize` + the tool; askers resolve it local-first or to any roster\npeer, over the existing tc bus. No native/bridge tool — browser-hostable\nper the rule.\n\n- mesh-core: TtsSynthesizeArgs/Content contract (TTS_SKILL/TTS_TOOL_NAME\n  were already reserved).\n- @unstable-legion/speech: TtsEngine iface, kokoroEngine (webgpu/fp32 →\n  wasm/q8, HF-primary/CDN-fallback sourcing), ttsWorker (model only —\n  NO WebAudio, per the ASR decode-in-worker lesson), ttsWorkerClient\n  (WAV-encodes the raw PCM on the main thread), wavEncode, ttsTool, 8 tests.\n- mesh-react: useTtsHost, useTtsClient, useAudioPlayback (shared\n  AudioContext, gapless serial queue, resume-on-gesture).\n- apps/chat: \"🔊 Host text-to-speech\" toggle + a 🔊 speak button on each\n  assistant message (local-first or via a mesh TTS peer). Manual speak\n  only — auto-speak/wake/VAD are later increments.\n\nBuilds/tests green: core 255/255, speech 15/15 (7 ASR + 8 TTS), chat tsc\n+ vite build. base64-over-tc framing (binary Codec LatentFrame = phase 2).","tree":{"sha":"7628ae4ce3f26f46f4ea03195c02c1a4020cf58a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/7628ae4ce3f26f46f4ea03195c02c1a4020cf58a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/982e9a39b1cae0e15867bdc15834464217b1c59a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/982e9a39b1cae0e15867bdc15834464217b1c59a","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDk4MmU5YTM5YjFjYWUwZTE1ODY3YmRjMTU4MzQ0NjQyMTdiMWM1OWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/455bbca78395e96c560f45f85a725354c4c20249","sha":"455bbca78395e96c560f45f85a725354c4c20249","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/455bbca78395e96c560f45f85a725354c4c20249"}],"sha":"982e9a39b1cae0e15867bdc15834464217b1c59a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/982e9a39b1cae0e15867bdc15834464217b1c59a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/455bbca78395e96c560f45f85a725354c4c20249/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T20:23:43Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T20:23:43Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(speech): robust transcribe — copy PCM, guard empty audio, drop timestamps\n\n\"Transcription failed: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading\n''length'')\" came from transformers.js reading `audio.length` on an\nundefined/degenerate input. Harden the path:\n- workerClient posts the PCM as a structured-clone COPY instead of\n  transferring pcm.buffer — removes any transfer edge case that could\n  leave the worker''s view detached.\n- whisperEngine guards a non-Float32Array / empty PCM with a clear error\n  (\"no audio samples… clip may be empty/too short\") instead of letting it\n  surface as the opaque transformers ''length'' error.\n- drop `return_timestamps: true` (whisper''s timestamp decode is fragile\n  and voice-input only needs text); defensive text extraction.\n- more [legion-speech] logging (sample count in/out, timing).\n\nspeech build + 7/7 tests green.","tree":{"sha":"96438fba931f49af4c02562c5db56ffe6dd17198","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/96438fba931f49af4c02562c5db56ffe6dd17198"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/455bbca78395e96c560f45f85a725354c4c20249","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/455bbca78395e96c560f45f85a725354c4c20249","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDQ1NWJiY2E3ODM5NWU5NmM1NjBmNDVmODVhNzI1MzU0YzRjMjAyNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/0900966f239a706e814f328328c8b06d48b36c6d","sha":"0900966f239a706e814f328328c8b06d48b36c6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/0900966f239a706e814f328328c8b06d48b36c6d"}],"sha":"455bbca78395e96c560f45f85a725354c4c20249","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/455bbca78395e96c560f45f85a725354c4c20249"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/0900966f239a706e814f328328c8b06d48b36c6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T19:54:22Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T19:54:22Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(speech): decode audio on the main thread, not in the worker\n\nThe transcribe path threw \"AudioContext is not available in this context\"\non every attempt: worker.ts called decodeToPcm() INSIDE the Web Worker,\nbut AudioContext (WebAudio''s decoder) is a Window-only API — it doesn''t\nexist in a DedicatedWorker, so decoding raw bytes there always failed.\nThe audioDecode module doc already called this out; the wiring just did\nthe opposite of what it prescribed.\n\nMove the decode into SpeechWorkerClient.transcribe (main thread, where\nAudioContext exists); the worker now receives already-decoded 16kHz mono\nPCM (transferred, no copy) and only runs the Whisper engine. The worker\nprotocol carries pcm+sampleRate instead of audioBase64+mimeType.\n\nAlso add [legion-speech] diagnostic logging across the pipeline (mic\ncapture, client decode, worker transcribe, engine device/model-source\nselection) — the path was previously silent, so failures were invisible.\n\nspeech build + 7/7 tests green; react build green.","tree":{"sha":"835774c3ce5c141f34edbaaf246cd21a198d80bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/835774c3ce5c141f34edbaaf246cd21a198d80bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/0900966f239a706e814f328328c8b06d48b36c6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/0900966f239a706e814f328328c8b06d48b36c6d","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDA5MDA5NjZmMjM5YTcwNmU4MTRmMzI4MzI4YzhiMDZkNDhiMzZjNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/93c712eb039b7cf4fe9c067bb7f12219986d02fd","sha":"93c712eb039b7cf4fe9c067bb7f12219986d02fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/93c712eb039b7cf4fe9c067bb7f12219986d02fd"}],"sha":"0900966f239a706e814f328328c8b06d48b36c6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/0900966f239a706e814f328328c8b06d48b36c6d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/93c712eb039b7cf4fe9c067bb7f12219986d02fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T19:23:17Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T19:23:17Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"build(deps): resolve @codecai/* from published npm (0.5.0), not local file: checkout\n\nThe @codecai/{web,web-safety,web-llm} packages are published to the public\nnpm registry by the codec project''s CI/CD. mesh-core pinned them as\n`file:../../codec-local/packages/*`, which depends on a local codec\nworking-tree that is fragile (its source had been wiped locally, blocking\nevery build). Point them at the published `^0.5.0` instead — reproducible,\nno local codec checkout required, and the version matches what the file:\ntree carried.\n\nRegenerates package-lock: @codecai now resolves from registry.npmjs.org\nwith prebuilt dist; the codec-local packages'' build-time dep trees (babel\ntoolchain etc.) drop out since we consume prebuilt, not rebuild.\n\nVerified against v0.1.2: core 255/255, speech 7/7, mesh-react build, chat\ntsc --noEmit clean, chat vite build all green.","tree":{"sha":"8598bae52dc8000b8e4fadc95434a821d0464380","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/8598bae52dc8000b8e4fadc95434a821d0464380"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/93c712eb039b7cf4fe9c067bb7f12219986d02fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/93c712eb039b7cf4fe9c067bb7f12219986d02fd","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDkzYzcxMmViMDM5YjdjZjRmZTljMDY3YmI3ZjEyMjE5OTg2ZDAyZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/55e2b8d25efb4784a6e8c795c6db365af67200bb","sha":"55e2b8d25efb4784a6e8c795c6db365af67200bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/55e2b8d25efb4784a6e8c795c6db365af67200bb"}],"sha":"93c712eb039b7cf4fe9c067bb7f12219986d02fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/93c712eb039b7cf4fe9c067bb7f12219986d02fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/55e2b8d25efb4784a6e8c795c6db365af67200bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T18:52:54Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T18:52:54Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"Merge tag ''v0.1.2'' into feat/speech-mesh-poc\n\nv0.1.2 — deploy-visibility + diagnostics fixes\n\nSince v0.1.1 (621e0fd):\n  518a186  serve /wasm/ Cache-Control:no-cache, not immutable (#62) — a\n           fixed-URL wasm marked immutable made every wasm rebuild invisible\n           to browsers until a full cache clear (masked #53/#57 deploys). Now\n           revalidates via ETag; future wasm deploys land on a normal reload.\n  78f3761  log every stage-worker dispose+terminate (#56) — proved the\n           supersede/reload path DISPOSES correctly (not a leak); pure\n           instrumentation.\n  c208f71  threadStore reopens IndexedDB on close (#59) — no more\n           InvalidStateError / lost conversation saves under storage pressure.\n  6c5dc65  stop the false ''DROPPED unknown sessionId'' warning (#55) — it was\n           the benign multi-engine broadcast filter-miss, not the slowness.\n\nPairs with legion-stage-runtime v0.1.2 (wasm dde809e7). Live: Qwen3-8B full\n7.6GB VRAM / 29 tok/s on a 2080 Ti; monolithic load path (incremental #47\nstill opt-in and unfinished).\n\n# Conflicts:\n#\tapps/chat/src/App.tsx\n#\tapps/chat/src/components/MeshSidebar.tsx","tree":{"sha":"c4fd37e82c675788f0a51623c06d1565e193ce53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/c4fd37e82c675788f0a51623c06d1565e193ce53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/55e2b8d25efb4784a6e8c795c6db365af67200bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/55e2b8d25efb4784a6e8c795c6db365af67200bb","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDU1ZTJiOGQyNWVmYjQ3ODRhNmU4Yzc5NWM2ZGIzNjVhZjY3MjAwYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/18c1fdb2f651e75365ba0dadebeef9e3d468c4a9","sha":"18c1fdb2f651e75365ba0dadebeef9e3d468c4a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/18c1fdb2f651e75365ba0dadebeef9e3d468c4a9"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/518a186e99aa71483318ee47cf6000d44a554f1d","sha":"518a186e99aa71483318ee47cf6000d44a554f1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/518a186e99aa71483318ee47cf6000d44a554f1d"}],"sha":"55e2b8d25efb4784a6e8c795c6db365af67200bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/55e2b8d25efb4784a6e8c795c6db365af67200bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/518a186e99aa71483318ee47cf6000d44a554f1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T14:25:27Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T14:25:27Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(deploy): serve /wasm/ no-cache, not immutable — wasm deploys were invisible\n\nlegion-stage.wasm has a fixed URL but its content changes on every rebuild.\nServing it ''public, immutable'' (30d) meant browsers never revalidated — even\non Ctrl+Shift+R — so a new wasm was silently ignored until a full cache clear.\nThis masked wasm deploys all through the #53/#57 work (server served the new\nbinary; the browser ran the old one). Switch /wasm/ to Cache-Control:no-cache\nso the ETag is checked each load (304 when unchanged, full bytes only on a\nreal change). Content-hashing the wasm filename later would let it be\nimmutable again (#62).","tree":{"sha":"e1ed5ebca8df7356fad68fdcbec8404f8a7cedb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/e1ed5ebca8df7356fad68fdcbec8404f8a7cedb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/518a186e99aa71483318ee47cf6000d44a554f1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/518a186e99aa71483318ee47cf6000d44a554f1d","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDUxOGExODZlOTlhYTcxNDgzMzE4ZWU0N2NmNjAwMGQ0NGE1NTRmMWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/78f37610aa953e3e7ed5149d9a6f240a9bc91c12","sha":"78f37610aa953e3e7ed5149d9a6f240a9bc91c12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/78f37610aa953e3e7ed5149d9a6f240a9bc91c12"}],"sha":"518a186e99aa71483318ee47cf6000d44a554f1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/518a186e99aa71483318ee47cf6000d44a554f1d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/78f37610aa953e3e7ed5149d9a6f240a9bc91c12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T13:30:30Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T13:30:30Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"chore(mesh): log every stage-worker dispose+terminate (prove/disprove #56 leak)\n\nInstrumentation only, no logic change. The three dispose paths — the reload/\nsupersede path (useStageHost disposeWorker), the resident-teardown path\n(useStageHost disposeResident), and the driver''s own resident stage-0\n(useCommunalChat disposeResidentStageZero) — now emit a range-tagged\n''DISPOSING … + terminate()'' line. dispose() already calls worker.terminate()\n(frees the WebGPU context), but none of these logged, so an existing capture\nshowing N constructs / 0 disposes could NOT distinguish a real leaked context\nfrom a silent-but-correct disposal. With this, a claim-resize reload log shows\nconstruct-vs-dispose balance directly: constructs > disposes proves+locates a\nleak; balanced means the VRAM is the by-design 2-context solo + oversized\ncompute buffers (#57), not a leak.","tree":{"sha":"13ce8656c02f9a98919ff7ef288a809705a71628","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/13ce8656c02f9a98919ff7ef288a809705a71628"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/78f37610aa953e3e7ed5149d9a6f240a9bc91c12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/78f37610aa953e3e7ed5149d9a6f240a9bc91c12","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDc4ZjM3NjEwYWE5NTNlM2U3ZWQ1MTQ5ZDlhNmYyNDBhOWJjOTFjMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/c208f71f365c1c23bd8e965d97df6d449d0cb181","sha":"c208f71f365c1c23bd8e965d97df6d449d0cb181","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c208f71f365c1c23bd8e965d97df6d449d0cb181"}],"sha":"78f37610aa953e3e7ed5149d9a6f240a9bc91c12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/78f37610aa953e3e7ed5149d9a6f240a9bc91c12"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c208f71f365c1c23bd8e965d97df6d449d0cb181/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T13:15:18Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T13:15:18Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(chat): reopen IndexedDB on close instead of reusing a dead connection\n\nopenDb() cached the connection forever with no onclose/onversionchange\nhandler, so once the browser closed the IDB connection — which it does under\nstorage pressure (the disk-full condition hit during testing) — every\nputThread threw ''InvalidStateError: The database connection is closing'' and\nconversations stopped saving until a reload. clearDbCache() now nulls the\ncached promise/instance on close/versionchange/error, and a withStore()\nhelper reopens+retries once on InvalidStateError. All four ops route through\nit. 7 threadStore tests pass; typecheck clean.","tree":{"sha":"48e1c0a604d7b4a27da74f878e29bbf20f6447cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/48e1c0a604d7b4a27da74f878e29bbf20f6447cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/c208f71f365c1c23bd8e965d97df6d449d0cb181","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/c208f71f365c1c23bd8e965d97df6d449d0cb181","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKGMyMDhmNzFmMzY1YzFjMjNiZDhlOTY1ZDk3ZGY2ZDQ0OWQwY2IxODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/6c5dc65ccc177d74641c37ee2b8c841fee4d8ee1","sha":"6c5dc65ccc177d74641c37ee2b8c841fee4d8ee1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/6c5dc65ccc177d74641c37ee2b8c841fee4d8ee1"}],"sha":"c208f71f365c1c23bd8e965d97df6d449d0cb181","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c208f71f365c1c23bd8e965d97df6d449d0cb181"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/6c5dc65ccc177d74641c37ee2b8c841fee4d8ee1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T13:14:57Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T13:14:57Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(mesh): stop logging a false DROPPED warning for other engines'' frames\n\npeer.onStageFrame broadcasts every inbound frame to ALL listeners, so a tab\nrunning both the body-host engine (useStageHost) and the stage-0 serve engine\n(localStageServeEngine) — the solo whole-model / serveFirstStage case — sees\nthe sibling engine''s frames, plus its own selfId loopback frames. A sessionId\nabsent from an engine''s own map is a filter-miss, not an error, but both\nengines logged ''onStageFrame DROPPED — unknown sessionId'' once per token. In\nsolo self-host that spammed the console and read like the cause of slow\ngeneration (it is not — tokens are produced normally by the owning engine).\nReturn silently for an unknown sessionId; keep the malformed-envelope and\nspoofed-sender warnings, which are real. Cosmetic, but misleading logs cost\nreal diagnosis time.","tree":{"sha":"6d7620a846535a1789b934a997fb8795c9e49cb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/6d7620a846535a1789b934a997fb8795c9e49cb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/6c5dc65ccc177d74641c37ee2b8c841fee4d8ee1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"a