nn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/621e0fd901623a2eeb40a4873b7d0ef15aa6a89b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T14:43:10Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T14:43:10Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(chat): drop the web manifest so the app stops being a PWA\n\nselfDestroying only retires the service worker. vite-plugin-pwa still\nemitted manifest.webmanifest and injected its <link>, so Chrome continued\ntreating the site as an installable PWA and an already-installed copy kept\nlaunching standalone with its own storage. manifest: false stops it being\nemitted or linked. The self-destroying SW stays, to unregister workers that\nare already out there.","tree":{"sha":"de0dec4e656093e7914026355a0214adc14867cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/de0dec4e656093e7914026355a0214adc14867cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/621e0fd901623a2eeb40a4873b7d0ef15aa6a89b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gist