01","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/f0c91c9f76452ad63a844d6b99dec60f7b4dad76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T11:28:59Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T11:28:59Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(chat): add Qwen3-32B channel\n\nSlicing + HF upload already done (wdunn001/legion-model-qwen3-32b, 68 files/\n20.2GB committed). Wire it into CHAT_CHANNELS: 64 layers, nEmbd 5120, untied\nembeddings, ~320MB/layer, loads from HF (manifest + fragments CORS-verified,\naccess-control-allow-origin:*). Heavy (~20GB) — expect to split across several\npeers or load from a local folder; solo-on-one-tab unproven. Default stays 8B.","tree":{"sha":"f3ff34090bb14b189750b069afb6a612a3fd8f63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/f3ff34090bb14b189750b069afb6a612a3fd8f63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/f0c91c9f76452ad63a844d6b99dec60f7b4dad76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/f0c91c9f76452ad63a844d6b99dec60f7b4dad76","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKGYwYzkxYzlmNzY0NTJhZDYzYTg0NGQ2Yjk5ZGVjNjBmN2I0ZGFkNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/22e2df1a68dc93d15d4f3fdfff1bd23e30fc2df0","sha":"22e2df1a68dc93d15d4f3fdfff1bd23e30fc2df0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/22e2df1a68dc93d15d4f3fdfff1bd23e30fc2df0"}],"sha":"f0c91c9f76452ad63a844d6b99dec60f7b4dad76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/f0c91c9f76452ad63a844d6b99dec60f7b4dad76"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/22e2df1a68dc93d15d4f3fdfff1bd23e30fc2df0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T11:05:05Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T11:05:05Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(chat): load model layers from a local folder (checksum-verified)\n\nBring-your-own-model: point the app at a local clone of the model package\n(HF repo / .88 slices) via the File System Access API and load layer\nfragments from disk instead of downloading — no multi-GB fetch, persisted\nacross visits (IndexedDB-remembered handle).\n\nSECURITY / trust model: the folder supplies BYTES ONLY. The manifest and\nevery fragment''s sha256 still come exclusively from the remote source\n(resolveChatModelConfig().manifestUrl — HF + mirror), never the folder.\nLocal bytes flow through loadStage''s existing fetchImpl seam into\nstage-runtime''s unmodified fetchAndCacheFragment, which hashes them against\nthe remote-sourced sha256 and THROWS on mismatch — a corrupt/tampered local\nlayer fails closed, never loads. Proven end-to-end in localFolderFetch.test\n(good bytes pass, tampered bytes rejected via the REAL fetchAndCacheFragment).\nA missing local file falls back to the network (partial folders work).\n\ncreateLocalFolderFetch(dirHandle) + fragmentRelativePath; localFolderHandle\nthreaded through the load protocol -> stageWorker -> loadStage.fetchImpl and\nthe useCommunalChat/useCommunalHost proactive-load paths. useModelFolder hook\n(picker + IndexedDB persist + permission re-verify) + ModelFolderPanel UI;\nChrome/Edge-gated, download stays the default. No legion-stage-runtime change.","tree":{"sha":"df343e72e4a5ba4223fcf60212946f44566d1556","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/df343e72e4a5ba4223fcf60212946f44566d1556"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/22e2df1a68dc93d15d4f3fdfff1bd23e30fc2df0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/22e2df1a68dc93d15d4f3fdfff1bd23e30fc2df0","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDIyZTJkZjFhNjhkYzkzZDE1ZDRmM2ZkZmZmMWJkMjNlMzBmYzJkZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/12fe00589d9d74dd224d398d914a5543ffa5c8d4","sha":"12fe00589d9d74dd224d398d914a5543ffa5c8d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/12fe00589d9d74dd224d398d914a5543ffa5c8d4"}],"sha":"22e2df1a68dc93d15d4f3fdfff1bd23e30fc2df0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/22e2df1a68dc93d15d4f3fdfff1bd23e30fc2df0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/12fe00589d9d74dd224d398d914a5543ffa5c8d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T10:27:40Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T10:27:40Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(ui): GPU-name detection prefers WebGL renderer; clamp layers-of; drop false note\n\n- GPU VRAM auto-detect still over-reported (11GB 2080 Ti -> 17.7GB) because\n  the catalog clamp never fired: deriveGpuName returned bare ''nvidia turing''\n  (Chromium/Edge redact adapter.info to vendor+architecture) which matches no\n  catalog entry. Prefer the WebGL UNMASKED_RENDERER (''…RTX 2080 Ti…'') over\n  vendor+architecture so matchGpuCatalog hits and the clamp applies. Exported\n  deriveGpuName + tests (incl. the Edge redaction case).\n- ''Layers to host'' showed ''38 of 34'' after switching 14B->8B: the display used\n  the raw persisted override. Clamp the shown/slider value to the current\n  model''s communal layer count (stored value left intact for switching back).\n- Dropped the ''Prefer ONE tab … ~3.3GB disk cache and one GPU'' note — the\n  3.3GB/failure-domain framing was inaccurate.\n- Documented the host/driver/serve-stage-0 roles + why stage 0 loads lazily\n  (docs/OPTIONAL-STAGE0.md); deferred the always-eager/split-toggle idea.","tree":{"sha":"eb33c3ca9c3d9fdb4a335710ccf625501dbc1f77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/eb33c3ca9c3d9fdb4a335710ccf625501dbc1f77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/12fe00589d9d74dd224d398d914a5543ffa5c8d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/12fe00589d9d74dd224d398d914a5543ffa5c8d4","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDEyZmUwMDU4OWQ5ZDc0ZGQyMjRkMzk4ZDkxNGE1NTQzZmZhNWM4ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/fd0346ef339c21af53ff6316f957d4459f8cd8f1","sha":"fd0346ef339c21af53ff6316f957d4459f8cd8f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/fd0346ef339c21af53ff6316f957d4459f8cd8f1"}],"sha":"12fe00589d9d74dd224d398d914a5543ffa5c8d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/12fe00589d9d74dd224d398d914a5543ffa5c8d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/fd0346ef339c21af53ff6316f957d4459f8cd8f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T09:56:19Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T09:56:19Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"revert-forward: keep eager resident stage-0 — 8B breakage was transient GPU state\n\nConfirmed live: the 8B host stall + ''state changed since read from disk'' was a\nWebGPU device wedged by repeated 14B OOM/abort cycles, NOT the eager-load — a\nbrowser restart cleared it and 8B loads cleanly with the eager path on. So the\nprior commit''s removal was the wrong call; restore the eager-load (prod never\nlost it — that removal was never deployed). Added a KNOWN FRAGILITY note: it\nraces the body-host WebGPU load and can wedge under an already-stressed GPU;\nreal hardening = serialize behind the host load (tracked, not urgent).","tree":{"sha":"2a98c75edc8e26f745d867a93e4d23f2b6508b80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/2a98c75edc8e26f745d867a93e4d23f2b6508b80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/fd0346ef339c21af53ff6316f957d4459f8cd8f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/fd0346ef339c21af53ff6316f957d4459f8cd8f1","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKGZkMDM0NmVmMzM5YzIxYWY1M2ZmNjMxNmY5NTdkNDQ1OWY4Y2Q4ZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/30d7b11bb8a5fe8ef7fe57c2d5d70dc9e0085483","sha":"30d7b11bb8a5fe8ef7fe57c2d5d70dc9e0085483","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/30d7b11bb8a5fe8ef7fe57c2d5d70dc9e0085483"}],"sha":"fd0346ef339c21af53ff6316f957d4459f8cd8f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/fd0346ef339c21af53ff6316f957d4459f8cd8f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/30d7b11bb8a5fe8ef7fe57c2d5d70dc9e0085483/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T09:49:42Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T09:49:42Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(chat): drop eager resident stage-0 load — it raced the host load\n\nThe eager-load effect (29e2340) fired a second wasm worker to load\n[0,driverLayers) the moment ''Serve the first stage'' was on, while a capable\npeer''s body-host worker ([driverLayers,totalLayers)) was ALSO loading. Two\nwasm modules requesting the WebGPU device concurrently failed the stage-0\nload (''state had changed since it was read from disk'') AND stalled the body\nhost''s download (0 shards, 90s watchdog) — regressing the working 8B host.\nRevert to lazy resident-stage-0 load (ensureResidentStageZero on first chat,\nafter the body host is up), never racing. A future eager warm-up must\nserialize behind the host load, not spawn a competing worker.","tree":{"sha":"d4364c19f50ab94d25a254c6c2284f5d09f31abc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/d4364c19f50ab94d25a254c6c2284f5d09f31abc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/30d7b11bb8a5fe8ef7fe57c2d5d70dc9e0085483","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/30d7b11bb8a5fe8ef7fe57c2d5d70dc9e0085483","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDMwZDdiMTFiYjhhNWZlOGVmN2ZlNTdjMmQ1ZDcwZGM5ZTAwODU0ODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/1e1fda1fd34f4fe6ce70edd7c580bc0494c6ca3f","sha":"1e1fda1fd34f4fe6ce70edd7c580bc0494c6ca3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/1e1fda1fd34f4fe6ce70edd7c580bc0494c6ca3f"}],"sha":"30d7b11bb8a5fe8ef7fe57c2d5d70dc9e0085483","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/30d7b11bb8a5fe8ef7fe57c2d5d70dc9e0085483"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/18c1fdb2f651e75365ba0dadebeef9e3d468c4a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T04:57:02Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T04:57:02Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(chat): ASR voice input — speak into the composer (Phase 1)\n\nBring the speech capability into the deployed chat app as voice INPUT:\na mic button in the composer records, transcribes via Whisper, and drops\nthe text into the input (you send it as a normal message — no auto-send,\nno TTS, no LLM-loop change; those are later phases).\n\nTranscription runs locally when this tab hosts ASR, otherwise it routes\nto a mesh peer advertising `asr.transcribe` — same local-first resolution\n`useSpeechClient` uses. A \"Host speech-to-text (uses your GPU)\" toggle in\nthe tool-contribution panel lets a GPU tab offer transcription to the\nmesh; when on, the tab advertises ASR_SKILL + the `transcribe` tool in its\ncap and serves inbound calls via the existing useMeshTools path.\n\nPlugs into the chat app''s tool-contribution system (registry + optedIn +\ncap) that landed on main — no new mesh machinery. vite.config: `worker:\n{format:''es''}` (code-split the lazy-transformers speech worker, matching\napps/demo) and exclude onnxruntime-web''s ~21MB wasm from the PWA precache\n(fetched at runtime on ASR-host-enable, like gguf/webllm).\n\nBuilds/tests green: core 255/255, speech 7/7, chat tsc + vite build.\nBrowser mic/mesh verification per packages/speech-engines/MANUAL-TEST.md.","tree":{"sha":"963bf9b6f8216c318f1e71efa133767df1ab76d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/963bf9b6f8216c318f1e71efa133767df1ab76d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/18c1fdb2f651e75365ba0dadebeef9e3d468c4a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/18c1fdb2f651e75365ba0dadebeef9e3d468c4a9","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDE4YzFmZGIyZjY1MWU3NTM2NWJhMGRhZGViZWVmOWUzZDQ2OGM0YTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/2f58e4a735cc6240ff2ac0f27c8e58593536b333","sha":"2f58e4a735cc6240ff2ac0f27c8e58593536b333","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/2f58e4a735cc6240ff2ac0f27c8e58593536b333"}],"sha":"18c1fdb2f651e75365ba0dadebeef9e3d468c4a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/18c1fdb2f651e75365ba0dadebeef9e3d468c4a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/1e1fda1fd34f4fe6ce70edd7c580bc0494c6ca3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T04:37:48Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T04:37:48Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(host): monotonic download progress + shard-based layer counter\n\nTwo download-progress bugs, both from parallel out-of-order shard loading:\n- The loader fetches shards concurrently and reports each completion by its\n  1-based INDEX with a prefix-by-index byte sum (assumes all lower shards\n  done). Out-of-order completion (shard 6 finishes before 1) made the raw\n  numbers bounce — 990MB then 6MB — rolling the UI bar BACKWARD (12%->5%).\n  Rebuild progress monotonically in useStageHost from the SET of completed\n  shard indices + their real sizes (req.shardBytes); a set only grows.\n- assembledLayerCount scaled the ''X of N layers'' counter by the BYTE\n  fraction, which lags the shard count (huge embeddings/output shards skew\n  it) — so it read one behind the console (''4 of 38'' vs shard 5). Scale by\n  the shard fraction instead; the bar % stays byte-based.","tree":{"sha":"cef177ba67c9c8b9c380ebe3f41b473d34324b9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/cef177ba67c9c8b9c380ebe3f41b473d34324b9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/1e1fda1fd34f4fe6ce70edd7c580bc0494c6ca3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","sub