g_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/29e23406461c93b48271e7fb118ab988eb54a449/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T03:12:17Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T03:12:17Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(serve): eager-load resident stage-0 + strip stop token from thin output\n\nTwo thin-client regressions from the live phone run:\n- Eager-load the resident stage-0 the moment ''Serve the first stage'' is on,\n  instead of lazily on this peer''s first chat. residentStageZeroRef (and thus\n  useLocalStageServe''s advertisement) only goes non-null after load+warm-up,\n  so eager loading also stops this peer being advertised as a stage-0 host\n  before the weights are in VRAM — a driver no longer routes here then waits\n  out a cold [0,driverLayers) download.\n- Don''t fold the EOG stop token (ChatML <|im_end|>) into the detokenized\n  text on the final host — it''s a control signal, and detokenizing it leaked\n  the literal ''<|im_end|>'' into thin-client output. Fixed in both the\n  useStageHost final branch and localStageServeEngine''s parity branch.","tree":{"sha":"fa4ee42177367f01f65cee35f4d0943c166ce04b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/fa4ee42177367f01f65cee35f4d0943c166ce04b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/29e23406461c93b48271e7fb118ab988eb54a449","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/29e23406461c93b48271e7fb118ab988eb54a449","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDI5ZTIzNDA2NDYxYzkzYjQ4MjcxZTdmYjExOGFiOTg4ZWI1NGE0NDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/fef036e0508a64ec773016325bc9276dfe735657","sha":"fef036e0508a64ec773016325bc9276dfe735657","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/fef036e0508a64ec773016325bc9276dfe735657"}],"sha":"29e23406461c93b48271e7fb118ab988eb54a449","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/29e23406461c93b48271e7fb118ab988eb54a449"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/fef036e0508a64ec773016325bc9276dfe735657/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T02:55:26Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T02:55:26Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(mesh): crew scale line + per-segment host counts in Who''s-hosting\n\nThe topology bar named only candidates[0] per layer-range, hiding every\nother host — a segment can be served by many redundant peers. Add:\n- a ''N hosts · M full copies · K seats · your crew'' aggregate (deriveCrewScale):\n  distinct discovered hosts (self excluded), redundant complete copies\n  (min per-segment host count, 0 on a gap), and bottleneck seat capacity.\n- per-segment hostCount with a ''+N'' badge so a range served by several peers\n  shows it instead of pretending one host owns it.\nScoped to discovered peers (''your crew''); a global census is a separate item.","tree":{"sha":"3f67519c24151e4257f81cb788cba1a39c903b32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/3f67519c24151e4257f81cb788cba1a39c903b32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/fef036e0508a64ec773016325bc9276dfe735657","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/fef036e0508a64ec773016325bc9276dfe735657","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKGZlZjAzNmUwNTA4YTY0ZWM3NzMwMTYzMjViYzkyNzZkZmU3MzU2NTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/f896ca776e7c05f61adc60c16050be47a5ed79b4","sha":"f896ca776e7c05f61adc60c16050be47a5ed79b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/f896ca776e7c05f61adc60c16050be47a5ed79b4"}],"sha":"fef036e0508a64ec773016325bc9276dfe735657","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/fef036e0508a64ec773016325bc9276dfe735657"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/f896ca776e7c05f61adc60c16050be47a5ed79b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T02:24:34Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T02:24:34Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(serve): forward the isFirst stage''s embedded tokens, not null frame.tokens\n\nA text-relay thin driver ships promptText and no tokens, so the served\nisFirst stage tokenizes server-side into the local `tokens` var. The relay\nforward encoded `frame.tokens` (null) instead, reading .length on null and\nfreeing the session (surfacing on the phone as a failed generation). Forward\n[...tokens] so downstream gets the real token count for positions; on decode\nsteps tokens === frame.tokens so the behavior is unchanged there.","tree":{"sha":"9c7cad2a1966c315f253a8c932c453fb77fb11d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/9c7cad2a1966c315f253a8c932c453fb77fb11d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/f896ca776e7c05f61adc60c16050be47a5ed79b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/f896ca776e7c05f61adc60c16050be47a5ed79b4","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKGY4OTZjYTc3NmU3YzA1ZjYxYWRjNjBjMTYwNTBiZTQ3YTVlZDc5YjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/9dff03dba4845f3982a140cbca03ac71b5f3cc30","sha":"9dff03dba4845f3982a140cbca03ac71b5f3cc30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/9dff03dba4845f3982a140cbca03ac71b5f3cc30"}],"sha":"f896ca776e7c05f61adc60c16050be47a5ed79b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/f896ca776e7c05f61adc60c16050be47a5ed79b4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/9dff03dba4845f3982a140cbca03ac71b5f3cc30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T01:29:52Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T01:29:52Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(serve): isFirst served stage embeds tokens, not a dummy activation\n\nThe resident stage-0 serve engine fed a dummyActivationFrame to\nclient.prefill/decode for the isFirst stage. That dummy is only ignored\nby the driver''s fused stage.prefill; the session-based legion_prefill_s\nrejects any activation input (''this stage expects token input, not\nactivation input''), which freed the thin driver''s session and cascaded\nto ''no eligible communal''. isFirst now prefills/decodes with tokens and\nno activation, matching useCommunalChat''s own stage-0 path.","tree":{"sha":"c9aaa3bb70af3061e6ffd9c7405cfaadbd41825c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/c9aaa3bb70af3061e6ffd9c7405cfaadbd41825c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/9dff03dba4845f3982a140cbca03ac71b5f3cc30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/9dff03dba4845f3982a140cbca03ac71b5f3cc30","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDlkZmYwM2RiYTQ4NDVmMzk4MmExNDBjYmNhMDNhYzcxYjVmM2NjMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/50f97283e741fdbb4b26c11432308a7f18bef71e","sha":"50f97283e741fdbb4b26c11432308a7f18bef71e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/50f97283e741fdbb4b26c11432308a7f18bef71e"}],"sha":"9dff03dba4845f3982a140cbca03ac71b5f3cc30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/9dff03dba4845f3982a140cbca03ac71b5f3cc30"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/50f97283e741fdbb4b26c11432308a7f18bef71e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T01:10:39Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T01:10:39Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(mesh): stop infinite render loop when serving a resident stage-0 (React #185)\n\nThe moment a peer adopted its resident stage-0 to serve thin clients, the UI\nwhite-screened with React #185 (max update depth). useStageHost''s cap-publish\neffect had `opts.extraLoadedStages` in its deps AND called setStageHostCap\ninside — and extraLoadedStages is a fresh array identity every render, so:\nrender → effect → setState → render → new array → effect → … forever.\n\nThe effect already reads the live value from a ref, so the dep only needs to\nfire on CONTENT change: key it on a stable JSON signature of the entries\ninstead of the array identity. Also dedupe useLocalStageServe''s\nsetLoadedStageEntry (the engine returns a fresh object each sync; only push\nwhen content actually changed) so the entry identity stays stable. The entry''s\nepoch is per-load (not per-build), so the signature only moves on real events\n(a served session opening/closing). Gated feature; toggle-off path unaffected.","tree":{"sha":"e993b397a354b4ac754cea9b2810a6ff8619891c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/e993b397a354b4ac754cea9b2810a6ff8619891c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/50f97283e741fdbb4b26c11432308a7f18bef71e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/50f97283e741fdbb4b26c11432308a7f18bef71e","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDUwZjk3MjgzZTc0MWZkYmI0YjI2YzExNDMyMzA4YTdmMThiZWY3MWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/fdcd51f36c265d25d9e445da9f3a5b70cd02e48a","sha":"fdcd51f36c265d25d9e445da9f3a5b70cd02e48a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/fdcd51f36c265d25d9e445da9f3a5b70cd02e48a"}],"sha":"50f97283e741fdbb4b26c11432308a7f18bef71e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/50f97283e741fdbb4b26c11432308a7f18bef71e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/fdcd51f36c265d25d9e445da9f3a5b70cd02e48a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T00:53:58Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T00:53:58Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(mesh): reuse a driver''s resident stage-0 to serve thin clients (opt-in)\n\nPhase 1 of the thin-driver host-side: a capable peer can serve its already-\nloaded stage-0 [0,driverLayers) as an isFirst communal stage to thin/text-\nrelay clients, reusing the exact worker it drives with — no second load, so\nthe token_embd class of failure can''t recur (the reused worker already holds\nthe embeddings). Behind a per-host opt-in toggle (\"Serve the first stage\"),\nOFF by default and byte-for-byte unchanged when off.\n\n- useCommunalChat: resident, multi-lane stage-0 (maxSessions=1+N) when the\n  toggle is on; unchanged in-turn load+dispose when off; driver''s own fused\n  chat untouched.\n- localStageServeEngine (new, pure) + useLocalStageServe (new hook): adopted-\n  mode serving — never load/dispose/reset the worker, reuse stageSessionAdmission\n  + the wire codecs; relay-forward copied for Phase 1 (Phase-2 will extract).\n- useStageHost: extraLoadedStages union so ONE peer advertises both its [0,2)\n  and its [2,36) in a single cap (Peer.setCap fully replaces); claimedRangeRef\n  cross-talk guard. Non-serving/body-host peers: cap behavior unchanged.\n- apps/chat: persisted serveFirstStage toggle in the contribution panel.\n\nKnown Phase-1 gap: resident load is lazy (triggered by the peer''s own first\nchat turn) — eager preload is a follow-up. Gated off, so no prod impact until\na user opts in.","tree":{"sha":"bb6e912fef6ee32b6d1c9ad03c77f9cd8978d9df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/bb6e912fef6ee32b6d1c9ad03c77f9cd8978d9df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/fdcd51f36c265d25d9e445da9f3a5b70cd02e48a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/fdcd51f36c265d25d9e445da9f3a5b70cd02e48a","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKGZkY2Q1MWYzNmMyNjVkMjVkOWU0NDVkYTlmM2E1YjcwY2QwMmU0OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/c8532297cc8897b8a6d67b46a5f933a44e72454e","sha":"c8532297cc8897b8a6d67b46a5f933a44e72454e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c8532297cc8897b8a6d67b46a5f933a44e72454e"}],"sha":"fdcd51f36c265d25d9e445da9f3a5b70cd02e48a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/fdcd51f36c265d25d9e445da9f3a5b70cd02e48a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c8532297cc8897b8a6d67b46a5f933a44e72454e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T23:15:43Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T23:15:43Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"revert(chat): disable supportThinDrivers — it regressed the body host (token_embd)\n\nEnabling supportThinDrivers made a host claiming a final-layer range fail to\nload with missing token_embd.weight (tied input/output embeddings — the output\nstage needs the embeddings artifact the fragment resolver omits unless the\nstage is isFirst). Restore the working capable-host behavior; thin clients get\nthe honest ''can''t be served'' notice until the fragment fix + a stage-0-reuse\ndesign land.","tree":{"sha":"acf84a2f7946ca8ca4f41dbba145b1a8eed70185","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/acf84a2f7946ca8ca4f41dbba145b1a8eed70185"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/c8532297cc8897b8a6d67b46a5f933a44e72454e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/c8532297cc8897b8a6d67b46a5f933a44e72454e","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKGM4NTMyMjk3Y2M4ODk3YjhhNmQ2N2I0NmE1ZjkzM2E0NGU3MjQ1NGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/63c215358e69ee1abdc5395005bd8e0907a0e791","sha":"63c215358e69ee1abdc5395005bd8e0907a0e791","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/63c215358e69ee1abdc5395005bd8e0907a0e791"}],"sha":"c8532297cc8897b8a6d67b46a5f933a44e72454e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c8532297cc8897b8a6d67b46a5f933a44e72454e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/63c215358e69ee1abdc5395005bd8e0907a0e791/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T23:04:53Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T23:04:53Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(chat): honest coverage notice for thin clients instead of a false \"assembling\"\n\nA thin/text-relay client hosts no stage, so it can only chat when other\nmembers cover EVERY layer — but it was shown the generic \"isn''t fully\nassembled yet — waiting for hosts to cover every layer\", which implies it''s\njust a matter of time. When there''s no isFirst host on the mesh, that never\nresolves for a thin device: it''s a lie about the state.\n\nderiveChatNotice now takes an isThinDevice flag and, on a coverage error,\ntells a thin device the truth — this device isn''t powerful enough to run a\nstage itself, it depends on other members hosting the whole pipeline (first\nstage included), and the way out is a more powerful device or a capable\nmember contributing. Capable devices keep the existing copy unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"83de47ad6914e6451b0393f573ab6da0a7e50d70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/83de47ad6914e6451b0393f573ab6da0a7e50d70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/63c215358e69ee1abdc5395005bd8e0907a0e791","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/63c215358e69ee1abdc5395005bd8e0907a0e791","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDYzYzIxNTM1OGU2OWVlMWFiZGM1Mzk1MDA1YmQ4ZTA5MDdhMGU3OTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/19a1e0f3bd3863352b19cbb31709a989e8d1dc66","sha":"19a1e0f3bd3863352b19cbb31709a989e8d1dc66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/19a1e0f3bd3863352b19cbb31709a989e8d1dc66"}],"sha":"63c215358e69ee1abdc5395005bd8e0907a0e791","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/63c215358e69ee1abdc5395005bd8e0907a0e791"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/355d44fec11051bc1d9f48c5730afd1abd10ebed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T23:01:21Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T23:01:21Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"docs(speech): clarify no cross-origin isolation is required\n\nWebGPU needs none; the onnxruntime-web wasm fallback auto-detects a\nnon-isolated page and runs single-threaded (like the LLM path). Reframe\nthe COOP/COEP notes so they don''t imply a header dependency we don''t want\nto take on app-wide (which would risk the existing model-weight loads).\nPoint the threads/CORP follow-up at its own branch.","tree":{"sha":"28c7dc9880fc2b5a884551c355197e0a0e6e6627","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/28c7dc9880fc2b5a884551c355197e0a0e6e6627"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/355d44fec11051bc1d9f48c5730afd1abd10ebed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/355d44fec11051bc1d9f48c5730afd1abd10ebed","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDM1NWQ0NGZlYzExMDUxYmMxZDlmNDhjNTczMGFmZDFhYmQxMGViZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/2fdd03177970a180c262e3d34860c8236ec7effa","sha":"2fdd03177970a180c262e3d34860c8236ec7effa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/2fdd03177970a180c262e3d34860c8236ec7effa"}],"sha":"355d44fec11051bc1d9f48c5730afd1abd10ebed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/355d44fec11051bc1d9f48c5730afd1abd10ebed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/19a1e0f3bd3863352b19cbb31709a989e8d1dc66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T23:00:13Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T23:00:13Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(chat): enable supportThinDrivers so thin clients have an isFirst host\n\nThe text-relay/thin driver routes its first stage to a remote isFirst host,\nbut nothing in the mesh ever advertised [0, driverLayers): every capable peer\nhosts its own stage-0 privately and useCommunalHost defaults to claiming only\n[driverLayers, totalLayers). So a thin client (a phone) sat forever at\n\"waiting for host to cover every layer\" — the driver-side text-relay was inert\nwithout the host-side half.\n\nTurn on the existing supportThinDrivers option in apps/chat: capable hosts now\nclaim over [0, totalLayers), so the lowest claim owns the embeddings and\nbecomes an isFirst communal host a thin client can route through. Capable\ndrivers still host their own [0, driverLayers) locally and are unaffected\n(they use the [driverLayers, totalLayers) subset of coverage).","tree":{"sha":"f6f02e26826ab56beeedaf8eb46faa6c33424469","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/f6f02e26826ab56beeedaf8eb46faa6c33424469"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/19a1e0f3bd3863352b19cbb31709a989e8d1dc66","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/19a1e0f3bd3863352b19cbb31709a989e8d1dc66","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDE5YTFlMGYzYmQzODYzMzUyYjE5Y2JiMzE3MDlhOTg5ZThkMWRjNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/000f5237eeefa2007773d3fa214d1ae9403fab25","sha":"000f5237eeefa2007773d3fa214d1ae9403fab25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/000f5237eeefa2007773d3fa214d1ae9403fab25"}],"sha":"19a1e0f3bd3863352b19cbb31709a989e8d1dc66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/19a1e0f3bd3863352b19cbb31709a989e8d1dc66"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/000f5237eeefa2007773d3fa214d1ae9403fab25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T22:53:14Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T22:53:14Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(host): clear the stale \"Failed to fetch — retrying\" once a shard lands\n\nOn a throttled network a single fetch reject fails the whole stage-load\nattempt and scheduleRetry surfaces \"Couldn''t load layers N–M: Failed to\nfetch — retrying\", but that error only cleared on the WHOLE stage\nsucceeding — so it persisted (and its attempt counter escalated toward the\ngive-up ''error'' label) even as shards kept landing on the next attempt.\n\nReset it on real forward progress: whenever the loaded stage reports fresh\nbytes/shards, clear the error and zero the backoff attempt counter, so a\nslow-but-advancing download shows \"loading shard X/Y\" instead of a stuck\nfailure and never gives up while it''s making headway. A genuine stall\n(no progress for stallMs) is still caught by the load watchdog.","tree":{"sha":"c1189be224268fe0f35a924f7fb955debc1c78d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/c1189be224268fe0f35a924f7fb955debc1c78d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/000f5237eeefa2007773d3fa214d1ae9403fab25","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/000f5237eeefa2007773d3fa214d1ae9403fab25","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDAwMGY1MjM3ZWVlZmEyMDA3NzczZDNmYTIxNGQxYWU5NDAzZmFiMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/fc96b36020218940201645dbfcb7ad60d292076f","sha":"fc96b36020218940201645dbfcb7ad60d292076f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/fc96b36020218940201645dbfcb7ad60d292076f"}],"sha":"000f5237eeefa2007773d3fa214d1ae9403fab25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/000f5237eeefa2007773d3fa214d1ae9403fab25"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/2fdd03177970a180c262e3d34860c8236ec7effa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T22:24:52Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T22:24:52Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(speech): HF-primary, Legion-CDN-fallback weight sourcing\n\nMatch the LLM model-layer policy: prefer the public mirror, keep a\nself-hosted fallback. createWhisperEngine now takes an ordered\n`modelSources` list (default: Hugging Face Hub primary, cdn.codecai.net\nfallback) and sets `env.remoteHost` per attempt to fail over — transformers.js\nhas no native failover. `wasmPaths` is now configurable so the ort runtime\ncan be self-hosted off the public CDN too.\n\nNothing is fetched until a peer enables ASR *hosting* (worker is lazy), so\nplain visitors and client-only peers download none of it; this only\ngoverns where the on-enable fetch comes from.\n\nAdds scripts/mirror-whisper-to-cdn.sh (weights + ort wasm -> CDN, HF\nlayout) as the deploy-time step to populate the fallback. README documents\nthe sourcing policy.\n\nspeech pkg build green; asrTool unit tests unchanged (blocked locally only\nby the codec-local symlink env gotcha, unrelated to this diff).","tree":{"sha":"b2dbaaa2d1a82a2a703790e5b9f4afb20f85d594","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/b2dbaaa2d1a82a2a703790e5b9f4afb20f85d594"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/2fdd03177970a180c262e3d34860c8236ec7effa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/2fdd03177970a180c262e3d34860c8236ec7effa","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDJmZGQwMzE3Nzk3MGExODBjMjYyZTNkMzQ4NjBjODIzNmVjN2VmZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/8eb3c67470b3600a04ffb68a8c349bdd1da1b1f3","sha":"8eb3c67470b3600a04ffb68a8c349bdd1da1b1f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/8eb3c67470b3600a04ffb68a8c349bdd1da1b1f3"}],"sha":"2fdd03177970a180c262e3d34860c8236ec7effa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/2fdd03177970a180c262e3d34860c8236ec7effa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/fc96b36020218940201645dbfcb7ad60d292076f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T22:02:52Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T22:02:52Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(mesh): text-relay driver — thin devices drive via host tokenize/detokenize\n\nPhones can''t host an 8B stage-0 (mobile WebGPU maxStorageBufferBindingSize\n~128MB vs a ~350MB embedding buffer), so instead of running any stage or\nholding a tokenizer, a thin device now drives as a pure text-in/text-out\nclient: it ships the prompt TEXT to the isFirst host (which tokenizes — every\nstage carries the vocab), the pipeline runs among the hosts, and the isFinal\nhost detokenizes and streams TEXT deltas back. No local tokenizer, no GPU,\nno model artifacts on the device.\n\n- Capability is now per-channel: derived from the manifest''s\n  shared.embeddings.tensor_bytes (350MB 8B, 423MB 32B), not a flat 128MB\n  (which was the 0.6B test-model floor). isThinDriverForModel replaces the\n  fixed threshold; the old constant stays as a documented fallback.\n- Protocol additions are optional/v1-compatible: stage.session.open gains\n  promptText + textOutput; stage.token gains text. Absent = old behavior.\n- incrementalTextStream: UTF-8-safe streaming detok (redecode-whole +\n  hold-back trailing U+FFFD) so multi-byte chars never split across deltas.\n- Gated behind textRelay (thin-only); capable devices take the unchanged\n  local-stage-0 path. Relay activation-forward path is untouched.\n\nKnown limits (documented): detok->retok isn''t token-identical on the rare\nreplan; a genuine U+FFFD is delayed one step.","tree":{"sha":"0c38bc4f4e822424259f606bd5318bf23ede1ec2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/0c38bc4f4e822424259f606bd5318bf23ede1ec2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/fc96b36020218940201645dbfcb7ad60d292076f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/fc96b36020218940201645dbfcb7ad60d292076f","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKGZjOTZiMzYwMjAyMTg5NDAyMDE2NDVkYmZjYjdhZDYwZDI5MjA3NmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/c1ad93fe029cb6261e9d91c5fd83eae77dbc1098","sha":"c1ad93fe029cb6261e9d91c5fd83eae77dbc1098","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c1ad93fe029cb6261e9d91c5fd83eae77dbc1098"}],"sha":"fc96b36020218940201645dbfcb7ad60d292076f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/fc96b36020218940201645dbfcb7ad60d292076f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/8eb3c67470b3600a04ffb68a8c349bdd1da1b1f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T20:57:44Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T20:57:44Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(speech): browser ASR as a mesh capability (PoC)\n\nAdd a speech-to-text capability to the mesh: mic -> Whisper in a Web\nWorker -> transcript, exposed as a `tc` tool-call job (asr.transcribe /\n`transcribe` tool) rather than an activation pipeline. A peer that hosts\nASR advertises the skill+tool in its cap; askers resolve it via the\nroster and call it over the existing tool bus, reusing ToolRegistry /\nuseMeshTools with no protocol change. Solo self-host also works.\n\n- mesh-core: canonical asr.transcribe skill/tool contract + arg/result\n  types (speech.ts). Audio rides tc as base64 for the PoC; binary Codec\n  LatentFrame transport is the documented phase-2 upgrade.\n- @unstable-legion/speech (new pkg): SpeechEngine iface, transformers.js\n  Whisper engine (Xenova/whisper-base, webgpu->wasm fallback), worker +\n  client, WebAudio decode, createAsrTranscribeTool() bridge, unit tests.\n  Uses the transformers.js already in the tree via the safety stack; no\n  new heavy dep. Parakeet.js/Piper slot behind the same interface later.\n- mesh-react: useMicCapture, useSpeechHost, useSpeechClient.\n- apps/demo: SpeechPanel (host toggle, record, transcribe, local or\n  over-mesh) wired into the debug surface.\n\nBuilds/tests green: core 164/164, speech 7/7, react + demo vite build.\nBrowser mic/WebGPU e2e per packages/speech-engines/MANUAL-TEST.md.","tree":{"sha":"1e94866fb2f966c8b080a845c1d3b4fe13264158","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/1e94866fb2f966c8b080a845c1d3b4fe13264158"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/8eb3c67470b3600a04ffb68a8c349bdd1da1b1f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/8eb3c67470b3600a04ffb68a8c349bdd1da1b1f3","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDhlYjNjNjc0NzBiMzYwMGEwNGZmYjY4YThjMzQ5YmRkMWRhMWIxZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/0c98828495ac0cc45c2e5f87135b9af57c748d1b","sha":"0c98828495ac0cc45c2e5f87135b9af57c748d1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/0c98828495ac0cc45c2e5f87135b9af57c748d1b"}],"sha":"8eb3c67470b3600a04ffb68a8c349bdd1da1b1f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/8eb3c67470b3600a04ffb68a8c349bdd1da1b1f3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c1ad93fe029cb6261e9d91c5fd83eae77dbc1098/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T20:10:48Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T20:10:48Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(chat): installable PWA (app-shell offline + auto-update)\n\nAdd vite-plugin-pwa with an autoUpdate service worker, web manifest, icons,\nand an install/offline story. The service worker caches ONLY the app shell\n(JS/CSS/HTML/wasm/icons, ≤6MB) — model shards are excluded from precache\n(globIgnores **/*.gguf, webllm/, stages/) and cross-origin model/manifest\nfetches (Hugging Face, the cdn mirror, /webllm/, .gguf) plus the wss signaling\nare NetworkOnly, so the SW never caches gigabytes or breaks HTTP range\nrequests / WebRTC. A small \"new version — reload\" toast is registered from\nmain.tsx (outside the React tree); App.tsx and styles.css are untouched.","tree":{"sha":"2777dde71c15f106b1ce2ee98bb5a5591aae4987","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/2777dde71c15f106b1ce2ee98bb5a5591aae4987"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/c1ad93fe029cb6261e9d91c5fd83eae77dbc1098","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/us