,"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c63d6aa3a90815c22fbab149b07709477097ca72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T19:21:27Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T19:21:27Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(chat): pipeline handoff indicator — per-hop direct/relayed, bytes, dtype\n\nMake the machine-to-machine Codec activation handoff visible in the UI. For\nthe active route, render each remote hop (source -> dest, layer range) with\nthe wire dtype (derived from the last frame''s byte size via\nwireDtypeFromFrameBytes — the honest wire truth, no separate plumbed field),\nthe last frame size in KB, and whether the connection is a direct P2P path or\nriding a TURN relay (new peer.peerConnectionType via getStats() nominated\ncandidate-pair type; relay on either side = relayed). Self-hosted hops are\nlabelled local (no WebRTC to classify). Shown in the mesh sidebar under the\ntopology map; self-gates to nothing when a route has no remote hop.","tree":{"sha":"6c1ef0e908d0db41095ec1c7bb222cba49e710df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/6c1ef0e908d0db41095ec1c7bb222cba49e710df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/c63d6aa3a90815c22fbab149b07709477097ca72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/c63d6aa3a90815c22fbab149b07709477097ca72","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKGM2M2Q2YWEzYTkwODE1YzIyZmJhYjE0OWIwNzcwOTQ3NzA5N2NhNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/23fc7eef48b78f34ee6fc3a248773743a240a79d","sha":"23fc7eef48b78f34ee6fc3a248773743a240a79d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/23fc7eef48b78f34ee6fc3a248773743a240a79d"}],"sha":"c63d6aa3a90815c22fbab149b07709477097ca72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c63d6aa3a90815c22fbab149b07709477097ca72"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/23fc7eef48b78f34ee6fc3a248773743a240a79d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T17:59:23Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T17:59:23Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(wire): int8 activation codec as default wire dtype + per-response tok/s badge\n\nAdd a self-contained int8 activation-wire codec (per-token abs-max symmetric\nquantization with an optional keyframe-anchored delta pre-pass) behind a\nheader-self-describing dispatcher, so f32/f16/i8 negotiate per hop and the\norchestrator/host stay dtype-agnostic. Widen wireDtype to include ''i8'' across\nthe planners, guards, and stage protocol; route hop-cost math through\nlegionActivationBytes (i8 = 1 byte/element). Default the wire to i8 (~4x fewer\nbytes/token/hop than f32; overridable via ?wireDtype=f16 / ?wireDtype=f32).\ni8 verified coherent on the 0.6b model: 4/5 prompts token-exact vs f32 under\ngreedy decode, the 5th a valid divergent completion (new f32-vs-i8 e2e A/B).\n\nSurface a decode-throughput metric (first generated token -> last) from the\nchat runtime and render it as a small \"N tok/s\" badge under each assistant\nreply.","tree":{"sha":"45dc555f670a3da72426c21cea501aaed625d178","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/45dc555f670a3da72426c21cea501aaed625d178"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/23fc7eef48b78f34ee6fc3a248773743a240a79d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/23fc7eef48b78f34ee6fc3a248773743a240a79d","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDIzZmM3ZWVmNDhiNzhmMzRlZTZmYzNhMjQ4NzczNzQzYTI0MGE3OWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/e7b50115c533846517e19da489fd33fe1504c133","sha":"e7b50115c533846517e19da489fd33fe1504c133","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/e7b50115c533846517e19da489fd33fe1504c133"}],"sha":"23fc7eef48b78f34ee6fc3a248773743a240a79d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/23fc7eef48b78f34ee6fc3a248773743a240a79d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/e7b50115c533846517e19da489fd33fe1504c133/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T16:38:51Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T16:38:51Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(mesh): N-stage relay — multi-host split inference actually works\n\nSplitting layers across two hosts produced gibberish (ffffffff…) that \"ran\ncleanly\" — no error — while a single host covering the whole range worked.\nTwo independent defects:\n\n1. runCommunalDriverSession#firstRemotePeerId returned [...currentRemotePeerIds][0].\n   That Set is filled downstream-first, so [0] was the FINAL stage''s peer: the\n   driver shoved stage-0''s activation straight into the last stage, skipping\n   every middle hop. Final stages sample happily → a plausible, WRONG token.\n   Invisible with one remote stage (Set has one element). Now addressed BY\n   INDEX (stage 1), with the outbound encoder explicitly stage 1''s.\n\n2. Intermediate-host relay didn''t exist. useStageHost asserted predictedToken\n   and threw for any non-final stage; result.activation (the boundary\n   activation a relay must forward) was returned by the worker and discarded.\n\nThe relay:\n- Protocol (additive/v1-safe): stage.session.open gains stageIndex, isFinal\n  (driver-authoritative), nextPeerId, prevPeerId; wireHeader is now optional.\n- Driver assigns each hop its prev/next/isFinal from the plan and sends a\n  wireHeader ONLY to stage 1; hops ≥2 take their upstream relay''s header\n  inline (the existing awaitingHeader path). Token still returns straight from\n  the final host to the driver (sender-agnostic callId).\n- Host: on a non-final stage, re-encode result.activation (seq/tokens/posStart\n  preserved so downstream re-derives isPrefill) and sendStageFrame to\n  nextPeerId; final stage replies to driverPeerId (not the inbound sender).\n  Spoof guard now checks prevPeerId. Dtype is self-describing on the wire\n  (each relay sends its own header), so a per-hop dtype difference cannot\n  corrupt — the downstream decodes exactly what the upstream encoded.\n- Churn: freeSession + roster-leave propagate teardown BOTH ways (driver,\n  upstream, downstream); handleStop accepts a stop from any pipeline neighbour.\n\nGuardrails:\n- validateStagePlan (stagePlanner): contiguity, exactly one isFirst/isFinal,\n  ends at totalLayers — nothing validated plans before.\n- maxStages on the communal planners: a runtime KILL-SWITCH (set to 2 to pin\n  the mesh to the proven single-remote shape); ships at Infinity now that the\n  relay works. The greedy cover already prefers a single full-range host, so\n  a multi-hop route only happens on a genuinely fragmented mesh.\n\nTests: 3-stage mock — first sf to stage 1 (fails before the fix), each hop\nopened with correct stageIndex/isFinal/prev/next, header only on stage 1,\nsession completes end to end; plan-validation gap/overlap/one-final; maxStages\nkill-switch. Solo self-host (driver[0,2)->driver[2,36)) regression intact.\nmesh-core 230, mesh-react 96, apps/chat 118 green.","tree":{"sha":"d7a51765761b4e5bc9587fcf2bcc5467ca0be03d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/d7a51765761b4e5bc9587fcf2bcc5467ca0be03d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/e7b50115c533846517e19da489fd33fe1504c133","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/e7b50115c533846517e19da489fd33fe1504c133","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKGU3YjUwMTE1YzUzMzg0NjUxN2UxOWRhNDg5ZmQzM2ZlMTUwNGMxMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/0976736037cab8cf1da575f8b8d2774a5dd60165","sha":"0976736037cab8cf1da575f8b8d2774a5dd60165","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/0976736037cab8cf1da575f8b8d2774a5dd60165"}],"sha":"e7b50115c533846517e19da489fd33fe1504c133","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/e7b50115c533846517e19da489fd33fe1504c133"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/0976736037cab8cf1da575f8b8d2774a5dd60165/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T12:35:45Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T12:35:45Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"chore: remove deployment topology from this public repo\n\nThis repo is public and was documenting private infrastructure: host IPs and\nshort names, /storage paths, router forward rules, the build box, an ACME\ncontact email, a Forgejo URL + SSH port, and analytics/dashboard hostnames.\nSome of it I added myself when writing the docs.\n\nRemoved (preserved in the private IaC instead):\n- docs/TURN-RELIABILITY.md — a forensic write-up of the private network:\n  router forwards, host topology, and a note that a coturn credential must be\n  treated as compromised. No public value; real exposure.\n- deploy/coturn/ — the retired edge coturn compose + conf, superseded by the\n  VPS relay and duplicated in the private IaC.\n\nParameterized (still usable, no topology):\n- docker-compose.yml — VIRTUAL_HOST / LETSENCRYPT_* / mirror dir / proxy\n  network now come from LEGION_* env vars (see .env.example). NOTE: the\n  deploy host''s .env must define them or VIRTUAL_HOST falls back to\n  legion.localhost and routing breaks.\n- .forgejo/workflows/ci.yml — clones via ${GITHUB_SERVER_URL} (set by the\n  runner) instead of a hardcoded host; sibling repo host/port/path come from\n  repo variables.\n- .env.example / docker-compose / Dockerfile / telemetry docs — placeholders\n  instead of our hostnames and paths.\n- .cursor/rules/infra-and-deploy.mdc — keeps the PRODUCT rules (self-host\n  signaling + TURN, never third-party STUN, verify-turn-baked, esbuild does\n  not typecheck) and drops the topology, with an explicit rule not to write\n  hosts/paths into this repo or its commit messages.\n\nLeft alone deliberately: the runtime fallbacks in App.tsx (signal relay) and\ntelemetry.ts (ingest URLs) already ship inside the public bundle, so they are\nnot secrets — but they do mean a third-party build with no .env would phone\nhome to our infra. Changing them is a behavior decision, not a scrub.","tree":{"sha":"74d345a303e0130b760e1e04575afe41f05011a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/74d345a303e0130b760e1e04575afe41f05011a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/0976736037cab8cf1da575f8b8d2774a5dd60165","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/0976736037cab8cf1da575f8b8d2774a5dd60165","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDA5NzY3MzYwMzdjYWI4Y2YxZGE1NzVmOGI4ZDI3NzRhNWRkNjAxNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/0e6bc2d3cf3a1b9666ad889a511b640b47a83ab9","sha":"0e6bc2d3cf3a1b9666ad889a511b640b47a83ab9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/0e6bc2d3cf3a1b9666ad889a511b640b47a83ab9"}],"sha":"0976736037cab8cf1da575f8b8d2774a5dd60165","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/0976736037cab8cf1da575f8b8d2774a5dd60165"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/0e6bc2d3cf3a1b9666ad889a511b640b47a83ab9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T12:15:16Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T12:15:16Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(host): show the real VRAM-upload percentage while a stage opens\n\nThe runtime now relays llama.cpp''s byte-level open progress (openFraction).\nThread it through StageWorkerLoadProgress and render it: \"Loading 34 layers\ninto GPU · 45%\" replaces a bar that pinned at 100% download and a phase label\nwith no number behind it.\n\nIf a host''s wasm predates the reporter, openFraction is undefined: render\nINDETERMINATE (aria-valuenow omitted, which is how a progressbar signals\nunknown) rather than claiming 0% — a stalled-looking 0% for minutes is exactly\nthe class of lie this whole thread has been about.","tree":{"sha":"4c0813e5a27d45cbfeb9b4c62694edff8aa0c335","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/4c0813e5a27d45cbfeb9b4c62694edff8aa0c335"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/0e6bc2d3cf3a1b9666ad889a511b640b47a83ab9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/0e6bc2d3cf3a1b9666ad889a511b640b47a83ab9","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDBlNmJjMmQzY2YzYTFiOTY2NmFkODg5YTUxMWI2NDBiNDdhODNhYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/3ea9810302b91defe37571610a9d09e8d4f13b2b","sha":"3ea9810302b91defe37571610a9d09e8d4f13b2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/3ea9810302b91defe37571610a9d09e8d4f13b2b"}],"sha":"0e6bc2d3cf3a1b9666ad889a511b640b47a83ab9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/0e6bc2d3cf3a1b9666ad889a511b640b47a83ab9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/3ea9810302b91defe37571610a9d09e8d4f13b2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T11:11:33Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T11:11:33Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(host): a sustained hosting-off frees VRAM again; a blip does not\n\nc42e9b9 moved the worker onto a hook-lifetime ref so a re-subscribe of the\nanswer effect couldn''t destroy a stage that took minutes to load. That part is\nright and worth keeping — `enabled` is `hosting && isLeader`, and colocation\nleader-election can flip it for a moment.\n\nBut it moved disposal to the []-unmount effect ONLY, which regressed something\nreal: switching hosting OFF no longer freed the GPU. 4.4GB stayed pinned in\nVRAM until the tab closed, and a leadership handoff left the OLD leader holding\nits weights while the NEW leader loaded its own — double VRAM, on exactly the\nhardware where that OOMs. Before c42e9b9 the answer effect''s cleanup (deps\nincluded `enabled`) disposed on hosting-off; that behavior was lost.\n\nThread both: keep it resident across a blip, free it once the peer has\ngenuinely stopped hosting. Disposal now runs on a RESIDENT_GRACE_MS timer armed\nwhen `enabled` goes false and cancelled if it comes back, so re-enabling inside\nthe window reuses the stage as-is. True unmount still frees immediately.\n\nRunway is deliberately long (10min): a cold reload is a multi-minute multi-GB\nround trip, so holding VRAM a while is much cheaper than paying that back for a\ntoggle the user reverses. disposeResident also clears loadedStages and\nrepublishes, so a freed stage is never left advertised.","tree":{"sha":"8c42259898d1ac755fdaffc2eeb5c4004f3c4c40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/8c42259898d1ac755fdaffc2eeb5c4004f3c4c40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/3ea9810302b91defe37571610a9d09e8d4f13b2b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/3ea9810302b91defe37571610a9d09e8d4f13b2b","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDNlYTk4MTAzMDJiOTFkZWZlMzc1NzE2MTBhOWQwOWU4ZDRmMTNiMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/c691716dd4d0e1404786fcba8019213510854937","sha":"c691716dd4d0e1404786fcba8019213510854937","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c691716dd4d0e1404786fcba8019213510854937"}],"sha":"3ea9810302b91defe37571610a9d09e8d4f13b2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/3ea9810302b91defe37571610a9d09e8d4f13b2b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c691716dd4d0e1404786fcba8019213510854937/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T10:13:46Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T10:13:46Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(host): believe the loader''s phase instead of guessing from shard counts\n\nThe runtime now reports whether a load is ''downloading'' or ''opening'' (weights\nuploading to VRAM inside legion_stage_open). Thread it through\nStageWorkerLoadProgress -> useStageHost -> the drawer and prefer it over the\nold shard-count heuristic, which is wrong in exactly the case the user hits:\na cache-warm load reaches shardsFetched===totalShards within seconds and then\nspends MINUTES in the GPU upload, so the drawer reported \"Downloading model…\"\nfor the whole thing while nothing was being downloaded at all.\n\nThe count heuristic stays as a fallback for a host on an older runtime that\nsends no phase.","tree":{"sha":"77f8352299eebfe849f33d8442517ce181a104ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/77f8352299eebfe849f33d8442517ce181a104ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/c691716dd4d0e1404786fcba8019213510854937","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/c691716dd4d0e1404786fcba8019213510854937","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKGM2OTE3MTZkZDRkMGUxNDA0Nzg2ZmNiYTgwMTkyMTM1MTA4NTQ5Mzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/e164e472bbb5155beda8e97349574915606e06b6","sha":"e164e472bbb5155beda8e97349574915606e06b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/e164e472bbb5155beda8e97349574915606e06b6"}],"sha":"c691716dd4d0e1404786fcba8019213510854937","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c691716dd4d0e1404786fcba8019213510854937"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/e164e472bbb5155beda8e97349574915606e06b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T10:01:47Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T10:01:47Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"chore(mesh-core): preserve the unwired hostHealth tracker\n\ncreateHostHealthTracker (cooldown/backoff/decay for demoting hosts that\nattach-fail, stall mid-stream, or camp a blocking range). Written earlier for\nthe churn-resilience work and never wired into the orchestrator or the app —\nnothing imports it, so this is inert. Committing so it isn''t lost to a stray\nworktree; wiring it up is still open work.","tree":{"sha":"15d54b4fc910be953d615d2857b02a48cb2217c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/15d54b4fc910be953d615d2857b02a48cb2217c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/e164e472bbb5155beda8e97349574915606e06b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/e164e472bbb5155beda8e97349574915606e06b6","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKGUxNjRlNDcyYmJiNTE1NWJlZGE4ZTk3MzQ5NTc0OTE1NjA2ZTA2YjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/c6af080e872caf1c7a80c28ee36dbebe04d82e30","sha":"c6af080e872caf1c7a80c28ee36dbebe04d82e30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c6af080e872caf1c7a80c28ee36dbebe04d82e30"}],"sha":"e164e472bbb5155beda8e97349574915606e06b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/e164e472bbb5155beda8e97349574915606e06b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c6af080e872caf1c7a80c28ee36dbebe04d82e30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T08:43:04Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T08:43:04Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"diag(host): log the reuse-vs-reload decision in ensureWorkerLoaded\n\nEvidence from a live capture: [2,36) finished preloading at 4:20:21, the\ndriver routed to it at 4:20:25, and the session.open at 4:21:23 reloaded the\nwhole stage from shard 1 anyway — a 7-minute wait for weights the host had\njust loaded. Which branch fired (reuse / await-in-flight / config mismatch /\nno worker) is unknowable from the logs, because the decision is silent.\n\nNow it says exactly what it saw and what it chose: want vs resident config,\nhasWorker, loadInFlight, session count, and the origin of the request. This\nis diagnostics, not a fix — the next capture identifies the branch instead of\ninviting another guess.","tree":{"sha":"7d4f3c667349414f0caf638dac026a3585108993","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/7d4f3c667349414f0caf638dac026a3585108993"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/c6af080e872caf1c7a80c28ee36dbebe04d82e30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/c6af080e872caf1c7a80c28ee36dbebe04d82e30","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKGM2YWYwODBlODcyY2FmMWM3YTgwYzI4ZWUzNmRiZWJlMDRkODJlMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/184d4994ad95e2b30953dbd326dbf8cc5ebbec96","sha":"184d4994ad95e2b30953dbd326dbf8cc5ebbec96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/184d4994ad95e2b30953dbd326dbf8cc5ebbec96"}],"sha":"c6af080e872caf1c7a80c28ee36dbebe04d82e30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c6af080e872caf1c7a80c28ee36dbebe04d82e30"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/184d4994ad95e2b30953dbd326dbf8cc5ebbec96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T08:37:45Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T08:37:45Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(host): a failed warm-up must never advertise — it is the readiness proof\n\nwarmUpStageWorker ran a real prefill + decode dispatch, and on failure logged\n\"dispatch failed (non-fatal)\" and returned normally. useStageHost then set\nworkerClient and published loadedStages, so a stage whose compute pipelines\ndid not compile got advertised to the mesh, took real chats, and trapped\n`unreachable` on every prefill — reloading in a crash loop.\n\nEvidence (three captured sessions):\n\n  log            tokens  warmup-failed  WGSL-err  unreachable\n  ...7909912       266         0            0          0\n  ...0912323         0         0            0          0\n  ...5504702         0         3           12        575\n\nThe session that actually generated had ZERO warm-up failures; every warm-up\nfailure belongs to a host that generated nothing and trapped 575 times. The\nfailure is perfectly predictive of a stage that cannot serve, so throwing here\nrejects only the already-broken case and cannot break the working path.\n\nThe warm-up IS the proof a stage can run: it compiles every pipeline and\nexecutes both real dispatch shapes. Failing it now throws, which routes into\nthe caller''s existing load-failed/backoff path — the stage is simply never\nadvertised, and the drawer shows why instead of the mesh carrying a host that\nalready accepted work it can never do.\n\nRoot cause of the observed failure is separate and still open: the WGSL uses\n@builtin(num_subgroups) (mul_mat_vec_q4_K_f32_sg_reduce), which the device\nrejects — a legion-stage-runtime shader/feature-gating bug.","tree":{"sha":"cf45f064c41e19fee0c4cbe0e8f7986ff01d73fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/cf45f064c41e19fee0c4cbe0e8f7986ff01d73fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/184d4994ad95e2b30953dbd326dbf8cc5ebbec96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/184d4994ad95e2b30953dbd326dbf8cc5ebbec96","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDE4NGQ0OTk0YWQ5NWUyYjMwOTUzZGJkMzI2ZGJmOGNjNWViYmVjOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/1bd6b46314b8f3e1009b29d3d3be4596b26bd106","sha":"1bd6b46314b8f3e1009b29d3d3be4596b26bd106","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/1bd6b46314b8f3e1009b29d3d3be4596b26bd106"}],"sha":"184d4994ad95e2b30953dbd326dbf8cc5ebbec96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/184d4994ad95e2b30953dbd326dbf8cc5ebbec96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/1bd6b46314b8f3e1009b29d3d3be4596b26bd106/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T08:32:01Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T08:32:01Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(host): retract the stage advertisement the instant the weights go away\n\nA host must never be listed for a stage it does not currently hold resident\nin VRAM. The positive gate was already right — `workerClient` is assigned\nonly after legion_stage_open AND warmUpStageWorker both succeed, so a VRAM\nfailure never advertises. The hole was the negative side: disposeWorker()\ncleared the worker but never called syncPublicState(), so `loadedStagesRef`\n— what the publish loop actually broadcasts — kept the OLD stage.\n\nSince doLoad() BEGINS with `await disposeWorker()`, that meant the peer went\non telling the mesh \"I have [2,36) loaded\" for the entire multi-minute\nreload. collectCommunalAds reads loadedStages, so drivers believed it, routed\nreal work to a host holding no weights, and sat waiting out the download —\nand if the subsequent VRAM load had failed, the mesh would have been carrying\na host that already accepted work it could never do.\n\ndisposeWorker() now syncs public state (recomputing loadedStages to [] and\nrepublishing) before awaiting the dispose.\n\nFollow-up worth doing separately: the loader streams every shard to MEMFS and\nthen does one big native open. Loading each layer into VRAM as it lands (and\nfetching layer N+1 while N loads) would cut the cold-start wall clock a lot.","tree":{"sha":"17757120b747b3db9e5249a68421d06a3c7c8cb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/17757120b747b3db9e5249a68421d06a3c7c8cb4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/1bd6b46314b8f3e1009b29d3d3be4596b26bd106","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/1bd6b46314b8f3e1009b29d3d3be4596b26bd106","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDFiZDZiNDYzMTRiOGYzZTEwMDliMjlkM2QzYmU0NTk2YjI2YmQxMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/22093b3a4f3db4dd51ebdbcf2123ae3c95a2bb08","sha":"22093b3a4f3db4dd51ebdbcf2123ae3c95a2bb08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/22093b3a4f3db4dd51ebdbcf2123ae3c95a2bb08"}],"sha":"1bd6b46314b8f3e1009b29d3d3be4596b26bd106","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/1bd6b46314b8f3e1009b29d3d3be4596b26bd106"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/22093b3a4f3db4dd51ebdbcf2123ae3c95a2bb08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T08:18:33Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T08:18:33Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(host): show the download whenever bytes are moving, not only when phase says so\n\nRaising the layer budget re-claims a bigger range and re-downloads\ngigabytes — with no indication in the UI. Two causes:\n\n- useCommunalHost flips phase straight back to ''active'' during the re-load,\n  because the PREVIOUS stage is still in loadedStages and advertised. So the\n  new download runs under phase ''active''.\n- deriveHostingLifecycleState short-circuited on ''active'' -> \"Hosting N\n  layers\" and hid the bar.\n\nRule is now simply: any time a load is in flight, say so — the in-flight\nload is checked BEFORE phase, since phase demonstrably lies mid-re-load.\n\nFor that, loadProgress had to mean exactly \"loading right now\": useStageHost\nnever cleared it, so it lingered at its final value forever after a load.\nNow cleared when the load settles (success or failure), and the per-shard\nticks re-populate it the instant the next load starts fetching.\n\nRegression tests cover both: phase ''active'' + in-flight shards => downloading\n(and ''opening'' for the native-open tail), and phase ''active'' + no in-flight\nload => hosting.","tree":{"sha":"833a1070ec56675ac4cd09f5bbfbea362bdfd3a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/833a1070ec56675ac4cd09f5bbfbea362bdfd3a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/22093b3a4f3db4dd51ebdbcf2123ae3c95a2bb08","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/22093b3a4f3db4dd51ebdbcf2123ae3c95a2bb08","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDIyMDkzYjNhNGYzZGI0ZGQ1MWViZGJjZjIxMjNhZTNjOTVhMmJiMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/d265051f6b8f465fa7305f1b1e768f067b49861b","sha":"d265051f6b8f465fa7305f1b1e768f067b49861b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/d265051f6b8f465fa7305f1b1e768f067b49861b"}],"sha":"22093b3a4f3db4dd51ebdbcf2123ae3c95a2bb08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/22093b3a4f3db4dd51ebdbcf2123ae3c95a2bb08"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/d265051f6b8f465fa7305f1b1e768f067b49861b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T08:03:04Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T08:03:04Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(host): actually return loadProgress so the drawer shows real download numbers\n\nuseStageHost called setLoadProgress(...) on every shard and logged\n\"[stage-host] load progress: shard 3/12 (251/1274 MB)\" to the console — then\nomitted `loadProgress` from its returned handle. So `useCommunalHost`''s\n`downloadProgress` was permanently undefined, the right drawer''s progress bar\nnever rendered, and a multi-minute download showed a bare \"Downloading model…\"\nwith no numbers at all. `loadProgress?:` being optional on the handle\ninterface is why tsc never flagged the missing field.\n\nThe data existed the whole time; it just never left the hook.\n\nAlso make the bar say something useful: layer-based counts + real GB + a\npercentage (\"Downloading model: 3 of 11 layers (0.3 of ~1.3 GB) · 24%\"), and\nduring ''opening'' report the native load into VRAM instead of a stuck\n\"11 of 11\".","tree":{"sha":"849c89bbb7c694732482259e852b5bbae7d74962","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/849c89bbb7c694732482259e852b5bbae7d74962"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/d265051f6b8f465fa7305f1b1e768f067b49861b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/d265051f6b8f465fa7305f1b1e768f067b49861b","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKGQyNjUwNTFmNmI4ZjQ2NWZhNzMwNWYxYjFlNzY4ZjA2N2I0OTg2MWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/c42e9b94030a39250f72e39942b6699b4942e877","sha":"c42e9b94030a39250f72e39942b6699b4942e877","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c42e9b94030a39250f72e39942b6699b4942e877"}],"sha":"d265051f6b8f465fa7305f1b1e768f067b49861b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/d265051f6b8f465fa7305f1b1e768f067b49861b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c42e9b94030a39250f72e39942b6699b4942e877/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T07:34:03Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T07:34:03Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(host): keep preloaded stage resident across effect churn; host lifecycle in the right drawer\n\nThe self-hosting driver preloaded its committed range into VRAM on join,\nthen RE-downloaded all 4.4GB from shard 1 when the user sent a prompt —\nso the host effectively \"said ready, then loaded for 8 minutes on the\nfirst call\" (and to a REMOTE caller looked like a non-responsive host).\n\nRoot cause: useStageHost kept its worker/session/load state as closure-\nlocal `let`s inside the \"answer\" effect, whose deps include `enabled`\n(= hosting && isLeader). Leader-election churn re-subscribes that effect;\nits cleanup disposed the just-loaded worker and the fresh closure started\nempty with no re-preload, so the self-directed stage.session.open sailed\npast the reuse guard and cold-loaded again.\n\nFix: hoist that state onto a hook-lifetime `engineRef` (StageEngine) so a\nre-subscribe re-adopts the SAME resident worker and the sameConfig reuse\nguard actually fires; dispose only on true unmount, never on churn. A\ncommitted stage now stays warm in VRAM for the next caller.\n\nUI (per \"put it in the right drawer, not the chat — the caller may be\nremote\"): drop the chat-pane load bar; drive the hosting-consent status in\nthe right drawer off hostingLabels'' lifecycle state machine (finally wired\nin) so it reads Ready to host → Downloading model… → Loading into GPU… →\nHosting N layers, with the shard/GB bar through the download+open phases.\nThe word \"Hosting\" appears only once weights are resident and serving.","tree":{"sha":"7dd49a92aaeb7426fc8da622ed6ede0b1fc3622c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/7dd49a92aaeb7426fc8da622ed6ede0b1fc3622c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/c42e9b94030a39250f72e39942b6699b4942e877","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/c42e9b94030a39250f72e39942b6699b4942e877","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKGM0MmU5Yjk0MDMwYTM5MjUwZjcyZTM5OTQyYjY2OTliNDk0MmU4Nzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/8c189c1ab12a1e296c4acf057785cd1fbdaaeacf","sha":"8c189c1ab12a1e296c4acf057785cd1fbdaaeacf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/8c189c1ab12a1e296c4acf057785cd1fbdaaeacf"}],"sha":"c42e9b94030a39250f72e39942b6699b4942e877","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/c42e9b94030a39250f72e39942b6699b4942e877"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/8c189c1ab12a1e296c4acf057785cd1fbdaaeacf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T06:35:03Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T06:35:03Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(mesh): live model-assembly progress + progress-aware stage load\n\nThe cold start of the communal Qwen3-8B was silent for ~8 minutes and then\nspuriously stalled: the driver awaited each stage''s load with a flat\n300s timeout, so a healthy 4.4GB solo download tripped it mid-load and\nforced a replan, while the chat UI showed nothing between \"sent\" and the\nfirst token.\n\n- Protocol: new result-shaped `stage.load.progress` push (fresh callId so\n  it never settles the ready/accept waiter). Host emits it per shard, plus\n  an ''opening''/''warming'' phase for the silent native-open + warm-up tail.\n- Orchestrator: load wait is now progress-aware — the deadline resets on\n  every progress push (no-progress STALL window, default kept at the old\n  300s so a host on an old build that sends no progress doesn''t regress) +\n  a generous 30-min ceiling backstop. New `loadProgress` event surfaces the\n  counts. PendingToolCallTracker gains resetTimeout + rejectCall.\n- UI: chat waiting-state shows \"Loading Qwen3-8B — shard 24/36 · 2.6/4.4 GB\n  → opening stage… → warming up…\" with a progress bar, instead of a frozen\n  spinner. Cleared on the first token.\n- Tests: protocol round-trip + phase guard, tracker reset/reject, and two\n  orchestrator tests (healthy slow load survives; genuine silence fast-fails).","tree":{"sha":"52b2739c997bef3369c4cf0c3b90a37d02b592d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/52b2739c997bef3369c4cf0c3b90a37d02b592d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/8c189c1ab12a1e296c4acf057785cd1fbdaaeacf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/8c189c1ab12a1e296c4acf057785cd1fbdaaeacf","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDhjMTg5YzFhYjEyYTFlMjk2YzRhY2YwNTc3ODVjZDFmYmRhYWVhY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/92a7abdd150144bf410417c57e59caed28b7af7d","sha":"92a7abdd150144bf410417c57e59caed28b7af7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/92a7abdd150144bf410417c57e59caed28b7af7d"}],"sha":"8c189c1ab12a1e296c4acf057785cd1fbdaaeacf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/8c189c1ab12a1e296c4acf057785cd1fbdaaeacf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/92a7abdd150144bf410417c57e59caed28b7af7d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T23:14:12Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T23:14:12Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(mesh-react): served stage host resolves its own shards (fixes legion_stage_open empty paths)\n\nhandleSessionOpen hardcoded shardUrls:[], so every SERVED stage (the\nstage.session.open path the pipeline uses) loaded zero shards and\nlegion_stage_open failed ''paths, path_count, and out_model are required''\n-> no host could serve a stage -> AI never responded. The driver''s own\nstage-0 worked only via a separate preload path. Give useStageHost a\nresolveSessionShards callback (wired in useCommunalHost to the same\nresolveCommunalShardPlan + manifest the preload path uses) so a served\nhost resolves shards for its range from its own manifest.","tree":{"sha":"b037f65be29a32e20d9f5e00650f64321c7e54ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/b037f65be29a32e20d9f5e00650f64321c7e54ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/92a7abdd150144bf410417c57e59caed28b7af7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/92a7abdd150144bf410417c57e59caed28b7af7d","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDkyYTdhYmRkMTUwMTQ0YmY0MTA0MTdjNTdlNTljYWVkMjhiN2FmN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/428070e206989573ddfd5d3d0041599537230522","sha":"428070e206989573ddfd5d3d0041599537230522","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/428070e206989573ddfd5d3d0041599537230522"}],"sha":"92a7abdd150144bf410417c57e59caed28b7af7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/92a7abdd150144bf410417c57e59caed28b7af7d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/428070e206989573ddfd5d3d0041599537230522/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T21:04:04Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T21:04:04Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"docs: add AGENTS.md + CLAUDE.md + .cursor/rules for AI agents\n\nDocument the project''s concerns and patterns in .cursor/rules/*.mdc (the\nsource of truth Cursor auto-applies): architecture (pipeline-split model,\nresilience gaps), mesh-protocol (wire actions, additive-guard idiom, runtime\ndebugging), infra-and-deploy (self-hosted signaling+TURN, split-horizon DNS,\ndeploy pipeline, IaC persistence), conventions. AGENTS.md + CLAUDE.md orient\nand reference the rules so Cursor, Claude Code, and other agents share one set\nof guidance.","tree":{"sha":"e1b81f89d854536e1ba143a95e443595afa90a11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/e1b81f89d854536e1ba143a95e443595afa90a11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/428070e206989573ddfd5d3d0041599537230522","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4011100?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/428070e206989573ddfd5d3d0041599537230522","node_id":"C_kwDOSckSltoAKDQyODA3MGUyMDY5ODk1NzNkZGZkNWQzZDAwNDE1OTk1MzcyMzA1MjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commit/14d4bb75ab52e9b5afc9f1ba068e9d38f5da7c91","sha":"14d4bb75ab52e9b5afc9f1ba068e9d38f5da7c91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/14d4bb75ab52e9b5afc9f1ba068e9d38f5da7c91"}],"sha":"428070e206989573ddfd5d3d0041599537230522","url":"https://api.gi