","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/88e6313750c21b396e664cae7ff30727dbcc2816/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T20:44:09Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T20:44:09Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"feat(chat): self-hosted MQTT-over-WSS signaling relay (signal.quasarke.net)\n\nPeer discovery was stalling on flaky/overloaded public MQTT brokers —\nlive diagnostics showed 29/33 peer connections never exchanged SDP (never\nleft the empty ICE state), so the relay/guard fixes couldn''t help. Prepend\na self-hosted mosquitto (behind nginx TLS on the off-ISP VPS, split-horizon\nDNS to the VPS from LAN + public) so discovery no longer depends on public\ninfra. Public defaults kept as fallback; env-overridable via VITE_RELAY_URLS.","tree":{"sha":"3de5d319cc85a6f15417122f6fe005a68120aee6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/3de5d319cc85a6f15417122f6fe005a68120aee6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/commits/88e6313750c21b396e664cae7ff30727dbcc2816","verification":{"payload":null,"reaso