,"gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wdunn001","id":4011100,"login":"wdunn001","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTExMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wdunn001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/commits/17e5b39530a1b123abb652b914c0b8489d6e904c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T19:09:16Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T19:09:16Z","email":"wdunn001@gmail.com","name":"wdunn001"},"message":"fix(mesh-core): tolerate a stage host that omits loadedStages.wireDtype\n\nA capable communal host running a bundle that predates the f16-wire\nfield advertises loadedStages entries without wireDtype (JSON drops the\nundefined key). isMeshLoadedStage hard-required wireDtype in {f32,f16},\nso the guard rejected the ENTIRE cap -> the host silently vanished from\nthe mesh the moment it loaded a stage (only peers with a non-empty\nloadedStages hit the check). In a P2P mesh you can''t guarantee identical\nbundles, and the code already treats descriptor fields as additive.\n\n- guard: wireDtype optional (reject only a present-but-invalid value)\n- type: MeshLoadedStage.wireDtype optional, documented as f16-on-absent\n- collectCommunalAds: default a dtype-less ad to f16 so the activation\n  wire encoder never sees undefined\n- regression tests for accept/reject/default","tree":{"sha":"e2c5714168b09cfdbec07e21133d177143d2c38e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wdunn001/Unstable-legion/git/trees/e2c5714168b09cfdbec07e21133d177143d2c38e"},"url":"https://api.githu