":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/fe58872982235788a26d04f86e0c98431d3ec2c8","node_id":"C_kwDOScuOy9oAKGZlNTg4NzI5ODIyMzU3ODhhMjZkMDRmODZlMGM5ODQzMWQzZWMyYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/7494ca226716807535e597da4e4afacadc6bf330","sha":"7494ca226716807535e597da4e4afacadc6bf330","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/7494ca226716807535e597da4e4afacadc6bf330"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/751e993b0a92d7d82c3d0e15460fcfaf3601844b","sha":"751e993b0a92d7d82c3d0e15460fcfaf3601844b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/751e993b0a92d7d82c3d0e15460fcfaf3601844b"}],"sha":"fe58872982235788a26d04f86e0c98431d3ec2c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/fe58872982235788a26d04f86e0c98431d3ec2c8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/751e993b0a92d7d82c3d0e15460fcfaf3601844b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T00:40:46Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"rawritude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T00:40:46Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"rawritude"},"message":"fix(contract): close audit M-2 + Lows from pop-civ review\n\nM-2 (population zero-injection for legacy parents):\nread_latent_for_breeding now synthesizes pop alleles (latent[16/17/18]\n= D / R1 / R2) from the visible-DNA byte 18 when a parent has no stored\nlatent. Mirrors the M-3 trait-slot fix from the earlier audit cycle so\nlegacy parents contribute their visible population for 100% of samples\ninstead of injecting pop = 0 (Humanoid) 30% of the time. Pinned by\nlegacy_parent_contributes_visible_population_not_zero, which strips a\nparent''s Latent storage to fake a pre-dominance planet and asserts the\nchild''s population reflects the visible byte.\n\nLows:\n- read_civ_tier now clamps with min(raw, 4) instead of `raw as u8`, so\n  any out-of-range value already in storage can''t surface as garbage.\n- Conjoin civ_tier comment rewritten to match the min(a,b) code — the\n  child is pinned by the WEAKER parent, not the stronger one. Also\n  documents the legacy-parent → tier 0 seeding (audit M-3) explicitly.\n- mix_token_id_into_latent removed. The helper had been narrowed to\n  XOR id[3] into byte 19, which is a no-op for token_ids < 2^24 (every\n  id we''ll see in practice) and which sat in the still-reserved tail\n  no caller reads. Every byte the helper used to touch is now stirred\n  in-place by the per-byte writes in latent_from_seed (pop bytes) or\n  by the audit-M1 trait stir.\n\n48 contract tests pass (was 47), web/art unchanged. WASM 44,473 bytes\n(under 50 KB gate). clippy + fmt clean.","tree":{"sha":"5a3c94be583cccc32789c5739379fbb8b9081f7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/trees/5a3c94be583cccc32789c5739379fbb8b9081f7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/commits/751e993b0a92d7d82c3d0e15460fcfaf3601844b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/751e993b0a92d7d82c3d0e15460fcfaf3601844b","node_id":"C_kwDOScuOy9oAKDc1MWU5OTNiMGE5MmQ3ZDgyYzNkMGUxNTQ2MGZjZmFmMzYwMTg0NGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/0caf99bb1983f3acb897c9a946e16999f8a51ecf","sha":"0caf99bb1983f3acb897c9a946e16999f8a51ecf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/0caf99bb1983f3acb897c9a946e16999f8a51ecf"}],"sha":"751e993b0a92d7d82c3d0e15460fcfaf3601844b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/751e993b0a92d7d82c3d0e15460fcfaf3601844b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/0caf99bb1983f3acb897c9a946e16999f8a51ecf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T00:25:12Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"rawritude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T00:25:12Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"rawritude"},"message":"feat(contract): on-chain Population gene + civ_tier (closes #26, game-audit F15)\n\nAdds two on-chain concepts that previously existed only in the frontend.\n\nPopulation gene\n- Lives in the latent blob''s reserved region: latent[16/17/18] are the\n  expressed D / R1 / R2 alleles. `population_of_latent` returns\n  `latent[16] % 6` — the public-facing population type 0..5 mapping to\n  POPULATIONS in art/src/scene.ts.\n- Inheritance reuses the existing 70/22/8 D/R1/R2 dominance weights via\n  `sample_allele`, with the same swap-bit + R2-pool + mutation logic as\n  the trait-slot loop. Entropy bytes rr[7]/15/23/31 (correlated with\n  trait slot 7 — benign because population is a separate 0..5 domain).\n- Genesis seeds D/R1/R2 from seed bytes 24/25/26 XOR''d with token_id so\n  same-round siblings get distinct populations. `mix_token_id_into_latent`\n  narrowed to byte 19 only so it never double-stirs the pop trio.\n- New view `population_of(id)` + `PopulationExpressed` event emitted on\n  both reveal_genesis and reveal_conjoin.\n\nciv_tier (additive — Vitals struct untouched)\n- New `DataKey::CivTier(u32)` stores tier 0..=4 as u32 (Soroban storage\n  doesn''t accept u8). Pre-civ-tier planets get a 0 fallback in reads.\n- Genesis seeds tier 0. Conjoin child starts at\n  `min(parent_a.tier, parent_b.tier)` so Spacefaring parents don''t gift\n  progress; tier is earned per-planet.\n- `care` re-evaluates `stats::civ_signal(updated, class)` (0..255) and\n  ratchets the stored tier up to `min(4, signal / 51)`. Ratchet-only —\n  care never demotes. A fallen signal lazily caps future progression\n  rather than persisting a write on every read.\n- `civ_signal` is class-aware: Bloom/Jungle/Ocean weight biomass 60%;\n  Lava/Cinder/Forge weight temperature 60%; Crystal/Quartz weight low\n  hydration 50%; Hollow/Void weight low biomass 50%; Ice/Mist/Gas/Aether\n  weight spirit 50%; rest fall back to balanced 5-way average. Fixed\n  /100 integer math (no_std friendly), terms cap with saturating_add.\n- New view `civ_tier_of(id)` reads stored value directly (no projection\n  demotion). `CivTierChanged` event fires on ratchet. extend_planet_ttl\n  covers the new key with a `has` guard.\n\nTests (7 new — total 47)\n- genesis_writes_population_byte: 0xAA seed → pop 2 (Avian)\n- population_propagates_through_conjoin: child D drawn from parent allele\n- civ_tier_starts_at_zero_for_genesis\n- civ_tier_ratchets_up_on_care: Bloom + repeated Tend climbs to tier 4\n- civ_tier_class_aware_hollow_thrives_on_low_biomass: Hollow with decayed\n  biomass climbs; same Hollow with high biomass stays low\n- civ_tier_view_falls_back_to_zero_for_legacy_planets\n- population_of_unknown_planet_errors\n\nValidation: cargo fmt, cargo clippy -D warnings, 47/47 cargo tests,\nstellar contract build (planet.wasm ≈ 44.5 KB / 50 KB gate),\nweb tsc --noEmit clean, 17/17 vitest, 43/43 art tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1228aac837145c8548da39847b3ceac969326c52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/trees/1228aac837145c8548da39847b3ceac969326c52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/commits/0caf99bb1983f3acb897c9a946e16999f8a51ecf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/0caf99bb1983f3acb897c9a946e16999f8a51ecf","node_id":"C_kwDOScuOy9oAKDBjYWY5OWJiMTk4M2YzYWNiODk3YzlhOTQ2ZTE2OTk5ZjhhNTFlY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/1884f1585505f85dcc8f4b374262e5452f73ea88","sha":"1884f1585505f85dcc8f4b374262e5452f73ea88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/1884f1585505f85dcc8f4b374262e5452f73ea88"}],"sha":"0caf99bb1983f3acb897c9a946e16999f8a51ecf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/0caf99bb1983f3acb897c9a946e16999f8a51ecf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/7494ca226716807535e597da4e4afacadc6bf330/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T00:23:53Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"rawritude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T00:23:53Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"rawritude"},"message":"docs: fresh galaxy + surface shots, richer image alt text\n\nGalaxy.png captured with a planet selected so both floating panels\nappear in a single shot — SECTORS legend top-right + PLANET #0\ndetail bottom-right.\n\nSurface.png re-captured against design-system-v2 modal chrome —\nplanet #2''s HIVE × INDUSTRIAL side scene (green mound architecture,\npink kelp, lit windows, inhabitants along the horizon). The old\nshot predated the design-token sweep.\n\nREADME captions expanded:\n- Surface section walks the composition pipeline + flags that the\n  in-flight contract-pop-civ branch promotes population + civ tier\n  on-chain.\n- Galaxy caption calls out both floating panels.","tree":{"sha":"9b6e5008b7d1b29a5574e93281c5b752502ca37f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/trees/9b6e5008b7d1b29a5574e93281c5b752502ca37f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/commits/7494ca226716807535e597da4e4afacadc6bf330","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/7494ca226716807535e597da4e4afacadc6bf330","node_id":"C_kwDOScuOy9oAKDc0OTRjYTIyNjcxNjgwNzUzNWU1OTdkYTRlNGFmYWNhZGM2YmYzMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/1884f1585505f85dcc8f4b374262e5452f73ea88","sha":"1884f1585505f85dcc8f4b374262e5452f73ea88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/1884f1585505f85dcc8f4b374262e5452f73ea88"}],"sha":"7494ca226716807535e597da4e4afacadc6bf330","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/7494ca226716807535e597da4e4afacadc6bf330"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/1884f1585505f85dcc8f4b374262e5452f73ea88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T00:14:53Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"rawritude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T00:14:53Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"rawritude"},"message":"fix(web): clamp planet sprite to its card so it never overflows\n\nThe canvas had a hard-coded width/height of NATIVE_SIZE * scale (e.g.\n192 px at scale 3). When the gallery grid dropped a card below that\nwidth — which happens in the genesis gallery''s narrower auto-fit\ncolumns — the sprite spilled outside the card border.\n\nAdd maxWidth: 100% + height: auto so the browser scales the canvas\ndown to its container. image-rendering: pixelated keeps the art crisp\nthrough the downscale. The canvas raster stays at full resolution, so\nanimations + rarity overlays don''t lose detail.\n\nAlso marks the canvas with the .pixel-sprite class to inherit the\ndisplay: block + max-width rule from the kit.","tree":{"sha":"3036a59f209df2ecf295f53488442fb883238649","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/trees/3036a59f209df2ecf295f53488442fb883238649"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/commits/1884f1585505f85dcc8f4b374262e5452f73ea88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/r