.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/4773ecf2dc48614664a50bccc814db3b494f0d52"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/5834ae63184b4ac3e6d7f0c64b1df87287649471/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T00:10:30Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"rawritude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T00:10:30Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"rawritude"},"message":"feat(web): galaxy + conjunction pages match Cosmocopia Web UI Kit\n\nGalaxy:\n- /galaxy is now full-bleed (.galaxy-page / .galaxy-masthead /\n  .galaxy-stage) — no max-width, canvas fills the stage edge to edge.\n- Sectors moved into a top-right floating panel (.floating-panel\n  .galaxy-legend) with the kit''s solid-green title bar.\n- Selected planet detail surfaces as a bottom-right floating panel\n  (.floating-panel .galaxy-detail) when a planet is clicked, instead\n  of a sidebar.\n- A small .galaxy-hint chip in the bottom-left reports count + the\n  drag/scroll/click controls.\n- Masthead reuses .hero-mark + .hero-title so the wordmark stays in\n  the same typographic system as Home.\n\nConjunction (new page):\n- /conjunction route mounts a 5-column .conjoin-grid:\n  parent A | + | parent B | = | child.\n- Empty parent slots use .conjoin-slot.empty (dashed border, hover\n  goes to primary). Filled slots get a card-titlebar showing \"parent\n  a/b\" + token id.\n- Child slot previews the midpoint coords; renders \"an unknown world\n  awaits\" until both parents are picked, then explains that art is\n  sealed until reveal.\n- \"commit-reveal\" panel below the grid has the big CONJOIN btn-primary\n  and a live progress line (committing → waiting (N ledgers) →\n  revealing → done).\n- \"your candidates\" gallery underneath: click any planet to slot it\n  into A, click another for B; clicking an already-slotted planet\n  clears it. .card.has-titlebar.pickable with .picked highlight.\n\nTopNav:\n- Conjunction tab now points at /conjunction (was /?conjoin=1).\n- TopNav.tsx simplified to a match-function array.","tree":{"sha":"c07eedcc9e4bdf779b9c5f946507025054303eeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/trees/c07eedcc9e4bdf779b9c5f946507025054303eeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/commits/5834ae63184b4ac3e6d7f0c64b1df87287649471","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.