s","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/f06f1952ec04410e6b27199416c15cd470ba6fb6","node_id":"C_kwDOScuOy9oAKGYwNmYxOTUyZWMwNDQxMGU2YjI3MTk5NDE2YzE1Y2Q0NzBiYTZmYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/32e45027d745bdb9f46c8e089cd9c2531f69a6d0","sha":"32e45027d745bdb9f46c8e089cd9c2531f69a6d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/32e45027d745bdb9f46c8e089cd9c2531f69a6d0"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/1e572d4380b04a21748cf09a9205b3950cffa1ef","sha":"1e572d4380b04a21748cf09a9205b3950cffa1ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/1e572d4380b04a21748cf09a9205b3950cffa1ef"}],"sha":"f06f1952ec04410e6b27199416c15cd470ba6fb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/f06f1952ec04410e6b27199416c15cd470ba6fb6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/1e572d4380b04a21748cf09a9205b3950cffa1ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T23:59:43Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"rawritude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T23:59:43Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"rawritude"},"message":"feat(web): match Cosmocopia Web UI Kit reference design\n\nThe user provided web/Cosmocopia Web UI Kit.html as the canonical\nreference. This commit ports its visual language into the live app.\n\nWhat''s new structurally:\n\n- TopNav (`.kit-tabs`) — sticky black bar at the top with HOME / GALAXY\n  / CONJUNCTION tabs. Active tab is a solid green slab with dark text;\n  inactive tabs are stardust on transparent.\n- Hero HUD (`.hero-hud`) — replaces the old `.hero` flex bar with a\n  three-zone grid: planet glyph + wordmark + subtitle on the left, three\n  telemetry stat tiles (DRAND / CLASSES / SECTORS) on the right, and an\n  identity strip across the bottom with the description text + galaxy\n  link + connect button. The planet glyph has a slowly-rotating dashed\n  orbit ring (steps(12, end), 24s — observatory-dial feel).\n- Panel title bars (`.panel-titlebar`) — replaces standalone h2s with a\n  solid green title block + dark uppercase text + a hatched stripe area\n  filling the remaining width. Applies to the owned-planets panel,\n  tinker / traits, genesis gallery, what''s next.\n- Card title bars (`.card-titlebar`) — each owned planet card now has a\n  thin black title bar showing `#<id>` + coords with a stardust hatched\n  stripe between them. Card padding moves inside the body so the title\n  bar runs flush.\n- Button system (`.btn .btn-primary / .btn-secondary / .btn-ghost\n  .btn-sm`) — pixel-chrome typography, hard offset shadow, translates on\n  active. Replaces the per-component button styles.\n- Vital rows (`.vital / .vital-glyph / .vital-bar / .vital-fill[\n  data-state]`) — renamed from `.vitalRow` for parity with the kit; fill\n  state (`good / warn / bad`) drives color via `[data-state]` selectors\n  instead of inline style.\n- Wallet chip (`.chip`) — pulsing auroral dot + monospace identity; same\n  pill shape as before but now matches the kit''s exact treatment. The\n  disconnect button is now a `.btn-ghost`.\n\nThe old class names (`.walletChip`, `.careRow`, `.careBtn`, plain h2\nsection headings) remain in globals.css for now so any component still\nreferencing them keeps working; future PRs can sweep them out once the\nkit covers every surface.\n\nValidation: tsc clean, 17 vitest pass, next build green.","tree":{"sha":"ea34bf21b5f8127dee4ebdbecb74c42e2654f923","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/trees/ea34bf21b5f8127dee4ebdbecb74c42e2654f923"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/commits/1e572d4380b04a21748cf09a9205b3950cffa1ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/1e572d4380b04a21748cf09a9205b3950cffa1ef","node_id":"C_kwDOScuOy9oAKDFlNTcyZDQzODBiMDRhMjE3NDhjZjA5YTkyMDViMzk1MGNmZmExZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/32e45027d745bdb9f46c8e089cd9c2531f69a6d0","sha":"32e45027d745bdb9f46c8e089cd9c2531f69a6d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/32e45027d745bdb9f46c8e089cd9c2531f69a6d0"}],"sha":"1e572d4380b04a21748cf09a9205b3950cffa1ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/1e572d4380b04a21748cf09a9205b3950cffa1ef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/32e45027d745bdb9f46c8e089cd9c2531f69a6d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T22:40:56Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"rawritude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T22:40:56Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"rawritude"},"message":"chore: redeploy contract — new address + bindings + README\n\nDeployed the dominance + audit-fix WASM to Stellar testnet at:\n  CB2YFH74ZJDTWELOVK4JYL5LP4A6LCTPSDTDWIFDUDERXV2TPZ7UCKDK\n\nSeeded 4 genesis planets via commit-reveal (token ids 0-3 at coords\n(0,0), (5,5), (-12,8), (30,-10)) to the deployer address.\n\n- Regenerated TS bindings — adds the `latent_of(id)` view returning the\n  R1/R2 allele blob.\n- README live-deployment block now points at the new contract id and\n  reflects the post-audit feature set + test counts (40 contract / 43\n  art / 17 vitest).\n- web/.env.local (gitignored) is updated locally by the deploy script.","tree":{"sha":"3ec2d50aec21eca0e38ebf3cd2ad7f0831a8762b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/trees/3ec2d50aec21eca0e38ebf3cd2ad7f0831a8762b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/commits/32e45027d745bdb9f46c8e089cd9c2531f69a6d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"h