d37349a06131a2","node_id":"C_kwDOScuOy9oAKDMwMzgyZjM4MjViYjRkNDhhMDY0NDY5YzIyZDM3MzQ5YTA2MTMxYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/1a554f689fae8faeeeeca6dd60acf9252baa9d70","sha":"1a554f689fae8faeeeeca6dd60acf9252baa9d70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/1a554f689fae8faeeeeca6dd60acf9252baa9d70"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/442b6188d9db181545d785814b070fc52d48648a","sha":"442b6188d9db181545d785814b070fc52d48648a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/442b6188d9db181545d785814b070fc52d48648a"}],"sha":"30382f3825bb4d48a064469c22d37349a06131a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/30382f3825bb4d48a064469c22d37349a06131a2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/442b6188d9db181545d785814b070fc52d48648a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T21:54:36Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"rawritude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T21:54:36Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"rawritude"},"message":"feat: rarity tiers + planet view (surface side-scene)\n\nTwo pure-frontend features that compose into one experience.\n\nRarity v1 (Common→Mystic):\n- art/src/rarity.ts derives a tier from existing DNA + coords with a\n  per-source contribution log. Cutoffs tuned so uniformly-random DNA\n  yields ~50% Common, ~33% Rare, ~14% Epic, ~3% Legendary, <1% Mystic.\n- Score sources: class mythics/exotics, atmosphere/feature/aura rarity\n  with intensity bonuses, ring + moon counts, stored rarity nibble,\n  generation 0 scarcity, combo bonuses, and galaxy coordinate scarcity.\n- RarityBadge component with tier-colored pill + hover tooltip listing\n  the full score breakdown. Mystic + Legendary get a slow CSS shimmer.\n- PlanetSprite gains an rAF animation overlay: Rare → breathing aura,\n  Epic → orbital sparkles, Legendary → rotating halo, Mystic stacks\n  corona arcs + particle ring. Common stays static (no loop).\n- Traits panel leads with the tier badge + score.\n- 19 unit tests for the scorer covering each source, combos, location,\n  and distribution shape.\n\nPlanet view (visit surface →):\n- art/src/scene.ts: deterministic 160×96 pixel scene composer producing\n  sky gradient (atmosphere-tinted), sun arc + star field driven by a\n  day-cycle time parameter, terrain band, trees/kelp/crystals,\n  procedural buildings (style varies by population + civ tier), and\n  animated inhabitants (walk/fly/swim/burrow) with footstep bobs and\n  wing-flaps.\n- Population (6 types) derived from DNA byte 18; civ tier (5 stages)\n  from (temperature + biomass + spirit) / 3. These move on-chain when\n  the contract grows real Population + civ_tier fields.\n- PlanetView modal: rAF-driven, 60s day cycle, scaled 4× from native.\n  Opened from each planet card''s \"visit surface →\" button.\n- 8 scene tests (determinism, day/night diff, civ-tier bucketing).","tree":{"sha":"074dfda2b48e0842b29ee0c8a2fcf378eaab5b