/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/25614a7355b598f9e2610612ce0ca40558946436/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T20:42:21Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"raph"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T20:42:21Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"raph"},"message":"feat(contract): enumerable + audit fixes + redeploy\n\nContract refactor (one redeploy cycle):\n- Switch NonFungibleToken ContractType from Base to Enumerable;\n  expose total_supply, get_token_id, get_owner_token_id. Frontend\n  drops the O(N) brute-force scan in favour of these.\n- Audit Critical #4: extend_planet_ttl now fires on care/migrate/\n  vitals_of/dna_of/coords_of/extend, not only at mint. Adds a public\n  `extend(id)` anyone can call to refresh a planet''s TTL. Closes\n  silent-data-loss after 30 days of inactivity.\n- Audit High #1: conjoin now requires ''to == owner_a || to == owner_b''\n  (RecipientNotParentOwner = #9). Closes NFT-spam-to-victim.\n- Audit Medium upgrade-path: set_admin + set_drand for rotation\n  without redeploy. ConfigChanged event for governance audit trail.\n- Audit Low #1: set_cooldown range-guarded [30, 30·17280] ledgers;\n  emits ConfigChanged. CooldownOutOfRange = #10.\n- Audit Low #4: coords_of returns Result<(i32,i32), UnknownPlanet>\n  instead of silently (0,0).\n- Audit Informational #1: from_seed and crossover take a token_id;\n  XOR''d into the salt region so same-round mints stay distinct.\n- Audit Informational #2: Born event has owner as a topic now —\n  indexers can filter all-borns-to-X without scanning.\n- Removed dead DataKey::Treasury (audit Low #2).\n- 24/24 contract tests (added: conjoin_rejects_recipient_not_parent_owner,\n  set_cooldown_rejects_out_of_range, set_admin_rotates_admin,\n  set_drand_rotates_verifier, extend_succeeds_for_existing_planet,\n  extend_rejects_unknown_planet, enumerable_views_present_via_trait).\n\nFrontend:\n- Audit High #5: unwrapResult now dispatches on tagged-union {tag:''Ok''|\n  ''Err'', values}; throws loudly on Err instead of silently returning\n  undefined.\n- listOwnedPlanets/listAllPlanets use the enumerable trait, dropping\n  the brute-force scan. Parallel get_token_id/get_owner_token_id calls.\n- New totalSupply() helper.\n- Vitest suite updated for the new shape (16 tests, including a new\n  unwrapResult-on-Err test).\n\nRedeployed to testnet:\n  CCV2FVBG4Q7HXM3NYS7GA5QMDGU5474HF6WKW6Y6KOW74QN453ZGRJTX\n4 genesis planets seeded, total_supply=4 verified via live RPC.\n\nCloses audit findings: Critical #3, #4; High #1, #5; Medium upgrade\npath; Low #1, #2, #4; Informational #1, #2, #3.\n\nStill open (separate task): Critical #1, #2 — commit-reveal mint\nto eliminate DNA grinding; tracked as task #21.","tree":{"sha":"04ccf15bc627f6325059e97d96240ea6b0e9673f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/trees/04ccf15bc627f6325059e97d96240ea6b0e9673f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/commits/25614a7355b598f9e2610612ce0ca40558946436","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https