nts{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/feacd96d9bea1968f24303668f0aa37709ab96e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T19:36:03Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"raph"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T19:36:03Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"raph"},"message":"feat(web): wire conjoin for both wallet paths\n\nsubmitConjoin(parentA, parentB, walletState) mirrors submitCare:\n- fetches the current drand round off-chain via stellar-sdk so the\n  contract''s get(round) call has a stable footprint\n- classic wallet: builds AssembledTransaction with the user''s G-key as\n  source, signs via StellarWalletsKit.signTransaction, submits\n- passkey wallet: builds with kit.deployerPublicKey as fee-payer source,\n  hands off to SmartAccountKit.signAndSubmit (WebAuthn auth-entry signing\n  + re-simulate + fee-payer sign + submit)\n\nAdded latestDrandRound() helper that calls latest() on the Drand-Relay\nverifier and decodes the [round, randomness] tuple via scValToNative.\n\nUI: OwnedPlanets now has a ''conjoin two planets'' toggle. In conjoin mode\ncards become pickable; selecting two reveals the conjoin button. Round\nis fetched at submit time, child is born at the parents'' midpoint\ncoordinates with crossed-over DNA + drand-driven mutation.","tree":{"sha":"cad71ddf534c3c192e4c92ba6144eebb6e64f721","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/trees/cad71ddf534c3c192e4c92ba6144eebb6e64f721"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/commits/feacd96d9bea1968f24303668f0aa37709ab96e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/feacd96d9bea1968f24303668f0aa37709ab96e4","node_id":"C_kwDOScuOy9oAKGZlYWNkOTZkOWJlYTE5NjhmMjQzMDM2NjhmMGFhMzc3MDlhYjk2ZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/48b656188bccd5bb2352448c3512f65e3b684145","sha":"48b656188bccd5bb2352448c3512f65e3b684145","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/48b656188bccd5bb2352448c3512f65e3b684145"}],"sha":"feacd96d9bea1968f24303668f0aa37709ab96e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/feacd96d9bea1968f24303668f0aa37709ab96e4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/48b656188bccd5bb2352448c3512f65e3b684145/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T19:31:23Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"raph"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T19:31:23Z","email":"raphlf@gmail.com","name":"raph"},"message":"feat(web): wire passkey signing for care actions\n\nsubmitCare now branches on wallet.kind:\n- classic wallets sign via Stellar Wallets Kit (existing flow)\n- passkey wallets build the AssembledTransaction with the kit''s\n  deterministic deployerPublicKey as fee-payer source, then hand it to\n  SmartAccountKit.signAndSubmit, which:\n    1. Signs auth entries via WebAuthn\n    2. Re-simulates (WebAuthn sigs are larger than placeholders)\n    3. Assembles with correct fees\n    4. Signs with fee payer and submits\n\nExposes getPasskeyKit() from wallet-context for downstream use.\n\nAdds scripts/transfer-planet.sh — CLI helper that transfers a seeded\nplanet from the deployer to any C... smart-account address, so the\npasskey-care flow can be exercised end-to-end on testnet.","tree":{"sha":"c75323e1817694c509d36b7484fe3046e35bec71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/trees/c75323e1817694c509d36b7484fe3046e35bec71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/git/commits/48b656188bccd5bb2352448c3512f65e3b684145","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7675978?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude","id":7675978,"login":"rawritude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzU5Nzg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rawritude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/48b656188bccd5bb2352448c3512f65e3b684145","node_id":"C_kwDOScuOy9oAKDQ4YjY1NjE4OGJjY2Q1YmIyMzUyNDQ4YzM1MTJmNjVlM2I2ODQxNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rawritude/cosmocopia/commit/e6374fe4052a3c8eb8789c0df8dad1928076fcb0","sha":"e6374fe4052a3c8eb8789c0df8dad1928076fcb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rawritude/cosmocopia/commits/e6374fe4052a3c8eb8789c0df8dad1928076fcb0"}],"sha":"48b656188bccd5bb2352448c3512f65e3b684