"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bargadev/lakonai/commit/5e63be13991965c6be095de292e068d3546cf5e0","node_id":"C_kwDOScz88NoAKDVlNjNiZTEzOTkxOTY1YzZiZTA5NWRlMjkyZTA2OGQzNTQ2Y2Y1ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bargadev/lakonai/commit/42aa162f076af450e506de53fd4027f840cc3d26","sha":"42aa162f076af450e506de53fd4027f840cc3d26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/commits/42aa162f076af450e506de53fd4027f840cc3d26"}],"sha":"5e63be13991965c6be095de292e068d3546cf5e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/commits/5e63be13991965c6be095de292e068d3546cf5e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17840539?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bargadev","id":17840539,"login":"bargadev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODQwNTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/commits/42aa162f076af450e506de53fd4027f840cc3d26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T02:15:00Z","email":"lucasmpbarga@gmail.com","name":"Lucas Barga"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T02:15:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: close the README (visual hero, real hero number, GitHub link, credits) + v1.2.2 (#38)\n\nEmbed a self-contained before/after SVG at the top of the README showing the\nreal measured `git diff main…HEAD` result (1,513,910 → 2,331 tokens, −99.8%),\nso npm/GitHub readers see the visual proof in the first fold.\n\n- Hero: \"up to 94%\" → the measured \"up to 99.8%\", with the concrete\n  1.5M → 2.3k token line underneath (specific beats rounded).\n- Add an explicit GitHub repo link/badge to the first fold (npm README had none).\n- Reframe Credits so lakonai reads as an original zero-dependency tool: prior\n  art (caveman/graphify/rtk) is credited as inspiration, not vendored or forked;\n  caveman''s MIT credit is retained.\n- Correct stale test counts (725/47 → 751/48) since publishing re-renders the\n  npm page; layer split re-measured from the live suite.\n\nnpm re-renders the README only on publish, so this ships with a version bump\n(1.2.1 → 1.2.2) and a matching CHANGELOG entry. CI publishes on merge to main.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38dd87b695ea60790653317e31bdc5466ccf5fc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/git/trees/38dd87b695ea60790653317e31bdc5466ccf5fc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/git/commits/42aa162f076af450e506de53fd4027f840cc3d26","verification":{"payload":"tree 38dd87b695ea60790653317e31bdc5466ccf5fc5\nparent d9fb90b3dcde831d55533a11d473a6288bca1f66\nauthor Lucas Barga <lucasmpbarga@gmail.com> 1788401700 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788401700 -0300\n\ndocs: close the README (visual hero, real hero number, GitHub link, credits) + v1.2.2 (#38)\n\nEmbed a self-contained before/after SVG at the top of the README showing the\nreal measured `git diff main…HEAD` result (1,513,910 → 2,331 tokens, −99.8%),\nso npm/GitHub readers see the visual proof in the first fold.\n\n- Hero: \"up to 94%\" → the measured \"up to 99.8%\", with the concrete\n  1.5M → 2.3k token line underneath (specific beats rounded).\n- Add an explicit GitHub repo link/badge to the first fold (npm README had none).\n- Reframe Credits so lakonai reads as an original zero-dependency tool: prior\n  art (caveman/graphify/rtk) is credited as inspiration, not vendored or forked;\n  caveman''s MIT credit is retained.\n- Correct stale test counts (725/47 → 751/48) since publishing re-renders the\n  npm page; layer split re-measured from the live suite.\n\nnpm re-renders the README only on publish, so this ships with a version bump\n(1.2.1 → 1.2.2) and a matching CHANGELOG entry. CI publishes on merge to main.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmNgkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5HsQAGuhfkTL+8yafGejubzco3pW\nrN37XRz4WuQ6/ASjOUKHOU3EF+OeX7DnoJInciIpMDCBcHKCnYNVp4zApwDVpleu\n83EYEREIJovx/q3Se4nUO8R/+tRYKx4KYOCYA/aSMdbgGl79YwwCgWj0EUzf0P+V\nlz+EsJXLqoSc6JGvixz2hj1TY8A7/CxycNxEUoRjcI9VF86wRkFFUuOvt8es6mc0\nyfsVDP7y99XnZdEXzgTLjlD7tJu7bRok+cR4nj/88M3OD5YFZrhOQQd1R17NkUGh\necOlzFWkAhVkq5J6N8jcFDA8UQtYlh2aCot+jzUiKXPLmEK4BK/Kv8mDAQxuBCEY\nHko/aREthziiBIzcuOjn7Oj1KFivAdqKFWbqKs0tJgk8sIOTPV/W4vUo10nQMJ4o\nhI9Xfp/NGFZte6sctIx+qFlr2cm5xPRiRC0QEw1SgdE3KVGrH1iNABOHNLeC6JIB\n9r8znFtsUn0jRT0PCZ/GiltayR9bc6eHuH6I4h4aLacuqO3nW9rX7VlWvTH/N/Va\nIA4gyiqeFj8xbETwb7kZ+UOtDKVr+nCuaBW8cTFHaShW/Qk3QEnBb/ndMUcaony2\nyKTcujKb1BBCnZ4IZ8KO8fA4FciXsZiKyxXp4dZYBg4zZq7SBWTT6dwE3mKQ+j6d\nFImXTpGWEZuAs/+30nDY\n=ezTn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-03T02:15:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-fl