4:18Z","email":"lucasmpbarga@gmail.com","name":"Lucas Barga"},"message":"feat: auto-build graph on session start for new git projects\n\nOn SessionStart, walk up from cwd to find the git root. If\nlakonai-graph/graph.json doesn''t exist, trigger `lakonai graph build`\nas a detached background process and surface a notice to the agent.\n\nFire-and-forget — never blocks the session. Existing projects (graph\nalready built) see no change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"555fb53d4aca7c279290d1fddce499ef55dd8b56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/git/trees/555fb53d4aca7c279290d1fddce499ef55dd8b56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/git/commits/98ffaad55767fca54a468b6f717ef3e4d95d22bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17840539?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bargadev","id":17840539,"login":"bargadev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODQwNTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bargadev/lakonai/commit/98ffaad55767fca54a468b6f717ef3e4d95d22bf","node_id":"C_kwDOScz88NoAKDk4ZmZhYWQ1NTc2N2ZjYTU0YTQ2OGI2ZjcxN2VmM2U0ZDk1ZDIyYm