prompt.js).\n- compress-memory takes a freeform instruction + validation levels: default\n  (lossless), --prune (code-only), --rewrite (free restructure, backup-only).\n- install offers the shim only when a hook-less agent is detected (Claude Code''s\n  hooks already cover it).\n- Removed `lakonai backups` command (revert is what matters; helper stays).\n- README rewritten lean (442 → ~170 lines, < caveman); reference moved to\n  docs/reference.md. Em dashes removed project-wide.\n\n351 tests, coverage gate green.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e55e850033b1adb28a9f06d7cb17a27f30d98e7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/git/trees/e55e850033b1adb28a9f06d7cb17a27f30d98e7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/git/commits/54da94d31d889084e04605461ada135b753a7c21","verification":{"payload":"tree e55e850033b1adb28a9f06d7cb17a27f30d98e7c\nparent 40da00b6a579310aafc404bbfd3e4fe23040f435\nauthor Lucas Barga <lucasmpbarga@gmail.com> 1780423349 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780423349 -0300\n\nfeat: 0.16.0 — output-savings in gain, upgrade, steerable compress-memory, leaner surface (#8)\n\n- gain now shows OUTPUT savings (terser model output) via the local AI CLI, no\n  API key, system-prompt method, weekly/TTY-only, cached (src/output-bench.js).\n- `lakonai upgrade`: self-update via detected package manager + rule refresh;\n  oh-my-zsh-style \"Update now? [Y/n]\" at a TTY (src/upgrade.js, update-prompt.js).\n- compress-memory takes a freeform instruction + validation levels: default\n  (lossless), --prune (code-only), --rewrite (free restructure, backup-only).\n- install offers the shim only when a hook-less agent is detected (Claude Code''s\n  hooks already cover it).\n- Removed `lakonai backups` command (revert is what matters; helper stays).\n- README rewritten lean (442 → ~170 lines, < caveman); reference moved to\n  docs/reference.md. Em dashes removed project-wide.\n\n351 test