 over-matching matched plain words;\n  placeholder restore broke on whitespace collapse) — now NUL-delimited spans and\n  separator/camelCase-only identifiers. Code/URLs/paths/params preserved exactly.\n- Remove the standalone lakonai-shrink/ package.\n- README (command + MCP section), CHANGELOG, lakonai-spec agent updated.\n\n301 tests, 100% coverage.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ecf7f514c86abb2e9e5b3aa6f2929e84e86787c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/git/trees/1ecf7f514c86abb2e9e5b3aa6f2929e84e86787c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/git/commits/6cf2f876d27cc78d586daf00915079971a2019da","verification":{"payload":"tree 1ecf7f514c86abb2e9e5b3aa6f2929e84e86787c\nparent e2cca294c460f11dd16fd6480d4dedc1939a8fe1\nauthor Lucas Barga <lucasmpbarga@gmail.com> 1780160963 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780160963 -0300\n\nfeat: bundle MCP shrink into lakonai as `lakonai shrink` (0.11.0) (#5)\n\n- Fold the separate lakonai-shrink package into src/shrink.js as a `lakonai shrink\n  <upstream-cmd>` subcommand — one install, one version, reuses the terse style.\n- Fix a description-compression bug (identifier over-matching matched plain words;\n  placeholder restore broke on whitespace collapse) — now NUL-delimited spans and\n  separator/camelCase-only identifiers. Code/URLs/paths/params preserved exactly.\n- Remove the standalone lakonai-shrink/ package.\n- README (command + MCP section), CHANGELOG, lakonai-spec agent updated.\n\n301 tests, 100% coverage.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqGxnDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAu3oQABRvqf+ELUQRZP0dIkf5+Kbo\ny7MtS/X7TFWPflOYnrY5k+SpNFvFIEfueqdXv6uMzwGuCL/AJZr8MBiAk+RMH851\nkNHSmgO6e5pDB0Hji/MW2oEsk5655oY1iT/r3WUAehUsBNcc+p4rsUazlNWiD+3f\nIGukq5dZ6/OI3Uuq6zyWD+9OUQG86QtKR4xmvPokWlizFYgiyqoltOzWDStI+Prt\nBrQOhxR7+BghMDOfuxcbbJ/mvO5QN7Uhc9OTostymoB