c6ea47e79e7","node_id":"C_kwDOScz88NoAKGE2NTZiYjMwZTFmODAxMzMyNjFhOWNiNTM3OTgwYzZlYTQ3ZTc5ZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bargadev/lakonai/commit/23c9e90e29d72b53bb2a8282a65005a7a1a99f8c","sha":"23c9e90e29d72b53bb2a8282a65005a7a1a99f8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/commits/23c9e90e29d72b53bb2a8282a65005a7a1a99f8c"}],"sha":"a656bb30e1f80133261a9cb537980c6ea47e79e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/commits/a656bb30e1f80133261a9cb537980c6ea47e79e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17840539?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bargadev","id":17840539,"login":"bargadev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODQwNTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/commits/23c9e90e29d72b53bb2a8282a65005a7a1a99f8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T19:09:40Z","email":"lucasmpbarga@gmail.com","name":"Lucas Barga"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T19:09:40Z","email":"lucasmpbarga@gmail.com","name":"Lucas Barga"},"message":"Expand filtering (engine + test runners + lint/cloud), add auto-learning, rename to lakonai\n\nFiltering:\n- Declarative filter engine (src/filters/engine.js + defs.js) — 9-stage pipeline,\n  one data entry per command: tsc/eslint/ruff/clippy/make/diff/docker/kubectl/\n  aws/pkg-install.\n- Test-runner filter wired into dispatch with stderr capture (jest/vitest/mocha/\n  pytest/ava, npm/pnpm/yarn/bun test, go test, cargo test): collapse passes, keep\n  failures + summary.\n- find filter that groups matches by directory; dedupConsecutive + groupByDir\n  primitives in utils. Coverage now spans ~30 commands.\n\nAuto-learning (beyond rtk''s report-only discover/learn):\n- src/learn.js reads the session transcript at Stop, accumulates per-command\n  output stats across sessions, and auto-promotes chatty unfiltered commands to a\n  conservative near-lossless filter (src/filters/auto.js). Opt out via\n  LAKON_NO_LEARN.\n\nRename lakonai-lib -> lakonai (package.json, README, CLAUDE.md, git remote).\n\nDocs & agent:\n- .claude/agents/lakonai-spec.md (full codebase knowledge) + CLAUDE.md rules to\n  keep the spec agent AND the README in sync with the code on every change.\n- README accuracy fixes (removed-alias claim, grep cap 15, 270 tests), promotes\n  auto-learning, adds the npm-test savings row. Remove completed ROADMAP.\n\nSuite: 270 tests, 100% coverage.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9864453ce86714bd7db2cd2f40b6b0531cb8f620","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/git/trees/9864453ce86714bd7db2cd2f40b6b0531cb8f620"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/git/commits/23c9e90e29d72b53bb2a8282a65005a7a1a99f8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17840539?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bargadev","id":17840539,"login":"bargadev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODQwNTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bargadev/lakonai/commit/23c9e90e29d72b53bb2a8282a65005a7a1a99f8c","node_id":"C_kwDOScz88NoAKDIzYzllOTBlMjlkNzJiNTNiYjJhODI4MmE2NTAwNWE3YTFhOTlmOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bargadev/lakonai/commit/d40590c85c8578a44cf755c878f7c581f5004aa3","sha":"d40590c85c8578a44cf755c878f7c581f5004aa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/commits/d40590c85c8578a44cf755c878f7c581f5004aa3"}],"sha":"23c9e90e29d72b53bb2a8282a65005a7a1a99f8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/commits/23c9e90e29d72b53bb2a8282a65005a7a1a99f8c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17840539?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bargadev","id":17840539,"login":"bargadev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODQwNTM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/commits/d40590c85c8578a44cf755c878f7c581f5004aa3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T14:26:04Z","email":"lucasmpbarga@gmail.com","name":"Lucas Barga"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T14:26:04Z","email":"lucasmpbarga@gmail.com","name":"Lucas Barga"},"message":"Remove lak/lakon aliases; migrate test suite to Jest with 100% coverage\n\nCLI:\n- Drop the `lak` and `lakon` bin aliases — `lakonai` is the only command now.\n  Update HELP, the shipped rule doc, README, and the bash-rewrite skip regex\n  (`/^lakonai(\\s|$)/`); remove the obsolete legacy-alias rewrite tests.\n\nTesting:\n- Migrate from node:test + c8 to Jest (jest.config.js, 80% threshold gate).\n- Make hooks and the CLI testable in-process: export pure logic, guard entry\n  points with `require.main === module`, translate c8→istanbul ignore pragmas.\n- Resolve home via `homedir()` (process.env.HOME || os.homedir()) so tests can\n  isolate HOME under Jest''s sandbox.\n- Add a test-runner output filter (src/filters/test.js) plus full unit coverage.\n  Suite is green at 100% statements/functions/lines, 100% branches.\n\nDocs:\n- Add CLAUDE.md (tests-before-commit policy) and an rtk-parity roadmap.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"837eaa288a4770667a08d1b1f48e85b30cb0e428","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/git/trees/837eaa288a4770667a08d1b1f48e85b30cb0e428"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bargadev/lakonai/git/commits/d40590c85c8578a44cf755c878f7c581f5004aa3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17840539?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bargadev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ba