jE1ZGZiNzkxNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commit/074ad8b09465f0d3fc71acdaa566b2670c3ce8be","sha":"074ad8b09465f0d3fc71acdaa566b2670c3ce8be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/074ad8b09465f0d3fc71acdaa566b2670c3ce8be"}],"sha":"983738ca184d2d57956c6fc93cfabb15dfb79145","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/983738ca184d2d57956c6fc93cfabb15dfb79145"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63979266?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Elesiann","id":63979266,"login":"Elesiann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTc5MjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/074ad8b09465f0d3fc71acdaa566b2670c3ce8be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T04:02:18Z","email":"giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com","name":"Giovani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T04:02:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ci): dispatch security-scan explicitly from Publish, drop workflow_run (#129)\n\n* fix(ci): dispatch security-scan explicitly from Publish, drop workflow_run\n\nrelease.yml starts Publish via workflow_dispatch using GITHUB_TOKEN, and\nGitHub suppresses workflow_run events for GITHUB_TOKEN-authored runs — so\nsecurity-scan.yml''s `workflow_run: workflows: [\"Publish\"]` trigger never\nfired for automated releases. Confirmed live: Publish run 29858583214\n(2.3.0-rc.1, success) produced zero Security Scan runs; a manual dispatch\n(run 29859953811) had to fill the gap by hand. Human tag pushes were\nunaffected (e.g. run 29615680209 on 2026-07-17).\n\nAdd a trigger-security-scan job to publish.yml, mirroring trigger-e2e''s\npattern exactly (same needs/permissions/env-var quoting), dispatching\nsecurity-scan.yml with the exact published version for both prerelease\nand stable tags. Remove the now-redundant workflow_run trigger and its\ndead \"Resolve image tag from publish\" step from security-scan.yml — kept,\nit would have caused duplicate scans for human tag pushes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JAWrUgCqbYeKy4TGdUaxHo\n\n* docs: drop backlog entry resolved by removing the workflow_run trigger\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JAWrUgCqbYeKy4TGdUaxHo\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6e4d2664ea690c6590ce8b857d27fafe63e5869","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/trees/c6e4d2664ea690c6590ce8b857d27fafe63e5869"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/commits/074ad8b09465f0d3fc71acdaa566b2670c3ce8be","verification":{"payload":"tree c6e4d2664ea690c6590ce8b857d27fafe63e5869\nparent 45efb8b6276d7f9da085ac5be9c4ba1fea6ddbeb\nauthor Giovani <giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com> 1784692938 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784692938 -0300\n\nfix(ci): dispatch security-scan explicitly from Publish, drop workflow_run (#129)\n\n* fix(ci): dispatch security-scan explicitly from Publish, drop workflow_run\n\nrelease.yml starts Publish via workflow_dispatch using GITHUB_TOKEN, and\nGitHub suppresses workflow_run events for GITHUB_TOKEN-authored runs — so\nsecurity-scan.yml''s `workflow_run: workflows: [\"Publish\"]` trigger never\nfired for automated releases. Confirmed live: Publish run 29858583214\n(2.3.0-rc.1, success) produced zero Security Scan runs; a manual dispatch\n(run 29859953811) had to fill the gap by hand. Human tag pushes were\nunaffected (e.g. run 29615680209 on 2026-07-17).\n\nAdd a trigger-security-scan job to publish.yml, mirroring trigger-e2e''s\npattern exactly (same needs/permissions/env-var quoting), dispatching\nsecurity-scan.yml with the exact published version for both prerelease\nand stable tags. Remove the now-redundant workflow_run trigger and its\ndead \"Resolve image tag from publish\" step from security-scan.yml — kept,\nit would have caused duplicate scans for human tag pushes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JAWrUgCqbYeKy4TGdUaxHo\n\n* docs: drop backlog entry resolved by removing the workflow_run trigger\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JAWrUgCqbYeKy4TGdUaxHo\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYEDKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAV44QADpqEzhBiq38bHZJkyHIxRZI\n4vIVzs+h7GWCJnqJ8z0a1fvyTUotKIH4B1Yy4OxUedbZze1PNefSCq93uKoDB6/G\nTIRM4rGEDc5OLOI5QwTYk/dtAj71DKu/rSwGt719E1nQ7RQqyc08aeVyTxhp9Ah/\nXnGcCOWIOv6KMhogZVkyss/jA91dtK4+PZkSS8eDZSGghKD3lHvnknIRMN6RWnJY\n9sIYHJgb2wRopCwhXNnxLvQ7ZcQzIqPa7Ws6Bgtl8/nOApNzLyGKOgijXlEHuQ4X\nZuIOrhJNwN3/PthR5ME1278xLQYGXQGeqNxQadi0LrFKe866RrAIsJZSLrAz5GiH\np8dK5tNgtbTCY+GjeOXevMEUbF61voXfvYTkpR93irhNEhaGxFJmTuKqsgORSmcA\nlV4mkc9r57S1MenjRzECumEjD274V5wEcrF1PkYgYNknxF6d3s78y2hZGt9NNRMq\nXiTJKyihty+wss6H/F2Bu+IRm2hUeq3geHlxfVp3JWd+pm8xcy68D8zfwbtPpplw\nc5Elt7Mc