cy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Elesiann","id":63979266,"login":"Elesiann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTc5MjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/45efb8b6276d7f9da085ac5be9c4ba1fea6ddbeb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T18:58:23Z","email":"giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com","name":"Giovani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T18:58:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: fix stale Backstage 1.49.4 strings after 1.53.0 bump (#127)\n\n* docs: fix stale Backstage 1.49.4 strings after 1.53.0 bump (#120)\n\nPR #120 bumped Backstage 1.49.4 -> 1.53.0 (backstage.json, EXTENSIONS_TAG)\nbut touched no docs. This fast-follows: updates every doc string that\nasserted 1.49.4 as the CURRENT platform/EXTENSIONS_TAG version, verified\nagainst backstage.json and the Dockerfile''s EXTENSIONS_TAG=bs_1.53.0 arg.\n\nAlso drops the now-completed \"Backstage 1.50 migration\" roadmap item\n(ROADMAP_FEATURES.md) and decouples the NFS/Phase 2 migration language\nin README.md and UPGRADING.md from the \"1.50\" version label, since the\ncore bump already landed past 1.50 while NFS Phase 2 remains unrelated\nand still deferred.\n\nLeft untouched (verified still accurate): individual dynamic-plugin OCI\ntags (rbac, tech-radar, kubernetes, jenkins, sonarqube, azure-devops,\ngithub-actions) which are literal deliberate pins still at bs_1.49.4 in\npresets/*.yaml and dynamic-plugins.default.yaml, pending republish\nupstream; ADR-010/013/014 decision-time context sections; and the\nhistorical 0.1.x row in UPGRADING.md''s compatibility matrix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JAWrUgCqbYeKy4TGdUaxHo\n\n* docs: review fixes — hedge unverified bs_1.53.0 bundle claims, fix dangling refs\n\nReview findings on #127: the two ROADMAP_BACKLOG bug claims are observed\nfacts from the bs_1.49.4 bundles, not yet re-verified against the 1.53\nrebuilds — hedge them instead of asserting present-tense at the new tag.\nADR-010 pointed at a ROADMAP_FEATURES section this PR removed; tech-stack\nstill claimed 1.50 ''currently deferred''.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JAWrUgCqbYeKy4TGdUaxHo\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ebe7f67a9f16abd0662bbf4eb6dd82c2edd8ca27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/trees/ebe7f67a9f16abd0662bbf4eb6dd82c2edd8ca27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/commits/45efb8b6276d7f9da085ac5be9c4ba1fea6ddbeb","verification":{"payload":"tree ebe7f67a9f16abd0662bbf4eb6dd82c2edd8ca27\nparent c4ed116c49e2642f06c36bd506271c1029980adf\nauthor Giovani <giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com> 1784660303 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784660303 -0300\n\ndocs: fix stale Backstage 1.49.4 strings after 1.53.0 bump (#127)\n\n* docs: fix stale Backstage 1.49.4 strings after 1.53.0 bump (#120)\n\nPR #120 bumped Backstage 1.49.4 -> 1.53.0 (backstage.json, EXTENSIONS_TAG)\nbut touched no docs. This fast-follows: updates every doc string that\nasserted 1.49.4 as the CURRENT platform/EXTENSIONS_TAG version, verified\nagainst backstage.json and the Dockerfile''s EXTENSIONS_TAG=bs_1.53.0 arg.\n\nAlso drops the now-completed \"Backstage 1.50 migration\" roadmap item\n(ROADMAP_FEATURES.md) and decouples the NFS/Phase 2 migration language\nin README.md and UPGRADING.md from the \"1.50\" version label, since the\ncore bump already landed past 1.50 while NFS Phase 2 remains unrelated\nand still deferred.\n\nLeft untouched (verified still accurate): individual dynamic-plugin OCI\ntags (rbac, tech-radar, kubernetes, jenkins, sonarqube, azure-devops,\ngithub-actions) which are literal deliberate pins still at bs_1.49.4 in\npresets/*.yaml and dynamic-plugins.default.yaml, pending republish\nupstream; ADR-010/013/014 decision-time context sections; and the\nhistorical 0.1.x row in UPGRADING.md''s compatibility matrix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JAWrUgCqbYeKy4TGdUaxHo\n\n* docs: review fixes — hedge unverified bs_1.53.0 bundle claims, fix dangling refs\n\nReview findings on #127: the two ROADMAP_BACKLOG bug claims are observed\nfacts from the bs_1.49.4 bundles, not yet re-verified against the 1.53\nrebuilds — hedge them instead of asserting present-tense at the new tag.\nADR-010 pointed at a ROADMAP_FEATURES section this PR removed; tech-stack\nstill claimed 1.50 ''currently deferred''.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JAWrUgCqbYeKy4TGdUaxHo\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqX8FPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAc3sQAJiwEM+nck1nF4PLwPZY+74y\nZ5ymEaa+KvjWK4bTUsLxZrFVUG0HPusf5VZjsje0op6VAqEw5bqh9HSrc7Ey52+u\n37JxfjTFTWGm8AakS5xOfFeNkszDB+ABsO3oNXdW2ghm9NQ7TDU8MpqoRCvMHo8w\nH8wjeDmwpmB9bRH6yAJwf/uUfaeK92cDklIRYmdXG9I4WBmiGeblow1MKmK+yJn/\nvBHFyAFEB8+z3c56MxNSINKRfyXxBLnLInoywGV9H5DbamJjvKJjpcWuUg7W9ENx\nMRRrvH/vjf+Rf5QnO4Fi4tQETqyUGKY8p9xlmjW