":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commit/c4ed116c49e2642f06c36bd506271c1029980adf","node_id":"C_kwDOSc5yKNoAKGM0ZWQxMTZjNDllMjY0MmYwNmMzNmJkNTA2MjcxYzEwMjk5ODBhZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commit/a0d4e48186a27f6ea9c4b3360c59f42d317bfbdf","sha":"a0d4e48186a27f6ea9c4b3360c59f42d317bfbdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/a0d4e48186a27f6ea9c4b3360c59f42d317bfbdf"}],"sha":"c4ed116c49e2642f06c36bd506271c1029980adf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/c4ed116c49e2642f06c36bd506271c1029980adf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63979266?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Elesiann","id":63979266,"login":"Elesiann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTc5MjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/a0d4e48186a27f6ea9c4b3360c59f42d317bfbdf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T18:38:32Z","email":"giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com","name":"Giovani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T18:38:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): bump Backstage 1.49.4 -> 1.53.0 (#120)\n\n* chore(deps): bump Backstage 1.49.4 -> 1.53.0 via versions:bump\n\nMechanical bump of all @backstage/* ranges to the 1.53.0 release\nmanifest, plus backstage.json. No source changes yet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(app): update build-metadata Backstage version to 1.53.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(dev): drop --config ref to app-config.dynamic-plugins.yaml in dev scripts\n\nThe file never existed in this repo (bootstrap leftover; in the image it\nis generated at boot by install-dynamic-plugins.py under\n/app/dynamic-plugins-root/, which the Dockerfile CMD references\ndirectly). Backstage 1.49 tolerated a missing --config file with a\nwarning; 1.53 makes it fatal, so `yarn dev`/`dev-local` no longer boot\nwith the dead flag. Effective config is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(app): bump @red-hat-developer-hub/backstage-plugin-theme 0.10.0 -> 0.14.10\n\nBackstage 1.53 ships @backstage/config-loader@1.11.0, which compiles every\ndependency''s config.d.ts strictly at boot. The theme''s published config.d.ts\nimported a type from ''./src'', a directory absent from the npm tarball (only\ndist/ is published) — fatal under the new compiler, so the backend crashed on\nstartup with \"Cannot find module ''./src''\". 0.14.10 inlines the type, fixing the\npublished config.d.ts. Usage is limited to useThemes in DynamicRoot; peerDeps\n(core-plugin-api ^1.12.4, @backstage/theme ^0.7.2, MUI v5) are satisfied by 1.53.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(dev): commit dynamic-plugins-root/.gitkeep so the dir exists at boot\n\nBackstage 1.53''s backend-dynamic-feature-service PluginScanner now\nlstatSyncs dynamicPlugins.rootDirectory during schema collection and\ncrashes with ENOENT if it is missing (1.49 tolerated absence). The dir\nis created at boot inside the image by install-dynamic-plugins.py, but\n`yarn dev` runs against the repo tree where it never existed. .gitignore\nalready anticipated this file (dynamic-plugins-root/* + !.gitkeep); it\nwas just never committed. Empty dir → scanner finds 0 plugins and\nproceeds. Verified: yarn dev boots, guest auth + catalog API 200,\nfrontend serves.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(docker): bump EXTENSIONS_TAG to bs_1.53.0 to match backstage.json\n\nThe 1.53 bump set backstage.json to 1.53.0 but left the Dockerfile\nARG EXTENSIONS_TAG at bs_1.49.4, tripping the validate check that\nasserts the baked extensions module matches the target Backstage\nversion. The extensions:bs_1.53.0 bundle now exists on quay.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JAWrUgCqbYeKy4TGdUaxHo\n\n* fix(app): patch janus-cli to ignore benign @protobufjs/inquire webpack warning\n\nThe Backstage 1.53 bump raised @backstage/plugin-api-docs 0.13.5->0.14.3,\nwhich pulls the AsyncAPI protobuf schema parser into the app''s webpack\ngraph. protobufjs''s inquire.js uses an obfuscated dynamic require() to\noptionally load a peer, so webpack emits ''Critical dependency: the\nrequest of a dependency is an expression''. It is benign, but janus-cli\n3.6.1 (still the app''s build CLI) has no ignoreWarnings hook and turns\nevery warning fatal under CI=true, breaking the production app build.\n\nPatch janus-cli''s webpack config to ignoreWarnings for this exact\nmodule only; all other warnings stay fatal. Verified: CI=true app build\ngreen with the patch, still failing without it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JAWrUgCqbYeKy4TGdUaxHo\n\n* fix(docker): keep nested typescript + Backstage-scope d.ts for runtime schema compile\n\nBackstage 1.53''s config-loader (1.11.x) breaks two assumptions of the\nd.ts strip step, killing boot:\n\n1. It requires typescript ^5.8 while the root resolves 5.5.4, so yarn\n   nests a private copy under @backstage/config-loader/node_modules/\n   typescript. The strip only spared the top-level typescript/, so the\n   copy config-loader actually resolves had no lib.*.d.ts:\n   \"TS2304: Cannot find name ''Array''\".\n2. 1.53 config.d.ts files import types from sibling packages\n   (@backstage/types, @backstage/backend-plugin-api, ...) and the\n   schema compiler (strict, skipLibCheck:false) follows those imports;\n   with their d.ts stripped: \"TS7016: Could not find a declaration\n   file for module ...\".\n\nFix the strip predicate: spare every nested typescript/ copy and all\nd.ts under the Backstage plugin scopes. Still deletes 514M of 650M of\nd.ts (@types/*, general libs). Verified empirically: image + restored\nfiles boots healthy (recommended preset, 57s); dies without them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JAWrUgCqbYeKy4TGdUaxHo\n\n* fix(entrypoint): catalog index defaults to the image''s own Backstage line\n\nThe marketplace catalog index was pulled as :latest at boot. The index''s\nmain branch tracks the NEXT platform release, so a :latest default lets\na newer line''s vitrine leak into stable deployments — advertising\nbundles built for a Backstage the running image doesn''t have. Default\nnow derives bs_<version> from backstage.json (this image: bs_1.53.0);\nCATALOG_INDEX_IMAGE still overrides. Pairs with the export-overlays\nchange that stops auto-moving the index''s :latest from main.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JAWrUgCqbYeKy4TGdUaxHo\n\n* fix(image): pin baked catalog index to Backstage line\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"893a280b3a00e7ce55d3d1ab398ec70c4f1fc312","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/trees/893a280b3a00e7ce55d3d1ab398ec70c4f1fc312"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/commits/a0d4e48186a27f6ea9c4b3360c59f42d317bfbdf","verification":{"payload":"tree 893a280b3a00e7ce55d3d1ab398ec70c4f1fc312\nparent a9503a1bdff1d272c7bbcb3253966933e80371fc\nauthor Giovani <giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com> 1784659112 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784659112 -0300\n\nchore(deps): bump Backstage 1.49.4 -> 1.53.0 (#120)\n\n* chore(deps): bump Backstage 1.49.4 -> 1.53.0 via versions:bump\n\nMechanical bump of all @backstage/* ranges to the 1.53.0 release\nmanifest, plus backstage.json. No source changes yet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(app): update build-metadata Backstage version to 1.53.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(dev): drop --config ref to app-config.dynamic-plugins.yaml in dev scripts\n\nThe file never existed in this repo (bootstrap leftover; in the image it\nis generated at boot by install-dynamic-plugins.py under\n/app/dynamic-plugins-root/, which the Dockerfile CMD references\ndirectly). Backstage 1.49 tolerated a missing --config file with a\nwarning; 1.53 makes it fatal, so `yarn dev`/`dev-local` no longer boot\nwith the dead flag. Effective config is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(app): bump @red-hat-developer-hub/backstage-plugin-theme 0.10.0 -> 0.14.10\n\nBackstage 1.53 ships @backstage/config-loader@1.11.0, which compiles every\ndependency''s config.d.ts strictly at boot. The theme''s published config.d.ts\nimported a type from ''./src'', a directory absent from the npm tarball (only\ndist/ is published) — fatal under the new compiler, so the backend crashed on\nstartup with \"Cannot find module ''./src''\". 0.14.10 inlines the type, fixing the\npublished config.d.ts. Usage is limited to useThemes in DynamicRoot; peerDeps\n(core-plugin-api ^1.12.4, @backstage/theme ^0.7.2, MUI v5) are satisfied by 1.53.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(dev): commit dynamic-plugins-root/.gitkeep so the dir exists at boot\n\nBackstage 1.53''s backend-dynamic-feature-service PluginScanner now\nlstatSyncs dynamicPlugins.rootDirectory during schema collection and\ncrashes with ENOENT if it is missing (1.49 tolerated absence). The dir\nis created at boot inside the image by install-dynamic-plugins.py, but\n`yarn dev` runs against the repo tree where it never existed. .gitignore\nalready anticipated this file (dynamic-plugins-root/* + !.gitkeep); it\nwas just never committed. Empty dir → scanner finds 0 plugins and\nproceeds. Verified: yarn dev boots, guest auth + catalog API 200,\nfrontend serves.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(docker): bump EXTENSIONS_TAG to bs_1.53.0 to match backstage.json\n\nThe 1.53 bump set backstage.json to 1.53.0 but left the Dockerfile\nARG EXTENSIONS_TAG at bs_1.49.4, tripping the validate check that\nasserts the baked extensions module matches the target Backstage\nversion. The extensions:bs_1.53.0 bundle now exists on quay.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JAWrUgCqbYeKy4TGdUaxHo\n\n* fix(app): patch janus-cli to ignore benign @protobufjs/inquire webpack warning\n\nThe Backstage 1.53 bump raised @backstage/plugin-api-docs 0.13.5->0.14.3,\nwhich pulls the AsyncAPI protobuf schema parser into the app''s webpack\ngraph. protobufjs''s inquire.js uses an obfuscated dynamic require() to\noptionally load a peer, so webpack emits ''Critical dependency: the\nrequest of a dependency is an expression''. It is benign, but janus-cli\n3.6.1 (still the app''s build CLI) has no ignoreWarnings hook and turns\nevery warning fatal under CI=true, breaking the production app build.\n\nPatch janus-cli''s webpack config to ignoreWarnings for this exact\nmodule only; all other warnings stay fatal. Verified: CI=true app build\ngreen with the patch, still failing without it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JAWrUgCqbYeKy4TGdUaxHo\n\n* fix(docker): keep nested typescript + Backstage-scope d.ts for runtime schema compile\n\nBackstage 1.53''s config-loader (1.11.x) breaks two assumptions of the\nd.ts strip step, killing boot:\n\n1. It requires typescript ^5.8 while the root resolves 5.5.4, so yarn\n   nests a private copy under @backstage/config-loader/node_modules/\n   typescript. The strip only spared the top-level typescript/, so the\n   copy config-loader actually resolves had no lib.*.d.ts:\n   \"TS2304: Cannot find name ''Array''\".\n2. 1.53 config.d.ts files import types from sibling packages\n   (@backstage/types, @backstage/backend-plugin-api, ...) and the\n   schema compiler (strict, skipLibCheck:false) follows those imports;\n   with their d.ts stripped: \"TS7016: Could not find a declaration\n   file for module ...\".\n\nFix the strip predicate: spare every nested typescript/ copy and all\nd.ts under the Backstage plugin scopes. Still deletes 514M of 650M of\nd.ts (@types/*, general libs). Verified empirically: image + restored\nfiles boots healthy (recommended preset, 57s); dies without them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JAWrUgCqbYeKy4TGdUaxHo\n\n* fix(entrypoint): catalog index defaults to the image''s own Backstage line\n\nThe marketplace catalog index was pulled as :latest at boot. The index''s\nmain branch tracks the NEXT platform release, so a :latest default lets\na newer line''s vitrine leak into stable deployments — advertising\nbundles built for a Backstage the running image doesn''t have. Default\nnow derives bs_<version> from backstage.json (this image: bs_1.53.0);\nCATALOG_INDEX_IMAGE still overrides. Pairs with the export-overlays\nchange that stops auto-moving the index''s :latest from main.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JAWrUgCqbYeKy4TGdUaxHo\n\n* fix(image): pin baked catalog index to Backstage line\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqX7yoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5LIQAFpGVisbJW5tNYo1CFznlz+s\nuYZ18ynMHnnIu2ywwH2aOtPY8sv+mga9wZMj9zRGBA/gTqE6wJK6dsO5Z1JLK/Nc\nMuuW105/5C+hgrq8bjB4NA0AxegQ0kXHtnpRq/3aABso1jXq4ZIERA3ReVQO5h2M\n6G9jCADVmbPCUZyIhWzrcFJylw6cmPxmy2vPybqd6EBQ6n8WfWqev008YKvLXdGa\nYzek98Rlvg0TAsAmC07cq03yFVlHVFp4voiOtMPAlktGOzcQDLdznR4a5jgtGoSL\n0sA1nZBOB8gja+z4GiNcEUnK3MsCzAOGndbyANf8P/63