code-platform/devportal-platform/commits/a0d4e48186a27f6ea9c4b3360c59f42d317bfbdf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63979266?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Elesiann","id":63979266,"login":"Elesiann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTc5MjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/a9503a1bdff1d272c7bbcb3253966933e80371fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T19:12:55Z","email":"giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com","name":"Giovani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T19:12:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: document static-only backend modules that must not be dynamic (#121)\n\nSeven backend modules are compiled statically into packages/backend/src/index.ts\nand also exist as OCI-bundled dynamic-plugin selectors upstream. Enabling any of\nthem via a hand-authored dynamic-plugins.yaml plugins: entry double-registers the\nmodule and crashes boot with \"Module ''<id>'' for plugin ''<pluginId>'' is already\nregistered\". None are reachable through any shipped preset or catalog entry today,\nbut the veecode-drydock fleet baseline (findings/15) surfaced the gap. Adds two\nmore modules already flagged by a comment in presets/azure.yaml for completeness.","tree":{"sha":"6f4aaec9c9581e9804fc5f294733a862ba06db52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/trees/6f4aaec9c9581e9804fc5f294733a862ba06db52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/commits/a9503a1bdff1d272c7bbcb3253966933e80371fc","verification":{"payload":"tree 6f4aaec9c9581e9804fc5f294733a862ba06db52\nparent aa792bd6a8439b7efcf7deb79227f4d892c8b03c\nauthor Giovani <giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com> 1784315575 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784315575 -0300\n\ndocs: document static-only backend modules that must not be dynamic (#121)\n\nSeven backend modules are compiled statically into packages/backend/src/index.ts\nand also exist as OCI-bundled dynamic-plugin selectors upstream. Enabling any of\nthem via a hand-authored dynamic-plugins.yaml plugins: entry double-registers the\nmodule and crashes boot with \"Module ''<id>'' for plugin ''<pluginId>'' is already\nregistered\". None are reachable through any shipped preset or catalog entry today,\nbut the veecode-drydock fleet baseline (findings/15) surfaced the gap. Adds two\nmore modules already flagged by a comment in presets/azure.yaml for completeness.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWn63CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+NwQAFkOunDK590xXYh5o4G4rexS\nJJQpvQVPwrhPMU/EugJQ7gqCW8m+pdYto2mt0ATtZOc/hk/ILgn8z0T3j/+1v0+7\nQQ2UhvzYTe5+IB6ZH+VHnqsaLCLCyjCQ12w2gFqz+8Y4OyLOBQYxEfsDb0VEYCgY\nWBOGkK/stUeBeQewv9cF3m2CoqLklOrZrAkFWbh7X2UySPkixHnl6+LvPbBXJwuv\nPO6ojloG9s537H5ptmAClDNDGwn+h8SLzGNj2jcZvbHXvybYgc4K/YpNaLr+mJal\n/fwIX42kWRjsfJ4cSUOM5yAM5x5L97lxvgxd+ryhtbWI/0wykhxN1ri4eyUyCMC7\nFvYvdXXjzPZjLBamNqTUcGgxMgsY+VGC3QLE/EWbDCWygge2fNYWAXX7Isn6t0c0\nR9dr3S9Y0Ajx3JfxFd/rCPlYFU8vZdfOPhwokHliXKB7lYRFYbPAvtvhxGFCygab\nml3RcGrVEdFR1LpfsHFih1sqli5oQuRCfljiNqX1rqFHhT1oHs6LT/AVusuwosAP\n1sAhAJ4cnp5M5OdLLMG5AGwKTkisFwjecLgmG+b7/kNsfDKmquLjq2ZdEkz1pYQC\nM3iVfpr+wAmdJ7SDU