s://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/aa792bd6a8439b7efcf7deb79227f4d892c8b03c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63979266?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Elesiann","id":63979266,"login":"Elesiann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTc5MjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/60227dc8091c8700d4520fcd6ff6f09d689f6687/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T12:27:08Z","email":"giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com","name":"Giovani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T12:27:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(dynamic-plugins): anchor OCI selector prefix match at path separator (#117)\n\ninstall-dynamic-plugins.py filtered tar members with a bare\nstartswith(plugin_path), so a selector that is a literal prefix of a\nsibling package in the same OCI bundle extracted BOTH packages\n(e.g. `!immobiliarelabs-backstage-plugin-gitlab` also installed\n`immobiliarelabs-backstage-plugin-gitlab-backend`). When the stray\nsibling has a required-config gate, it aborts the boot of an innocent\nplugin. Anchor the match at `plugin_path + ''/''` (keeping the bare\ndirectory entry itself).\n\nFound by the drydock batch calibration (2026-07-17) with triple\nevidence: aws-ecs frontend boot loaded the sibling backend; gitlab\nfrontend boot died on the stray backend''s `integrations.gitlab` gate;\nextraction WARNING cited `...-gitlab-backend/**` files during a\nfrontend-only install.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ac830f71a9d1c20d8cedf1a8ae4f6d1055969ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/trees/9ac830f71a9d1c20d8cedf1a8ae4f6d1055969ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/commits/60227dc8091c8700d4520fcd6ff6f09d689f6687","verification":{"payload":"tree 9ac830f71a9d1c20d8cedf1a8ae4f6d1055969ad\nparent 93bd01250442c1d535decc9529a411b73e8b6034\nauthor Giovani <giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com> 1784291228 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784291228 -0300\n\nfix(dynamic-plugins): anchor OCI selector prefix match at path separator (#117)\n\ninstall-dynamic-plugins.py filtered tar members with a bare\nstartswith(plugin_path), so a selector that is a literal prefix of a\nsibling package in the same OCI bundle extracted BOTH packages\n(e.g. `!immobiliarelabs-backstage-plugin-gitlab` also installed\n`immobiliarelabs-backstage-plugin-gitlab-backend`). When the stray\nsibling has a required-config gate, it aborts the boot of an innocent\nplugin. Anchor the match at `plugin_path + ''/''` (keeping the bare\ndirectory entry itself).\n\nFound by the drydock batch calibration (2026-07-17) with triple\nevidence: aws-ecs frontend boot loaded the sibling backend; gitlab\nfrontend boot died on the stray backend''s `integrations.gitlab` gate;\nextraction WARNING cited `...-gitlab-backend/**` files during a\nfrontend-only install.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWh+cCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAURsQAEoVsDeukV1V/WH2S6z3WPnc\ndj8gpElQXN1DM0OOI1Fqs7Cu2cyiZkR3Q9zMpFr