tps://github.com/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commit/0df39ef08963a4cebc820641408ef0218b499879","sha":"0df39ef08963a4cebc820641408ef0218b499879","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/0df39ef08963a4cebc820641408ef0218b499879"}],"sha":"9f1e5d33bbf73bf730c8fc1dc4ee576074ab7931","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/9f1e5d33bbf73bf730c8fc1dc4ee576074ab7931"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63979266?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Elesiann","id":63979266,"login":"Elesiann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTc5MjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/0df39ef08963a4cebc820641408ef0218b499879/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T14:51:57Z","email":"giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com","name":"Giovani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T14:51:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(boot): preflight guards for persistent state, baked inventory and operator config (#62)\n\nFragility-map round 1 (re-verified 2026-06-12). Every invariant below was\nprotected only by operator knowledge; each now fails fast at boot (exit 78)\nor self-heals, instead of silently breaking or crash-looping:\n\n- extensions-install.yaml corrupted on the volume: quarantine to .bak +\n  recreate empty + WARN (DB is the source of truth; the marketplace\n  regenerates the cache). Previously: KeyError traceback and a crash-loop\n  on every boot until a human edited the volume. Installer also raises a\n  clear InstallException instead of a bare KeyError for any include\n  missing the plugins list.\n- DEVPORTAL_DB_PATH not a writable dir supporting rename (read-only /\n  single-file bind): refuse at boot naming the cause. Previously: EXDEV\n  at marketplace write time, far from the cause.\n- preInstalled plugin without its directory under dynamic-plugins-root:\n  fail naming the plugin (catches image/inventory drift and an empty\n  volume mounted over dynamic-plugins-root). internal-* workspace\n  plugins are exempt (config-only entries, compiled into the app).\n  Previously: \"Using pre-installed (config only)\" lie + missing chrome /\n  404s with no error.\n- VEECODE_APP_CONFIG invalid (base64 or YAML shape): exit 78 naming the\n  var. Previously: node died ~45s later naming only the decoded file.\n- Unresolved ${...} placeholder in an enabled plugin ref: exit 78 naming\n  file+ref before any install. Previously: per-plugin skopeo errors.\n- Operator includes: in dynamic-plugins.yaml: explicit WARN that the\n  chain is entrypoint-owned. Previously: silently replaced.\n- RHDH extensions-backend post-install removal is now logged with the\n  reason (pluginId \"extensions\" collision with marketplace-backend).\n  Previously: rm -rf with no trace.\n\nVerified against veecode/devportal:2.1.1 + these files overlaid: pytest\n12/12, smoke-presets-negative 9/9 (incl. 2 new cases), poisoned-volume\nboot self-heals and restarts clean, baseline boot unaffected.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7cfb7224b4c5573967690b389216c4902bfba531","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/trees/7cfb7224b4c5573967690b389216c4902bfba531"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/commits/0df39ef08963a4cebc820641408ef0218b499879","verification":{"payload":"tree 7cfb7224b4c5573967690b389216c4902bfba531\nparent 4d556af0ca83774829f1e1c465939bf81db50d75\nauthor Giovani <giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com> 1781275917 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781275917 -0300\n\nfix(boot): preflight guards for persistent state, baked inventory and operator config (#62)\n\nFragility-map round 1 (re-verified 2026-06-12). Every invariant below was\nprotected only by operator knowledge; each now fails fast at boot (exit 78)\nor self-heals, instead of silently breaking or crash-looping:\n\n- extensions-install.yaml corrupted on the volume: quarantine to .bak +\n  recreate empty + WARN (DB is the source of truth; the marketplace\n  regenerates the cache). Previously: KeyError traceback and a crash-loop\n  on every boot until a human edited the volume. Installer also raises a\n  clear InstallException instead of a bare KeyError for any include\n  missing the plugins list.\n- DEVPORTAL_DB_PATH not a writable dir supporting rename (read-only /\n  single-file bind): refuse at boot naming the cause. Previously: EXDEV\n  at marketplace write time, far from the cause.\n- preInstalled plugin without its directory under dynamic-plugins-root:\n  fail naming the plugin (catches image/inventory drift and an empty\n  volume mounted over dynamic-plugins-root). internal-* workspace\n  plugins are exempt (config-only entries, compiled into the app).\n  Previously: \"Using pre-installed (config only)\" lie + missing chrome /\n  404s with no error.\n- VEECODE_APP_CONFIG invalid (base64 or YAML shape): exit 78 naming the\n  var. Previously: node died ~45s later naming only the decoded file.\n- Unresolved ${...} placeholder in an enabled plugin ref: exit 78 naming\n  file+ref before any install. Previously: per-plugin skopeo errors.\n- Operator includes: in dynamic-plugins.yaml: explicit WARN that the\n  chain is entrypoint-owned. Previously: silently replaced.\n- RHDH extensions-backend post-install removal is now logged with the\n  reason (pluginId \"extensions\" collision with marketplace-backend).\n  Previously: rm -rf with no trace.\n\nVerified against veecode/devportal:2.1.1 + these files overlaid: pytest\n12/12, smoke-presets-negative 9/9 (incl. 2 new cases), poisoned-volume\nboot self-heals and restarts clean, baseline boot unaffected.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLB0NCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA93AQACUFgtZuOusiN6Lip3W3uzYZ\n655f+0bivopGKmY9sZJDetUibVE9AsIvozRNEVPVYn4OMdUGQAfZLU+Omy8ljFfF\nPuC/55SKtNta2fcfvBdj5xOYNVBY8D8QUuTbpS74xrw3t5t0mrtXvJAeGnnEIj8d\nz8TBa89Yth4LH4c69si9/d1mVqRVX3Z83j2FAilpsiBnGhQw5CBdIaVuAoW1yMzt\ntpzIbv3v6LscnCDNYG+Dr416JbT4d4eYEejEngoqO8hiwWK0nDBX8ABbkWm1gAx7\n/ENdATuXsOfzQPnZHyAYi15cey/1ztFRTqOlyCU8C+tsdBBi3eI6oMRasRyBJ9rR\noXit5BA7obWBSVXjyXkJvWc0xw4To6Eeuc+MjfCypnK+YAKJBU9TeDQIfRi6wold\nPdhMQguCAGtOTrbfSPKZdG0shqfMkCKC5EOhlGblBXLb4aB6qd2AE6+QhnEQ1gmf\nFQhsKCHyuqAyHXFpL8/koUDAGMG9yPUCbPTcxacKJ01s2J5nCaSma6KU55L+2XmU\n0y+07/GZIQImmTs8JEoEox9AQiI17nshQdMoVWn1QE02fyk/T8jR8gHCnY2XpGMc\ncSEt48yyfG8qDySrb01tpXb98hWL30liZaZqaoVdE74mI/UFILz1DnPGHtbWODkf\nQvHabgnpf2+08HcyBqPZ\n=v27p\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-12T14:51:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"http