ions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commit/74e4a43c4364d70ff20f582405e9b2d5a503dd91","node_id":"C_kwDOSc5yKNoAKDc0ZTRhNDNjNDM2NGQ3MGZmMjBmNTgyNDA1ZTliMmQ1YTUwM2RkOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commit/4398de619fa1108f8f0c7a195d4268036b4f9af3","sha":"4398de619fa1108f8f0c7a195d4268036b4f9af3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/4398de619fa1108f8f0c7a195d4268036b4f9af3"}],"sha":"74e4a43c4364d70ff20f582405e9b2d5a503dd91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/74e4a43c4364d70ff20f582405e9b2d5a503dd91"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63979266?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Elesiann","id":63979266,"login":"Elesiann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTc5MjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/4398de619fa1108f8f0c7a195d4268036b4f9af3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T13:03:13Z","email":"giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com","name":"Giovani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T13:03:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ui): fix scroll and sidebar drawer broken in production bundle (#57)\n\n* fix(ui): fix scroll broken on long pages in production bundle\n\nThe RHDH-inherited workaround in Root.tsx used\n`& main[class*=\"BackstagePage-root\"]` to override Backstage''s fixed\n`height: 100vh` on `<main>`. In the production bundle, Backstage JSS\nclass names are minified (e.g. `jss4-1564`), so the substring\n`BackstagePage-root` never matches and the override is silently\ndropped — leaving the default `100vh` in effect and cutting off the\nbottom of long pages (Kubernetes tab, Grafana dashboards).\n\nFix: replace the class-attribute selector with the element selector\n`& main`. There is exactly one `<main>` scoped under `.sidebarLayout`,\nso this is safe and works in both dev (unminified) and prod (minified).\n\nAlso removed the dead `> div > main` rule in `pageWithoutFixHeight`\n(wrong DOM depth — `<main>` is a grandchild, not a child) and updated\nthe sidebarLayout box height to subtract `aboveSidebarHeaderHeight`\nconsistently with the existing calc.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ui): fix sidebar drawer hidden behind global header in prod bundle\n\n`BackstageSidebar-drawer` is also a Backstage JSS class that gets\nminified in the production bundle (e.g. `jss4-524`), so the\n`div[class*=\"BackstageSidebar-drawer\"]` selector never matched and\n`top` stayed at 0 — hiding the sidebar root behind the global header.\n\nReplace with `nav[aria-label=\"sidebar nav\"] > div`, which is the actual\nstable DOM structure (Backstage renders the drawer as the first div\nchild of the sidebar nav). Same class-agnostic rationale as the `& main`\nfix in the previous commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7016707695df45a67d25442abb81151ddd8e3dc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/trees/7016707695df45a67d25442abb81151ddd8e3dc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/commits/4398de619fa1108f8f0c7a195d4268036b4f9af3","verification":{"payload":"tree 7016707695df45a67d25442abb81151ddd8e3dc0\nparent 7e77785b7e718333dcf0d3c2c8e5ebd29e142bce\nauthor Giovani <giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com> 1781096593 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781096593 -0300\n\nfix(ui): fix scroll and sidebar drawer broken in production bundle (#57)\n\n* fix(ui): fix scroll broken on long pages in production bundle\n\nThe RHDH-inherited workaround in Root.tsx used\n`& main[class*=\"BackstagePage-root\"]` to override Backstage''s fixed\n`height: 100vh` on `<main>`. In the production bundle, Backstage JSS\nclass names are minified (e.g. `jss4-1564`), so the substring\n`BackstagePage-root` never matches and the override is silently\ndropped — leaving the default `100vh` in effect and cutting off the\nbottom of long pages (Kubernetes tab, Grafana dashboards).\n\nFix: replace the class-attribute selector with the element selector\n`& main`. There is exactly one `<main>` scoped under `.sidebarLayout`,\nso this is safe and works in both dev (unminified) and prod (minified).\n\nAlso removed the dead `> div > main` rule in `pageWithoutFixHeight`\n(wrong DOM depth — `<main>` is a grandchild, not a child) and updated\nthe sidebarLayout box height to subtract `aboveSidebarHeaderHeight`\nconsistently with the existing calc.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ui): fix sidebar drawer hidden behind global header in prod bundle\n\n`BackstageSidebar-drawer` is also a Backstage JSS class that gets\nminified in the production bundle (e.g. `jss4-524`), so the\n`div[class*=\"BackstageSidebar-drawer\"]` selector never matched and\n`top` stayed at 0 — hiding the sidebar root behind the global header.\n\nReplace with `nav[aria-label=\"sidebar nav\"] > div`, which is the actual\nstable DOM structure (Backstage renders the drawer as the first div\nchild of the sidebar nav). Same class-agnostic rationale as the `& main`\nfix in the previous commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKWCRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPaEQAHzsJXnNvofMI7FTwEXzrnqu\nZnqvktw6nC3AuWn3SINIGX8slf3xqG1oEWTCLZOCHDL1tWChkuGYfnvmGWM0i/Wv\n474ynoXIa3kPZ8q+dHDi5/8M9rokGAxwxJxWeQG98apTT+Uxe1c8TRsQUYuGDgOV\nvrrgaPzWxfh7u06xL7VICYDgYNXygt+akGM4DsxMFDmgga0eofOvRE1NbmxgZNZ6\nwMTqaqbWx4TzWQmwb1JkVwyKTMMnpUId6XTnxYh+2WlS+DmlhvYYA4gRaROQv0OT\ngQ/3VcxdtYZzaGylOhuw7dka/JwRWKJjFbkS8PSU8VqsbE8kI3j9k2J2lwI2k1uv\n3rnk1F2nDTo0aLuuslzDlxTQzdouB5NFyWn7QTXxbrfsfDqSWwTv+QHDx46x5qhm\nMYVfhuWlyQ4aW735XwjGMVj27j0h4JxNvZDz2gN2yCQm9t+xxBXtXaLJ33aHyla9\nmCxLO/nGIj3XsGkVEYd14xjUBZC1fbHEJ1fkPTgda83Okxs6MCMvvE4GDf7iLZmY\n63LJs8xn+PYiwNiIiFZ8piHBrU7iZ3mnA3L1swu/07pzdrNr8AOHYIoafs+gBAFb\nTEUwE0BKgCc6jHy0mnMTJgAL4jwBlgSvn+GRezHuahDkKL8RBqCfAX7rD9r191dB\nU5y3KbIgiTXqhytjVFtA\n=N9Sb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T13:03:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starr