ts{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commit/7e77785b7e718333dcf0d3c2c8e5ebd29e142bce","node_id":"C_kwDOSc5yKNoAKDdlNzc3ODViN2U3MTgzMzNkY2YwZDNjMmM4ZTVlYmQyOWUxNDJiY2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commit/9ffe96fd2af51e0335834fcc5639e9524aae1592","sha":"9ffe96fd2af51e0335834fcc5639e9524aae1592","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/9ffe96fd2af51e0335834fcc5639e9524aae1592"}],"sha":"7e77785b7e718333dcf0d3c2c8e5ebd29e142bce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/7e77785b7e718333dcf0d3c2c8e5ebd29e142bce"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63979266?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Elesiann","id":63979266,"login":"Elesiann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTc5MjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/9ffe96fd2af51e0335834fcc5639e9524aae1592/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T16:28:20Z","email":"giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com","name":"Giovani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T16:28:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(publish): notify downstream reconcilers on stable release (kill the cron) (#54)\n\nAdds a leaf job notify-downstream that, after the multi-arch manifest is\npublished and only for STABLE releases, sends a repository_dispatch\n(platform-image-released, version) to instance-manager and next-charts.\nTheir reconcilers already listen for this event, so DEFAULT_IMAGE / chart\nbumps now happen on release instead of on a daily cron.\n\nCross-org dispatch (veecode-platform -> veecode-saas-platform) needs a\ntoken the default GITHUB_TOKEN cannot provide: DISPATCH_TOKEN, a classic\nPAT with repo scope spanning both orgs. If the secret is absent the job\nno-ops with a warning (reconcilers keep their cron), so it can never\nbreak a release. Leaf job — cannot affect publish/release.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d714bcd3fb2e82e951c7eec1ad0f3e80a7e3f813","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/trees/d714bcd3fb2e82e951c7eec1ad0f3e80a7e3f813"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/commits/9ffe96fd2af51e0335834fcc5639e9524aae1592","verification":{"payload":"tree d714bcd3fb2e82e951c7eec1ad0f3e80a7e3f813\nparent d53c229fed2d9ba95449128f2137e64b008b8629\nauthor Giovani <giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com> 1781022500 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781022500 -0300\n\nci(publish): notify downstream reconcilers on stable release (kill the cron) (#54)\n\nAdds a leaf job notify-downstream that, after the multi-arch manifest is\npublished and only for STABLE releases, sends a repository_dispatch\n(platform-image-released, version) to instance-manager and next-charts.\nTheir reconcilers already listen for this event, so DEFAULT_IMAGE / chart\nbumps now happen on release instead of on a daily cron.\n\nCross-org dispatch (veecode-platform -> veecode-saas-platform) needs a\ntoken the default GITHUB_TOKEN cannot provide: DISPATCH_TOKEN, a classic\nPAT with repo scope spanning both orgs. If the secret is absent the job\nno-ops with a warning (reconcilers keep their cron), so it can never\nbreak a release. Leaf job — cannot affect publish/release.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKD8kCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQnQQACV/8q64dytvHjzO/ZcpgPXc\nX7LUcU0Ve42VdFsluF6/OWwwdCGoguC/jxwsG1IcjGJzj/MkShbSlyZdE/xN+21+\nU0DXFt1IT3UZ50Glw7t/Z9q4HDV+JKyfpIv5OzrXB+T+VjAJWquOSW7x4PEeqWj/\nCR+N3JRWeATvn/TC5t8DsQqb7R9u2+AbVPLsJDvjYS94nTSEjxmRO5lklBXwTWwB\nUWTvvN9jPZeMIhhQw012inSp1tWVeTVY7oEIrY2PfwUTGwtShOPXmRexnts2z2TT\n8alstH1cD4MUH32ZcGeH9XlbPJscd41y8efTfHRphuPLq00aVA/TkMB1RW6iGJXM\ndja9yVScDh8TNRWxXJT+SoBDqqnDOkGNXC8lXXFLCJkaAhm3hZZMywTZy40/oJm/\nbxQ2aLejXPnhNtifrlI91kxBK0m9JPWkeoUTfMJlIZI1AZedO/YFizDfv+s07Kh2\nsLaViSMpdCKbuHrXyZTMz3aZNWfnYKBFRYe/8FwypLepog+N0IDNLHRxNv93YKnt\nGd+GZKMinUaDtgDy7nu88AwtVgkJDzu8ePfsNeC7LjCcRjO0qiUKaV3XAWm9ZEEt\nGFBKrfK1ye8QyFyzJE3t1cFcVKU2tC7D+O1nPWMvWsMaKUNJL/Ur9LPORjP8XxRB\nE6C92Z5aRKPT5DsUG0yR\n=X19R\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-09T16:28:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.g