979266,"login":"Elesiann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTc5MjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/d53c229fed2d9ba95449128f2137e64b008b8629/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T18:50:42Z","email":"giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com","name":"Giovani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T18:50:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: bump stale bs_1.48.4 refs to bs_1.49.4 to match live default.yaml (#53)\n\nPR #49 bumped the github/jenkins/sonarqube/azure-devops bundles in\ndynamic-plugins.default.yaml from bs_1.48.4 to bs_1.49.4, but two docs\nstill referenced the old tag and now contradicted the boot file:\n\n- docs/PLUGINS.md: the plugin-matrix rows for azure-devops, jenkins,\n  sonarqube, and scaffolder-backend-module-sonarqube still listed\n  bs_1.48.4. Bumped all 7 rows to bs_1.49.4.\n- docs/topics/plugin-packaging.md: the \"Real examples from\n  dynamic-plugins.default.yaml\" block and the prose asserting those\n  bundles \"were built against bs_1.48.4 and that tag is pinned\n  literally\" were factually wrong. Bumped the example tags to bs_1.49.4\n  and reworded the prose to state the bundles are pinned literally at\n  bs_1.49.4.\n\nVerified against the live dynamic-plugins.default.yaml on main: all\nlisted plugins resolve to bs_1.49.4, with zero bs_1.48.4 occurrences.\nIntentionally-stale references (CHANGELOG history, ADR-010 rationale,\nthe generic pin-model note in dynamic-plugins.md, the deliberate\nconflicting-refs example in plugin-selection-surfaces.md, and the smoke\nfixture) are left untouched.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"addbea4cbf8f0ae82b02d25afb4955675b3d85b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/trees/addbea4cbf8f0ae82b02d25afb4955675b3d85b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/commits/d53c229fed2d9ba95449128f2137e64b008b8629","verification":{"payload":"tree addbea4cbf8f0ae82b02d25afb4955675b3d85b3\nparent 916aa7e283e92ca57645fef0d74c5d2b5223c1dc\nauthor Giovani <giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com> 1780944642 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780944642 -0300\n\ndocs: bump stale bs_1.48.4 refs to bs_1.49.4 to match live default.yaml (#53)\n\nPR #49 bumped the github/jenkins/sonarqube/azure-devops bundles in\ndynamic-plugins.default.yaml from bs_1.48.4 to bs_1.49.4, but two docs\nstill referenced the old tag and now contradicted the boot file:\n\n- docs/PLUGINS.md: the plugin-matrix rows for azure-devops, jenkins,\n  sonarqube, and scaffolder-backend-module-sonarqube still listed\n  bs_1.48.4. Bumped all 7 rows to bs_1.49.4.\n- docs/topics/plugin-packaging.md: the \"Real examples from\n  dynamic-plugins.default.yaml\" block and the prose asserting those\n  bundles \"were built against bs_1.48.4 and that tag is pinned\n  literally\" were factually wrong. Bumped the example tags to bs_1.49.4\n  and reworded the prose to state the bundles are pinned literally at\n  bs_1.49.4.\n\nVerified against the live dynamic-plugins.default.yaml on main: all\nlisted plugins resolve to bs_1.49.4, with zero bs_1.48.4 occurrences.\nIntentionally-stale references (CHANGELOG history, ADR-010 rationale,\nthe generic pin-model note in dynamic-plugins.md, the deliberate\nconflicting-refs example in plugin-selection-surfaces.md, and the smoke\nfixture) are left untouched.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJw8CCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArI0QAHa3jDSnRAOmRZMYoHm0HSYC\nP5bIZXP1mEnwAFD13EUaNSPGSHcZYhn3juntHrQmsHs+0wAqJYlQqvr63cPP9yJ6\njhbh5Zmw/RgIG7ND57wue+LUvcsJLLTcn8oniKrrb17lwHLZZSs48hwJIbiV6ZzP\nCljiZWEQej0jt1ep0FfT5rtuOIhb4w8xvIUKXmGlaYfoIc4fOicHAtTJey8NNj0+\nuYQy0DiCpabEjBmRie9hnoEGqR/m3afPT67Phv7puFQrTt44EBZ3YI9ojqndirbN\nD9w6JcXa9kKSdzLvIxT/WYAngKXNYPMFwS2WUp1ylrNsrsOqocA+Y6zejRmMla9b\nvsOVb5Ofb6n2QtTx9LHSxIiSfNk1+qnYnQOe1jrL5HnU68xKWBkUfYL88EOo2cgI\nLLPsnUbjraZk8kQL0N558U+0kelQYKtEcDY9TGy05gOAm8B2VncrY21L9fZVZAe/\nnZE1CKIYBBzdIyTyNb90xbJJKTdznLJ9aP79gC5Qp28Cal9DpbnkNuqa5Cygws7+\nFfzsTysCgmv1xhtYNQ30tYPaaawpo1KOnF0Y++d4i4NnfBO2snMtyl6In7SRGjRf\npv4SDANPcqQs5TJvGrnFgms31e9gC7Ph2sKd4dXqvld4gICSHZtZEK6N07RTWNmq\naqftgFjtXmioq5H7tlHL\n=Y6Cb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-08T18:50:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commit/d53c229fed2d9ba95449128f2137e64b008b8629","node_id":"C_kwDOSc5yKNoAKGQ1M2MyMjlmZWQyZDliYTk1NDQ5MTI4ZjIxMzdlNjRiMDA4Yjg2Mjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commit/916aa7e283e92ca57645fef0d74c5d2b5223c1dc","sha":"916aa7e283e92ca57645fef0d74c5d2b5223c1dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/916aa7e283e92ca57645fef0d74c5d2b5223c1dc"}],"sha":"d53c229fed2d9ba95449128f2137e64b008b8629","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/d53c229fed2d9ba95449128f2137e64b008b8629"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63979266?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Elesiann","id":63979266,"login":"Elesiann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTc5MjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/916aa7e283e92ca57645fef0d74c5d2b5223c1dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T17:46:17Z","email":"giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com","name":"Giovani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T17:46:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(smoke): drop dynamic-plugins-info from CORE_PLUGINS (self-excludes from its own API) (#52)\n\nThe publish smoke gate `recommended+mount` failed deterministically with\n`FAIL: core plugin(s) lost under operator override: plugin-dynamic-plugins-info`\n(publish run 27153550058). This is an assertion bug introduced by #48, not a\nreal override-drop.\n\n`dynamic-plugins-info` is the plugin that SERVES\n`/api/dynamic-plugins-info/loaded-plugins`. It does not list ITSELF in that\noutput, so it can never satisfy a substring assertion over the returned names —\nin any scenario. #48 was the first build to actually run the core-plugin check\n(2.1.0 was built pre-#48), which is why it surfaced now even though\ndynamic-plugins.yaml and the dynamic-plugins-info plugin are unchanged since 2.1.0.\n\nEmpirical proof against docker.io/veecode/devportal:2.1.0 (identical to main for\nthis purpose — the 2.1.0..HEAD diff touches neither dynamic-plugins.yaml nor the\nplugin):\n\n  recommended (NO mount), 11 plugins loaded — dynamic-plugins-info ABSENT\n  recommended + override mount, 12 plugins loaded — dynamic-plugins-info ABSENT\n\nThe endpoint returned the full plugin set in both cases, which only the loaded\ndynamic-plugins-info plugin can serve — so its liveness is already proven by the\nendpoint responding at all. Asserting on its self-report is a guaranteed false\nnegative.\n\nFix: remove `plugin-dynamic-plugins-info` from CORE_PLUGINS (now 5 entries) and\ndocument why it cannot be there. Re-running the patched recommended+mount gate\nagainst 2.1.0 now PASSES: operator plugin present + the remaining 5 core present.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58e18fa862311b2656250e43b105e5c06124ae0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/trees/58e18fa862311b2656250e43b105e5c06124ae0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/commits/916aa7e283e92ca57645fef0d74c5d2b5223c1dc","verification":{"payload":"tree 58e18fa862311b2656250e43b105e5c06124ae0c\nparent a33f87dd5b0b7e2e0c27fba40cf2508db6bc81ba\nauthor Giovani <giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com> 1780940777 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780940777 -0300\n\nfix(smoke): drop dynamic-plugins-info from CORE_PLUGINS (self-excludes from its own API) (#52)\n\nThe publish smoke gate `recommended+mount` failed deterministically with\n`FAIL: core plugin(s) lost under operator override: plugin-dynamic-plugins-info`\n(publish run 27153550058). This is an assertion bug introduced by #48, not a\nreal override-drop.\n\n`dynamic-plugins-info` is the plugin that SERVES\n`/api/dynamic-plugins-info/loaded-plugins`. It does not list ITSELF in that\noutput, so it can never satisfy a substring assertion over the returned names —\nin any scenario. #48 was the first build to actually run the core-plugin check\n(2.1.0 was built pre-#48), which is why it surfaced now even though\ndynamic-plugins.yaml and the dynamic-plugins-info plugin are unchanged since 2.1.0.\n\nEmpirical proof against docker.io/veecode/devportal:2.1.0 (identical to main for\nthis purpose — the 2.1.0..HEAD diff touches neither dynamic-plugins.yaml nor the\nplugin):\n\n  recommended (NO mount), 11 plugins loaded — dynamic-plugins-info ABSENT\n  recommended + override mount, 12 plugins loaded — dynamic-plugins-info ABSENT\n\nThe endpoint returned the full plugin set in both cases, which only the loaded\ndynamic-plugins-info plugin can serve — so its liveness is already proven by the\nendpoint responding at all. Asserting on its self-report is a guaranteed false\nnegative.\n\nFix: remove `plugin-dynamic-plugins-info` from CORE_PLUGINS (now 5 entries) and\ndocument why it cannot be there. Re-running the patched recommended+mount gate\nagainst 2.1.0 now PASSES: operator plugin present + the remaining 5 core present.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJv/pCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfuAQADRBnfkgPNk2p3m4/tvg761c\nehUbh9+zI36iFMzp5dm/nC0OP3inZd5pHTdwWs8amX66lizPNQSMU72MqM/RMicC\nGDcc5tiR6JpJwdjoI/3r/9w6E