ortal-platform/git/trees/42c7f34fb3416e98b707e2b72ae4e1c8f4a56299"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/commits/a33f87dd5b0b7e2e0c27fba40cf2508db6bc81ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commit/a33f87dd5b0b7e2e0c27fba40cf2508db6bc81ba","node_id":"C_kwDOSc5yKNoAKGEzM2Y4N2RkNWIwYjdlMmUwYzI3ZmJhNDBjZjI1MDhkYjZiYzgxYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commit/f31a4d17453caa3a901fe2536c518873a487dd78","sha":"f31a4d17453caa3a901fe2536c518873a487dd78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/f31a4d17453caa3a901fe2536c518873a487dd78"}],"sha":"a33f87dd5b0b7e2e0c27fba40cf2508db6bc81ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/a33f87dd5b0b7e2e0c27fba40cf2508db6bc81ba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63979266?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Elesiann","id":63979266,"login":"Elesiann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTc5MjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/f31a4d17453caa3a901fe2536c518873a487dd78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T16:34:12Z","email":"giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com","name":"Giovani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T16:34:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(presets): jenkins preset must use flat single-instance config (#51)\n\nThe jenkins preset emitted appConfig in the multi-instance form\n(`jenkins.instances[]`). That form crashes the backend at startup for any\noperator selecting `VEECODE_PRESETS=...,jenkins`.\n\nVerified root cause (boot-tested against veecode/devportal:2.1.0):\nthe base `app-config.yaml` ships a hardcoded top-level `jenkins.baseUrl`\n(line 183-184). When the preset adds `jenkins.instances[]` on top, the\nmerged config carries BOTH a top-level baseUrl AND a named instance. The\njenkins backend CI plugin''s `JenkinsConfig.fromConfig`\n(jenkinsInfoProvider.cjs.js:40) rejects that and throws during plugin\ninit: \"Found both a named jenkins instance with name default and top level\nbaseUrl, username or apiKey config. Use only one style of config.\" The\n`jenkins` plugin then never finishes initializing.\n\nSwitching the preset to the flat single-instance form\n(`jenkins.baseUrl/username/apiKey`) deep-merges with — and overrides — the\nbase config''s top-level `jenkins.baseUrl`, so only one config style exists.\nThe flat form satisfies both jenkins consumers: the CI frontend/backend\nplugin (discriminated union: flat OR instances[]) and the statically\nimported `@backstage-community/plugin-scaffolder-backend-module-jenkins`\n(packages/backend/src/index.ts), whose `buildJenkinsClient` reads\n`config.getString(''jenkins.baseUrl'')`.\n\nBoot-test (image veecode/devportal:2.1.0, fixed preset bind-mounted over\n/app/presets/jenkins.yaml, VEECODE_PRESETS=recommended,veecode-theme,jenkins):\n- healthcheck: {\"status\":\"ok\"}, backend Listening on 0.0.0.0:7007\n- \"Jenkins actions module started successfully\" (scaffolder module)\n- \"Initializing Jenkins backend\" (CI plugin)\n- zero \"threw an error during startup\" / \"Use only one style\" lines\nControl run with the old instances[] preset reproduces the crash\n(\"Use only one style of config\", jenkins plugin never initializes).\n\nThis fix lands in the NEXT image build; it does not alter the already\npublished 2.1.0 image.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"88246e2f5e0a98eabf35b44d53b23e3398b18840","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/trees/88246e2f5e0a98eabf35b44d53b23e3398b18840"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/commits/f31a4d17453caa3a901fe2536c518873a487dd78","verification":{"payload":"tree 88246e2f5e0a98eabf35b44d53b23e3398b18840\nparent ac89cc668a79a0a7456e264a3c05bd02410d06c5\nauthor Giovani <giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com> 1780936452 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780936452 -0300\n\nfix(presets): jenkins preset must use flat single-instance config (#51)\n\nThe jenkins preset emitted appConfig in the multi-instance form\n(`jenkins.instances[]`). That form crashes the backend at startup for any\noperator selecting `VEECODE_PRESETS=...,jenkins`.\n\nVerified root cause (boot-tested against veecode/devportal:2.1.0):\nthe base `app-config.yaml` ships a hardcoded top-level `jenkins.baseUrl`\n(line 183-184). When the preset adds `jenkins.instances[]` on top, the\nmerged config carries BOTH a top-level baseUrl AND a named instance. The\njenkins backend CI plugin''s `JenkinsConfig.fromConfig`\n(jenkinsInfoProvider.cjs.js:40) rejects that and throws during plugin\ninit: \"Found both a named jenkins instance with name default and top level\nbaseUrl, username or apiKey config. Use only one style of config.\" The\n`jenkins` plugin then never finishes initializing.\n\nSwitching the preset to the flat single-instance form\n(`jenkins.baseUrl/username/apiKey`) deep-merges with — and overrides — the\nbase config''s top-level `jenkins.baseUrl`, so only one config style exists.\nThe flat form satisfies both jenkins consumers: the CI frontend/backend\nplugin (discriminated union: flat OR instances[]) and the statically\nimported `@backstage-community/plugin-scaffolder-backend-module-jenkins`\n(packages/backend/src/index.ts), whose `buildJenkinsClient` reads\n`config.getString(''jenkins.baseUrl'')`.\n\nBoot-test (image veecode/devportal:2.1.0, fixed preset bind-mounted over\n/app/presets/jenkins.yaml, VEECODE_PRESETS=recommended,veecode-theme,jenkins):\n- healthcheck: {\"status\":\"ok\"}, backend Listening on 0.0.0.0:7007\n- \"Jenkins actions module started successfully\" (scaffolder module)\n- \"Initializing Jenkins backend\" (CI plugin)\n- zero \"threw an error during startup\" / \"Use only one style\" lines\nControl run with the old instances[] preset reproduces the crash\n(\"Use only one style of config\", jenkins plugin never initializes).\n\nThis fix lands in the NEXT image build; it does not alter the already\npublished 2.1.0 image.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJu8ECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAV1QQABXxSlZ5eoHFDKKn4zYC7PG4\nuYRAQOQZ6yUEpsc6KmZbJPsQVRCk6yx1sUNMeHAtPVplvoUEHuxoNI10FSexlSwB\nofvQ/1ZwHiFaqxWrJ30uLLs+m78GLzysRmrUpMq6E3x8WnW23q/O1e0mukYV2xSd\nQSk7Gsicu6wh/GeNdAe2BfN7INCdU9NbY+BDWrC8mTzeQoAjT1N3hxNpzKl8oYSo\nqnemV+Dehj1cYtoPaFEyIec/fglKtvoeBQ2qS2hUXf6lJ5zR3j0y6wyuohdh78dx\nQp9xwNH2OiUI8dDbHoSEkth9z1NsCpaQDH4kDO62CEwbO+mwqUADRDc2esG0vy/A\n/K0KB2kJ953qR1BbspbmsHNux0FZEK2BVgdIY/GYMb7eGsZupr8GdT05erbi/xgP\nSxI+NOcJmDIour0jnX8TXGkNnjXPmwHA2pIextrpHVA3JSGVBOg30qYjaGTZO5ko\n2KFvT0d1fLOtC8eDOqg14KbzmsESaQGxDsXX4ZDPP9J6HP5iMLtZC6N2NhLgOnEb\nV0qmDzqHApxaTtAQML8YY1s6LXjXNU0oxxzqLCmX9zKTSNq66RkV6ZvKJcPihBSU\nk/rbS4UpTQf8aVnHo1wL8WGLOOkJ82O4vkJj2NqKYQS8DZvUWLFkCFF5R5c75lxL\nqARmzadfBp503AFbDyjC\n=+j/j\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-08T16:34:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commit/f31a4d17453caa3a901fe2536c518873a487dd78","node_id":"C_kwDOSc5yKNoAKGYzMWE0ZDE3NDUzY2FhM2E5MDFmZTI1MzZjNTE4ODczYTQ4N2RkNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commit/ac89cc668a79a0a7456e264a3c05bd02410d06c5","sha":"ac89cc668a79a0a7456e264a3c05bd02410d06c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/ac89cc668a79a0a7456e264a3c05bd02410d06c5"}],"sha":"f31a4d17453caa3a901fe2536c518873a487dd78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/f31a4d17453caa3a901fe2536c518873a487dd78"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63979266?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Elesiann","id":63979266,"login":"Elesiann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTc5MjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/ac89cc668a79a0a7456e264a3c05bd02410d06c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T15:44:53Z","email":"giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com","name":"Giovani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T15:44:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(publish): auto-promote :latest on every stable platform release (#50)\n\nThe veecode/devportal image repo is shared between the 1.x distro line\nand the 2.x platform line. Policy: the 2.x platform line owns :latest and\nmust track the newest STABLE 2.x release automatically; the 1.x distro\nline publishes only versioned tags and never moves :latest (enforced in\ndevportal-distro).\n\nPreviously :latest moved only behind a manual update_latest=true dispatch\nflag. Change the manifest job''s :latest step condition so:\n\n- a stable tag push (github.event_name == ''push'', is_prerelease == false)\n  auto-promotes :latest;\n- a pre-release tag never moves :latest;\n- a workflow_dispatch moves :latest only with update_latest=true, so\n  re-publishing an older version cannot clobber :latest backward.\n\nRetain the update_latest dispatch input for deliberate re-promotions,\nrename the step for accuracy, and update the comments to match the policy.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a586a094fa183cbdc5ee914e271aacdb8640ce03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/trees/a586a094fa183cbdc5ee914e271aacdb8640ce03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/commits/ac89cc668a79a0a7456e264a3c05bd02410d06c5","verification":{"payload":"tree a586a094fa183cbdc5ee914e271aacdb8640ce03\nparent eee9ac013542eaa236eb53b71f9c580abda50041\nauthor Giovani <giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com> 1780933493 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780933493 -0300\n\nci(publish): auto-promote :latest on every stable platform release (#50)\n\nThe veecode/devportal image repo is shared between the 1.x distro line\nand the 2.x platform line. Policy: the 2.x platform line owns :latest and\nmust track the newest STABLE 2.x release automatically; the 1.x distro\nline publishes only versioned tags and never moves :latest (enforced in\ndevportal-distro).\n\nPreviously :latest moved only behind a manual update_latest=true dispatch\nflag. Change the manifest job''s :latest step condition so:\n\n- a stable tag push (github.event_name == ''push'', is_prerelease == false)\n  auto-promotes :latest;\n- a pre-release tag never moves :latest;\n- a workflow_dispatch moves :latest only with update_latest=true, so\n  re-publishing an older version cannot clobber :latest backward.\n\nRetain the update_latest dispatch input for deliberate re-promotions,\nrename the step for accuracy, and update the comments to match the policy.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJuN1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2h8QACwpnJpBSSf1eRaSJ9eclDZK\n3B1NdV+YvTCUGER9eFH16hS1mKtIjMLemmVmbn6O2v0VPOLoACpBeVUPFr8Ef5xE\nc7EUsZEKJGn2TvjtF5s7B0gsrM5waM+fs/lK1a7nfw91eWl5GxJTek7ZiFWOfMOH\nxPrkaKxcIKXPS2jGqcD4NXAxEgpengHZwt7WgBwsCsIf5b7vImUiKO8Z7LB6pHkx\nYvUPMwPmj64GbsQMdnvoSmmC8/SjcDTFcS54K/XCJOiVB//X1i0GKzwRIyQiAcqh\n+PxP2qbR6ZdNR2/vdUrxmSYY06VpPhPTncGz9UdMXB8CJfCg40/LVpNcQWhkw42T\ns1obmFt+ngw4i0EiQ8Zi/JDo7aIvTchTv4jRBJnTkucz1/pd3jlob0VnrEvjBWeC\nRCMKzIWJiMqORD1ASGnM8z3Lq0zh6V7Qf1nBn1kGJMPqm513Ao6JLzWgRi/+Sbaa\n7pNUV2ixRHC0/gcN6TkoPNZp+SA1Jhg4e27KnSvQOoDQyZVv3+jAWnnOzcyXAlCA\ngsZ8UI9YptN2NkmnIAAlEwSIIuj17e+MA4M+YMaBkiWSEQFslqAyK0g4wxoWOhaj\nqQ68mmWl/dbE1PeGtSHsdEaWgsJh6WlT1JgidpPZNblEKYXeFSO12xHe/Do+/QmH\n8FHqCkKsvyGlvB18/1QN\n=/quQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-08T15:44:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commit/ac89cc668a79a0a7456e264a3c05bd02410d06c5","node_id":"C_kwDOSc5yKNoAKGFjODljYzY2OGE3OWEwYTc0NTZlMjY0YTNjMDViZDAyNDEwZDA2YzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commit/eee9ac013542eaa236eb53b71f9c580abda50041","sha":"eee9ac013542eaa236eb53b71f9c580abda50041","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/eee9ac013542eaa236eb53b71f9c580abda50041"}],"sha":"ac89cc668a79a0a7456e264a3c05bd02410d06c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/ac89cc668a79a0a7456e264a3c05bd02410d06c5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63979266?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Elesiann","id":63979266,"login":"Elesiann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTc5MjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/eee9ac013542eaa236eb53b71f9c580abda50041/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T15:09:53Z","email":"giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com","name":"Giovani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T15:09:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(vitrine): bump example plugin refs bs_1.48.4 -> bs_1.49.4 (#49)\n\nThree operator-facing (documentation/vitrine) artifacts still pinned\nexample plugin packages at bs_1.48.4 while the rest of the image moved\nto bs_1.49.4. These are not in the boot/includes chain (runtime risk\nnil) but operators copy these snippets:\n\n- dynamic-plugins.default.yaml (10 occurrences: roadie x2, github-actions,\n  azure-devops x2, jenkins x2, sonarqube x2, scaffolder-sonarqube)\n- docs/CONFIGURATION_GUIDE.md (github-actions example)\n- presets/README.md (github-actions example)\n\nThe github-actions workspace was renamed to `github` (per #47), so its\nthree refs become github:bs_1.49.4 (image segment renamed; the\nbackstage-community-plugin-github-actions selector is unchanged). The\nother workspaces keep their names and only the tag is bumped.\n\nEach target ref was verified to resolve against quay.io/veecode via\nskopeo before rewriting; github-actions:bs_1.49.4 does NOT resolve\n(confirming the rename is required), and all six target images\n(github, roadie-backstage-plugins, azure-devops, jenkins, sonarqube,\nscaffolder-backend-module-sonarqube) at bs_1.49.4 resolve.\n\nBoot files (dynamic-plugins.yaml and the includes chain) are untouched.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5cc2d490a36b28d6fa5c06d75b02914d875a4565","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/trees/5cc2d490a36b28d6fa5c06d75b02914d875a4565"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/commits/eee9ac013542eaa236eb53b71f9c580abda50041","verification":{"payload":"tree 5cc2d490a36b28d6fa5c06d75b02914d875a4565\nparent bc18d9d080bd1c5a1a3a2514afe8b56029d941d9\nauthor Giovani <giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com> 1780931393 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780931393 -0300\n\ndocs(vitrine): bump example plugin refs bs_1.48.4 -> bs_1.49.4 (#49)\n\nThree operator-facing (documentation/vitrine) artifacts still pinned\nexample plugin packages at bs_1.48.4 while the rest of the image moved\nto bs_1.49.4. These are not in the boot/includes chain (runtime risk\nnil) but operators copy these snippets:\n\n- dynamic-plugins.default.yaml (10 occurrences: roadie x2, github-actions,\n  azure-devops x2, jenkins x2, sonarqube x2, scaffolder-sonarqube)\n- docs/CONFIGURATION_GUIDE.md (github-actions example)\n- presets/README.md (github-actions example)\n\nThe github-actions workspace was renamed to `github` (per #47), so its\nthree refs become github:bs_1.49.4 (image segment renamed; the\nbackstage-community-plugin-github-actions selector is unchanged). The\nother workspaces keep their names and only the tag is bumped.\n\nEach target ref was verified to resolve against quay.io/veecode via\nskopeo before rewriting; github-actions:bs_1.49.4 does NOT resolve\n(confirming the rename is required), and all six target images\n(github, roadie-backstage-plugins, azure-devops, jenkins, sonarqube,\nscaffolder-backend-module-sonarqube) at bs_1.49.4 resolve.\n\nBoot files (dynamic-plugins.yaml and the includes chain) are untouched.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJttBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAk6UQAGC9fAdVYfMaw1hLCHFjcb4B\nCuB4ouH6TXj7qVDv4tbcr3xELlm2/N/t2xLul38OUIvj71QZwGXpkB61ft6ScelO\nCMm8F0ESdGhOwwZbrv40p4Kj8G5sKpzdZ0zy8ssW5a2bj9jK44873lHUGzDvbdNo\nCnS7Z7zKsmJRcE/MWiY3bJA7ZZ13J