s/Elesiann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/63507c16be2d31d0760424b578ed0dc074a4af72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T15:40:55Z","email":"giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com","name":"Giovani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T15:40:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(plugins): make dynamic-plugins.default.yaml vitrine-only (#46)\n\nRemove dynamic-plugins.default.yaml from the runtime includes chain.\nIt is now documentation only — operators and contributors can browse\navailable plugins there, but the file is never read by the install script.\n\nWhat changed:\n- entrypoint.sh: remove .default.yaml shadow creation and drop it from\n  the hardwired includes chain and substitution loops\n- dynamic-plugins.yaml: add the 6 preInstalled core plugins (homepage,\n  global-header, about, about-backend, dynamic-plugins-info,\n  catalog-backend-module-extensions) with full pluginConfig inline\n- presets: fatten all 9 presets that had frontend plugins — each preset\n  now carries its own pluginConfig (dynamicRoutes, mountPoints, etc.)\n  instead of relying on the shallow merge from .default.yaml\n- .github/workflows/pr-check.yml: OCI ref scan now reads from\n  dynamic-plugins.yaml + presets/ instead of .default.yaml\n- dynamic-plugins.default.yaml: update header to \"DOCUMENTATION ONLY\"\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"505a78ef95b770c75563cb6c3ea5815fe80ec6d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/trees/505a78ef95b770c75563cb6c3ea5815fe80ec6d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/commits/63507c16be2d31d0760424b578ed0dc074a4af72","verification":{"payload":"tree 505a78ef95b770c75563cb6c3ea5815fe80ec6d8\nparent 5bebbd108cb6d4335b3cbbca839615f3a375765b\nauthor Giovani <giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com> 1780501255 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780501255 -0300\n\nrefactor(plugins): make dynamic-plugins.default.yaml vitrine-only (#46)\n\nRemove dynamic-plugins.default.yaml from the runtime includes chain.\nIt is now documentation only — operators and contributors can browse\navailable plugins there, but the file is never read by the install script.\n\nWhat changed:\n- entrypoint.sh: remove .default.yaml shadow creation and drop it from\n  the hardwired includes chain and substitution loops\n- dynamic-plugins.yaml: add the 6 preInstalled core plugins (homepage,\n  global-header, about, about-backend, dynamic-plugins-info,\n  catalog-backend-module-extensions) with full pluginConfig inline\n- presets: fatten all 9 presets that had frontend plugins — each preset\n  now carries its own pluginConfig (dynamicRoutes, mountPoints, etc.)\n  instead of relying on the shallow merge from .default.yaml\n- .github/workflows/pr-check.yml: OCI ref scan now reads from\n  dynamic-plugins.yaml + presets/ instead of .default.yaml\n- dynamic-plugins.default.yaml: update header to \"DOCUMENTATION ONLY\"\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqIEsHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAI6sQAJManXGO1Q297U/blil1+sH8\nd+spixT8fjADfV+1RAkPPw/mp9qw0TWsJX8oQD8e50Zj+JupcPji5jMFrJVCtn0y\nAVtnpYYYfA3KN+HLYL87zWfkCERCjbe+kv2bNrcA6KZ9dk82hL0PbvKwGlPznsVB\nnY4Wwhj9xiZbZbnMeMs3AYTKN2Rrl9QB6biXM/m2wgxBF7nXUcxocro6x4r5UV/Z\nnEI3sOZ+xE4u5wFqD1SwZPHlTD3hGg7UieEXU0OW9ZsC036BE6v1iXIlBKgA2NDG\ntBJpOy+6CNvK9ShEPRUD9XSAAn+yci3a05iZRkGFyJarQGcpw+gCGzlf6DHOfL3T\nxRvNvUTeEABS3qNbkgSVPqpltFOSchat1hFMKvfrnCM8//wGfsXAt6rbTaVzYudP\n2oZrre3jp0028ca/SjJ52AElCzUokl/TagL+ACkGlFPS32JQg3bl/XLsAuUxODoX\nT99zOs4v/Yc0tH1GDSmeSZOU6vEGdN5Yh444vhVCZ30yQQoNt8nhWdYj9uTgYzMh\nQbQIIP/pIiE+CNudfGUF37nOQTDfkwV9NPfq63Gu0u3C5Yyg1/gWCcYAwfbTV3RJ\nhRG7Muyd3dtHHLVS/p5ujg7Urc4zY+QMrVYxVhdyKOA6gepop5GXJS0iPGSzPNwS\n9qeb7ZSDq3L+Ey6mVbi4\n=oFO7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n