/api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/commits/5bebbd108cb6d4335b3cbbca839615f3a375765b","verification":{"payload":"tree bc326434c1541d53183e77e4e7460fe143e433e2\nparent d15adb759aaacad6c5d4afa4ec3c2dbccb8533cf\nauthor Giovani <giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com> 1780347145 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780347145 -0300\n\nchore: clean up rc.1 dry-run + vkdr command guard in E2E (#45)\n\n* Revert \"chore: release 2.0.1-rc.1\"\n\nThis reverts commit d15adb759aaacad6c5d4afa4ec3c2dbccb8533cf.\n\n* chore: clean up rc.1 dry-run + add vkdr command guard to E2E\n\n- Revert the 2.0.1-rc.1 dry-run release commit (package.json back to 2.0.0,\n  drop the test CHANGELOG.md). The dry-run proved the release→publish→E2E chain\n  end-to-end; the artifacts were throwaway.\n- vkdr-install-e2e: fail fast with a clear message if the installed vkdr lacks the\n  `devportal-platform` command (released vkdr predating vkdr#25), instead of the\n  cryptic \"Unmatched arguments\" from the install step.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHfEJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhNcQADTAMccH2kzt7W49eauONBgt\nV1DQCqNzUpdUQiXFm1TZEX62P8y17Y+7g6t8UhfX1Of7x2gzVU9nxzloMdk7CvZu\nH9Edysnvpw8rKn5Qs2cigY8wuqiq8fYW6Xbl/PyJA2/vCJIPp/BYXNyGg1aLOgVl\nlCZpqDkaPX3WHedYF8gapDT3AnuYqxdFX6BlCWv0WSXXjX7hcEONTFTvx0ZR3hUR\nTF7YOHoYDzKhYlTDj9bZ02bSzu1OT/7V+UmcIe9WZ30HrOJYaGPn3lW3EPCY5HHe\nJ4jTp8OOmyFi4K3BQhSQN1t8tkiZ+qbEldl6QHqhyXsBElnhdecFEM8e52AuJHTD\nmC/tB2NoKaJZeh2NW7noyPRAFLiq/GathZ9MUaJ1YajlDa9MnypZpEZG4Nr4KYfZ\nWhLObZL+Pqf5fZ1PCVY3VUsChajZ8GBVG1pgw6LP8VXZH+whiNChjjlb3EcYuy3+\nefff2f4YNpPJC21ZwkbTeMFK8T3O4OD9drecPalPZCOTmT3VT00zJTg43v9UKuQ0\nomSkCMxSWtu7jv+VWxYC/tTXJOjIFlN30PkjLC21pr0sjGq8Q2ABwfHPxAg0wuZW\n9sFjJ5TyMv8OfEQW24P1vENRlwVbghMzxtP9W8kAUGE3IndNrclpR4NVxOjz8Wkc\nxS2luxKSn2gpBOfUAyUU\n=HMA3\n----