938cc5ebbfc821a7b1a2b045b580e1b73579c90"}],"sha":"a9407d23fa8b680e484713def6971f6472baf668","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/a9407d23fa8b680e484713def6971f6472baf668"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63979266?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Elesiann","id":63979266,"login":"Elesiann","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTc5MjY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elesiann","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/commits/5938cc5ebbfc821a7b1a2b045b580e1b73579c90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T12:28:55Z","email":"giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com","name":"Giovani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T12:28:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(smoke): negative regression for preset/var fail-fast (exit 78) (#35)\n\nCloses the Axis 3 (config-explícita/falha-cedo) gap: the happy-path smoke\nfed every required var with dummies, so the fail-fast code path in\nentrypoint.sh was never exercised by CI. A refactor that broke the\npreset/var validation would have shipped silently.\n\nNew `scripts/smoke-presets-negative.sh` boots the image with deliberately\nincomplete env and asserts:\n  1. exit code is exactly 78\n  2. boot exited in ≤15s (fail-fast happens before Backstage starts)\n  3. error message names the missing variable (or the unknown preset)\n\nSix cases: one missing-var per preset family (github, gitlab, keycloak,\nazure, ldap) plus one unknown-preset case. Total runtime ~18s locally.\n\nWired into publish.yml as a new `smoke-negative` job parallel to the\nexisting matrix `smoke` job; both must pass for push-amd64 to proceed.\n\nVerified locally against veecode/devportal:0.1.1 — 6/6 PASS.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3bd25193b60a1607bab3848bdf515ce559f90c6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/trees/3bd25193b60a1607bab3848bdf515ce559f90c6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/veecode-platform/devportal-platform/git/commits/5938cc5ebbfc821a7b1a2b045b580e1b73579c90","verification":{"payload":"tree 3bd25193b60a1607bab3848bdf515ce559f90c6f\nparent 374652058a79e6387fd70e45dde06bcc696fbdd0\nauthor Giovani <giovanimcorrea18@gmail.com> 1779452935 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779452935 -0300\n\ntest(smoke): negative regression for preset/var fail-fast (exit 78) (#35)\n\nCloses the Axis 3 (config-explícita/falha-cedo) gap: the happy-path smoke\nfed every required var with dummies, so the fail-fast code path in\nentrypoint.sh was never exercised by CI. A refactor that broke the\npreset/var validation would have shipped silently.\n\nNew `scripts/smoke-presets-negative.sh` boots the image with deliberately\nincomplete env and asserts:\n  1. exit code is exactly 78\n  2. boot exited in ≤15s (fail-fast happens before Backstage starts)\n  3. error message names the missing variable (or the unknown preset)\n\nSix cases: one missing-var per preset family (github, gitlab, keycloak,\nazure, ldap) plus one unknown-preset case. Total runtime ~18s locally.\n\nWired into publish.yml as a new `smoke-negative` job parallel to the\nexisting matrix `smoke` job; both must pass for push-amd64 to proceed.\n\nVerified locally against veecode/devportal:0.1.1 — 6/6 PASS.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqEEwHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtNYQACl9wt8CrG3Gjgkk0/wdhs/2\nE2igyOid96omyToNbvhaIMY+4S6HtATxEPLzOMy2JGWUz2ui6sKCYntpcqqX0saI\n0BZMQY9VySVfdIP99NPkrKkc7gBn2DOzWt0IEzzl2KLkqzSu7PDIRJTLuEjvYzpm\nTjyKg7CqSRLjfrJ22Ls/L7ufDyBgUcO5A0zesobmHHhmlOxjtqrgS/uAKikM1fzU\nKDuW2fPozzuRNclYVo/odRYfyS66vSIjsvtD7HJKwzE0oRFAc4MMigazpB7jdpfR\nL496XFF8qUIH4pFiH7P4lHjMCy5Ed4bZtKGfzkW1VkbVtppwKFOsQA5INRzf5VOI\nQYbnUlT9y4sj6+b3uKYRQHuIwpqHsCMav++72XTZVL+0SdhP0aGxTNXR54Scfizr\nDhtgYO4mdTjPMW1T9ssqK2AG0CAWcoWe5B2vTWeHnmzhzIsxIHO46aD9j7QXpD5g\n7BrUETwi4c0nEOvyPmAfCc+xNI4eyRwPSzAtIElcv7YO1rx6i7Rs8rmqGz+Db76E\nbqDQi8oyWDH9gCZ3SpTaXXxUs3ImGB17L2G6b5+CuyqU2Qv1dd51KItbVofdEPGK\nqxEMNvjE+d93eOXKqWBuHBruEszsgbQcvwB97bxj3BXrlDMe/t1LVznWy9kI3gNX\nAo+mvZQ/9Ds/hdjpPyK4\n=d7+N\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-22T12:28:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"htt