ent"},"message":"fix(deslop-js): reconcile RN platform-sibling exports in detectDeadExports\n\nTreat React Native platform-variant files (.web/.native/.ios/.android)\nas one logical module when react-native is detected, so an export used\nthrough any sibling variant is no longer flagged as unused. Non-RN\nprojects are unaffected (gated on hasReactNative).\n\nFixes #42\n\nCo-authored-by: Aiden Bai <aidenybai@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f178f3f3e30830d711b28e233c473416b302aba6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/millionco/deslop-js/git/trees/f178f3f3e30830d711b28e233c473416b302aba6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/millionco/deslop-js/git/commits/f5934db8d89fa0cef8a55a8cabd6878f34769599","verification":{"payload":"tree f178f3f3e30830d711b28e233c473416b302aba6\nparent 201cd323dbcb3d539637034dc9c48def84503d51\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1781778086 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1781778086 +0000\n\nfix(deslop-js): reconcile RN platform-sibling exports in detectDeadExports\n\nTreat React Native platform-variant files (.web/.native/.ios/.android)\nas one logical module when react-native is detected, so an export used\nthrough any sibling variant is no longer flagged as unused. Non-RN\nprojects are unaffected (gated on hasReactNative).\n\nFixes #42\n\nCo-authored-by: Aiden Bai <aidenybai@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPBMXcoRhVxd4rOl405iH3rXD+j7my8R0+KXI0CaNLTc55y/eOULSzbFNHsbTHqN5w\niQkrbur5ds7S4va3vOEgQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-18T10:21:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers",