"email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"message":"fix: respect .gitignore when collecting source files\n\nFilter out gitignored files from analysis using `git check-ignore --no-index --stdin -z`.\nFiles matching any .gitignore pattern (including nested ones) are excluded from\nthe dependency graph entirely, preventing false unused-file/unused-export reports.\n\nDegrades gracefully when git is unavailable (returns empty set, no filtering).\n\nCloses millionco/react-doctor#692\n\nCo-Authored-By: Aiden Bai <aiden.bai05@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"59c06872347fb4cf8c7a48cf4d3ec759eedda0c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/millionco/deslop-js/git/trees/59c06872347fb4cf8c7a48cf4d3ec759eedda0c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/millionco/deslop-js/git/commits/44ae1dcda73d258fabb1f28615e4e0845b26dba6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/811515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/devin-ai-integration","id":158243242,"login":"devin-ai-integration[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCW6Zqg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de