bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"message":"ci: add cross-platform matrix (Windows, Linux, macOS) + Node 22/24/26\n\nMirror react-doctor''s CI pattern:\n- Test on ubuntu-latest × Node 22, 24, 26\n- Test on windows-latest × Node 22\n- Test on macos-latest × Node 22\n- fail-fast: false so all matrix cells run\n- Use pnpm/action-setup@v4 consistently\n- Keep lint/typecheck on ubuntu + Node 22 only\n\nCo-Authored-By: Aiden Bai <aiden.bai05@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"afa4fa1df9e63d00675bd710e6350783fd7a72c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/millionco/deslop-js/git/trees/afa4fa1df9e63d00675bd710e6350783fd7a72c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/millionco/deslop-js/git/commits/8960fc2d56bca007eb25e01d879934e33241ced2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/811515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/devin-ai-integration","id":158243242,"login":"devin-ai-integration[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCW6Zqg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/millionco/deslop-js/commit/8960fc2d56bca007eb25e01d879934e33241ced2","node_id":"C_kwDOSc_djdoAKDg5NjBmYzJkNTZiY2EwMDdlYjI1ZTAxZDg3OTkzNGUzMzI0MWNlZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/millionco/deslop-js/commit/d943c019534a49ff0713d275dfa0cc6f1266af6e","sha":"d943c019534a49ff0713d275dfa0cc6f1266af6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/millionco/deslop-js/commits/d943c019534a49ff0713d275dfa0cc6f1266af6e"}],"sha":"8960fc2d56bca007eb25e01d879934e33241ced2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/millionco/deslop-js/commits/8960fc2d56bca007eb25e01d879934e33241ced2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/811515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/devin-ai-integration","id":158243242,"login":"devin-ai-integration[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCW6Zqg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/millionco/deslop-js/commits/d943c019534a49ff0713d275dfa0cc6f1266af6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T10:14:05Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T10:14:05Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"message":"feat: parallelize file parsing with worker threads\n\nPort react-doctor''s bounded concurrency patterns to speed up deslop-js:\n\n- Add mapWithConcurrency utility (greedy load-balancing worker pool)\n- Add worker thread pool for file parsing (parse-worker.ts + parallel-parse.ts)\n- Run collectSourceFiles and resolveEntries in parallel via Promise.all\n- Auto-detect CPU cores via os.availableParallelism(), clamp to [1, 16]\n- Fall back to sequential parsing for <50 files or on worker failure\n- Serialize DeslopError across thread boundary via toJSON/reconstruct\n\nCo-Authored-By: Aiden Bai <aiden.bai05@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"f551e41e2f128d25cb87f529ff5723fe1773dafd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/millionco/deslop-js/git/trees/f551e41e2f128d25cb87f529ff5723fe1773dafd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/millionco/deslop-js/git/commits/d943c019534a49ff0713d275dfa0cc6f1266af6e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/811515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/devin-ai-integration","id":158243242,"login":"devin-ai-integration[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCW6Zqg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/millionco/deslop-js/commit/d943c019534a49ff0713d275dfa0cc6f1266af6e","node_id":"C_kwDOSc_djdoAKGQ5NDNjMDE5NTM0YTQ5ZmYwNzEzZDI3NWRmYTBjYzZmMTI2NmFmNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/millionco/deslop-js/commit/e47ef34aecce48e044c2dcb5b87ba9e93822dcba","sha":"e47ef34aecce48e044c2dcb5b87ba9e93822dcba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/millionco/deslop-js/commits/e47ef34aecce48e044c2dcb5b87ba9e93822dcba"}],"sha":"d943c019534a49ff0713d275dfa0cc6f1266af6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/millionco/deslop-js/commits/d943c019534a49ff0713d275dfa0cc6f1266af6e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39765499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barclayd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barclayd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barclayd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barclayd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/barclayd","id":39765499,"login":"barclayd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NzY1NDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barclayd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barclayd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barclayd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barclayd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barclayd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/barclayd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/millionco/deslop-js/commits/96a23119bcaf6aa36b18ef155991514159bd5c8b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T10:08:32Z","email":"barclaysd@me.com","name":"Dan Barclay"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T10:08:32Z","email":"barclaysd@me.com","name":"Dan Barclay"},"message":"fix(entries): treat Astro live.config as an always-used entry point\n\nAstro loads src/live.config.ts (live content collections) purely by\nfilename convention — no import statement references it anywhere in a\nproject. The Astro framework conventions already mark\nsrc/content.config.* / src/content/config.* as always-used, but not the\nlive collections counterpart, so live.config.ts and every module\nreachable only through it (loaders, schemas, CMS clients) were flagged\nas unused-file.\n\nAdd src/live.config.{js,ts,mjs,mts,cjs,cts} alongside the existing\ncontent config patterns. Astro itself probes live.config.{mjs,js,mts,ts}\n(searchLiveConfig in astro/src/content/utils); the extra cjs/cts\nvariants match the style of the sibling content.config entries.\n\nVerified against a real Astro 6 + WordPress live-collections repo:\nunused-file findings drop from 62 to 16, all 46 cleared files reachable\nonly via live.config.ts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58e79a94a842a24265033c810bf37141641a0941","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/millionco/deslop-js/git/trees/58e79a94a842a24265033c810bf37141641a0941"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/millionco/deslop-js/git/commits/96a23119bcaf6aa36b18ef155991514159bd5c8b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39765499?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barclayd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barclayd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barclayd/following{/other_use